(217213, 12501, 4729, '<td valign="top">Love this! Nice and neatly done.</td>', 'Love this! Nice and neatly done.', '2003-02-17 09:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(217218, 12364, 3972, '<td valign="top">The colour is good and the composition is very well balanced.</td>', 'The colour is good and the composition is very well balanced.', '2003-02-17 09:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(217221, 12421, 5158, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorits this week: extremely crisp, wonderfull colors and texture. I like the composition with its angle of view too. Only the upper portion, especially on the right side could be better: the diffuse black disturbes a little.<br/>Still, due to the freshness and the clear color one of the best: Good Luck to you</td>', 'This is one of my favorits this week: extremely crisp, wonderfull colors and texture. I like the composition with its angle of view too. Only the upper portion, especially on the right side could be better: the diffuse black disturbes a little.Still, due to the freshness and the clear color one of the best: Good Luck to you', '2003-02-17 09:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(217222, 12324, 5158, '<td valign="top">Composition and light are great, frame too. A little greenish IMO. Like the bubbles near the center of the lemon. Good luck.</td>', 'Composition and light are great, frame too. A little greenish IMO. Like the bubbles near the center of the lemon. Good luck.', '2003-02-17 09:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(217224, 12476, 5158, '<td valign="top">Yellow and blue always go well and your submission is a great example for that.<br/>I wonder why you didn''t show us more of this crane? Would have been interesting.</td>', 'Yellow and blue always go well and your submission is a great example for that.I wonder why you didn''t show us more of this crane? Would have been interesting.', '2003-02-17 09:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(217227, 12557, 5158, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I do not get a "fresh morning"-feeling on this flower. Of course there are some water-droplets on it, but one has to look twice to see them. You also might have considered to take away the upper leaf: it looks a little old.<br/>Otherwise I like your submission with the dark background and the variation of the brightness on the flower.</td>', 'To be honest, I do not get a "fresh morning"-feeling on this flower. Of course there are some water-droplets on it, but one has to look twice to see them. You also might have considered to take away the upper leaf: it looks a little old.Otherwise I like your submission with the dark background and the variation of the brightness on the flower.', '2003-02-17 10:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(217231, 12573, 4813, '<td valign="top">my favorite...a 10</td>', 'my favorite...a 10', '2003-02-17 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(217236, 12349, 3447, '<td valign="top">Attractive.  Could use sharper focus on this well arranged subject.</td>', 'Attractive.  Could use sharper focus on this well arranged subject.', '2003-02-17 10:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(217237, 12538, 5793, '<td valign="top">This needs a little more exposure but it is a good idea...the fingernails are a nice touch.</td>', 'This needs a little more exposure but it is a good idea...the fingernails are a nice touch.', '2003-02-17 10:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(217238, 12651, 5793, '<td valign="top">Of all the "lemons" this one is my favorite.</td>', 'Of all the "lemons" this one is my favorite.', '2003-02-17 10:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(217249, 12552, 5793, '<td valign="top">Should make honda aware of this..good job.</td>', 'Should make honda aware of this..good job.', '2003-02-17 10:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(217256, 12618, 6593, '<td valign="top">great color and composition - a winning photo!</td>', 'great color and composition - a winning photo!', '2003-02-17 10:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(217259, 12707, 1569, '<td valign="top">Where''s the yellow???</td>', 'Where''s the yellow???', '2003-02-17 10:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(217260, 12491, 5793, '<td valign="top">I want to see one of these with just a little light on the stem...just my opinion good work.</td>', 'I want to see one of these with just a little light on the stem...just my opinion good work.', '2003-02-17 10:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(217261, 12763, 2780, '<td valign="top">Yellow ones taste like soap. Nice focus on this and good lighting, but I think there needs to be a main focal point. At the moment my eyes are wandering. 7</td>', 'Yellow ones taste like soap. Nice focus on this and good lighting, but I think there needs to be a main focal point. At the moment my eyes are wandering. 7', '2003-02-17 10:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(217270, 12648, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I can''t help wondering what it would look like with the pen-line running into the border, or the border drawn using the pen.</td>', 'I like this, but I can''t help wondering what it would look like with the pen-line running into the border, or the border drawn using the pen.', '2003-02-17 11:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(217272, 12638, 1439, '<td valign="top">too dark, but nice idea :)</td>', 'too dark, but nice idea :)', '2003-02-17 11:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(217274, 12375, 6804, '<td valign="top">Wow this is cleaver. It certainly shows yellow I like that that the main subject is not centered, but I feel like you may have taken him just a bit too far off the page. I think Id like to see the rest of his hand and/or the collar on his shirt.  It just feels a little crowded to me.  But I do like it a lot.</td>', 'Wow this is cleaver. It certainly shows yellow I like that that the main subject is not centered, but I feel like you may have taken him just a bit too far off the page. I think Id like to see the rest of his hand and/or the collar on his shirt.  It just feels a little crowded to me.  But I do like it a lot.', '2003-02-17 11:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(217279, 12413, 4767, '<td valign="top">SUBTLE yellow!  Very nice!  (Would have been a 9 in the perspective category last week as far as I''m concerned!)   <br/>Encore je me souviens...</td>', 'SUBTLE yellow!  Very nice!  (Would have been a 9 in the perspective category last week as far as I''m concerned!)   Encore je me souviens...', '2003-02-17 11:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(217280, 12501, 6804, '<td valign="top">This looks like a promo shot. Its very well done. One tiny irritant is the shadow in the upper left being cast into the picture. The shape and direction of the shadow make me wonder whats up there.</td>', 'This looks like a promo shot. Its very well done. One tiny irritant is the shadow in the upper left being cast into the picture. The shape and direction of the shadow make me wonder whats up there.', '2003-02-17 11:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(217281, 12705, 6370, '<td valign="top">blurry and out of focus.  a run through with unsharp mask could have helped this some.</td>', 'blurry and out of focus.  a run through with unsharp mask could have helped this some.', '2003-02-17 11:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(217282, 12366, 6593, '<td valign="top">Good color, composition, and perspective.</td>', 'Good color, composition, and perspective.', '2003-02-17 11:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(217283, 12408, 6370, '<td valign="top">crisp, clear shot.  I like this quite a bit.  Maybe I''m just a sucker for a macro shot? :)  The glare off the cellophane is a bit distracting but I doubt it could have helped - not if I had been doing it, that''s for sure.</td>', 'crisp, clear shot.  I like this quite a bit.  Maybe I''m just a sucker for a macro shot? :)  The glare off the cellophane is a bit distracting but I doubt it could have helped - not if I had been doing it, that''s for sure.', '2003-02-17 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(217284, 12539, 6370, '<td valign="top">very nice macro shot.  the lighting here is quite nice.</td>', 'very nice macro shot.  the lighting here is quite nice.', '2003-02-17 11:28:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(217285, 12562, 6370, '<td valign="top">nice closeup of the cat.  Was unsharp mask run across this photo?  The black subject on darker background makes it a touch difficult to see the fine fine details (ie. the whiskers).</td>', 'nice closeup of the cat.  Was unsharp mask run across this photo?  The black subject on darker background makes it a touch difficult to see the fine fine details (ie. the whiskers).', '2003-02-17 11:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(217287, 12605, 6370, '<td valign="top">this photo looks strangely familiar.  :)  the glare from the lighting against the wall is a little distracting, but not overly.</td>', 'this photo looks strangely familiar.  :)  the glare from the lighting against the wall is a little distracting, but not overly.', '2003-02-17 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(217288, 12734, 6370, '<td valign="top">great action shot.</td>', 'great action shot.', '2003-02-17 11:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(217289, 12582, 4767, '<td valign="top">A lovely muted yellow!  Good tonality.  Not Edward Weston''s peppers, but VERY nocely done!</td>', 'A lovely muted yellow!  Good tonality.  Not Edward Weston''s peppers, but VERY nocely done!', '2003-02-17 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(217292, 12321, 4767, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t get the ''perspective'' thing out of your mind, or did it inspire you?  It does inspire me....</td>', 'Couldn''t get the ''perspective'' thing out of your mind, or did it inspire you?  It does inspire me....', '2003-02-17 11:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(217293, 12721, 6230, '<td valign="top">Colours can be a little brighter for more impact</td>', 'Colours can be a little brighter for more impact', '2003-02-17 11:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(217295, 12635, 6230, '<td valign="top">Subject is not very sharp. A little more DOF may help.</td>', 'Subject is not very sharp. A little more DOF may help.', '2003-02-17 11:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(217296, 12492, 4767, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2003-02-17 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(217299, 12473, 4767, '<td valign="top">Wish I could rate it higher.  I LOVE the concept, the yellow is fine, but it disturbs me to see the Great Yellow Father''s logo out of focus.  If it was intentional, I do apologise.</td>', 'Wish I could rate it higher.  I LOVE the concept, the yellow is fine, but it disturbs me to see the Great Yellow Father''s logo out of focus.  If it was intentional, I do apologise.', '2003-02-17 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(217300, 12492, 6230, '<td valign="top">Too much reflections on the subject, otherwise good take.</td>', 'Too much reflections on the subject, otherwise good take.', '2003-02-17 11:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(217302, 12554, 4767, '<td valign="top">The title makes the photo at least 1 and a half points higher!</td>', 'The title makes the photo at least 1 and a half points higher!', '2003-02-17 11:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(217303, 12694, 4767, '<td valign="top">Unique, nice... (You have a dragonfly named Icarus?)</td>', 'Unique, nice... (You have a dragonfly named Icarus?)', '2003-02-17 11:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(217304, 12552, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is so clean and bright I like it, but I can''t tell what it is. Honda.... motorcycle? I think I''d like to see more of it. One distraction to me is what looks like a broken pinstripe within the border on the top and left sides. It seems to follow the image to some degree, but I don''t see it on the bottom or the right side??? I''m not sure if it was intentional. I do like this picture alot it is one of the best.</td>', 'This is so clean and bright I like it, but I can''t tell what it is. Honda.... motorcycle? I think I''d like to see more of it. One distraction to me is what looks like a broken pinstripe within the border on the top and left sides. It seems to follow the image to some degree, but I don''t see it on the bottom or the right side??? I''m not sure if it was intentional. I do like this picture alot it is one of the best.', '2003-02-17 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(217305, 12490, 4767, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting!  (Or the best choice of blossom in the batch!)  Any post processing here?</td>', 'Amazing lighting!  (Or the best choice of blossom in the batch!)  Any post processing here?', '2003-02-17 11:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(217308, 12611, 917, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more or less of the cropped bit on the left. The space on the right is dead, I''d crop that out.  The bright spots on the horizon are distracting, I''d crop the top odd this pic. or try and get more in to make this a landscape with foreground interest. The main subject is OK, but a bit uninteresting. There are better times of day to be shooting this sort of pic, it looks a bit dull, but without the warmth of the evening sun.</td>', 'Needs a bit more or less of the cropped bit on the left. The space on the right is dead, I''d crop that out.  The bright spots on the horizon are distracting, I''d crop the top odd this pic. or try and get more in to make this a landscape with foreground interest. The main subject is OK, but a bit uninteresting. There are better times of day to be shooting this sort of pic, it looks a bit dull, but without the warmth of the evening sun.', '2003-02-17 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(217310, 12719, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture.  I''d love to see your outtakes...</td>', 'Interesting capture.  I''d love to see your outtakes...', '2003-02-17 11:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(217312, 12414, 917, '<td valign="top">Its a good photo, but that bee is in a very un-natural position. As its a dead bee (probably), perhaps you could have turned it to face the camera.<br/> Im not voting this week but Id give it a 7 normally.</td>', 'Its a good photo, but that bee is in a very un-natural position. As its a dead bee (probably), perhaps you could have turned it to face the camera. Im not voting this week but Id give it a 7 normally.', '2003-02-17 11:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(217313, 12390, 6230, '<td valign="top">Clown''s face is out of focus.</td>', 'Clown''s face is out of focus.', '2003-02-17 11:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(217314, 12733, 4767, '<td valign="top">GREAT tree, GREAT light, AMAZING photo!  and a tiny bit of yellow....</td>', 'GREAT tree, GREAT light, AMAZING photo!  and a tiny bit of yellow....', '2003-02-17 11:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(217318, 12350, 4767, '<td valign="top">Son of Chitty-Chitty Bang-Bang?</td>', 'Son of Chitty-Chitty Bang-Bang?', '2003-02-17 11:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(217321, 12652, 6740, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2003-02-17 12:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(217324, 12557, 6804, '<td valign="top">I like the focus fade to the background on this. A dash more contrast might help you hide the flaws in the bottom right background and might add a little snap to the flower too.</td>', 'I like the focus fade to the background on this. A dash more contrast might help you hide the flaws in the bottom right background and might add a little snap to the flower too.', '2003-02-17 12:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(217325, 12761, 2123, '<td valign="top">peTal. :-D<br/>That said, it''s a very nice shot. 7</td>', 'peTal. :-DThat said, it''s a very nice shot. 7', '2003-02-17 12:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(217326, 12525, 2123, '<td valign="top">A great example of what a border should do. :-)  A simple, striking shot. 8</td>', 'A great example of what a border should do. :-)  A simple, striking shot. 8', '2003-02-17 12:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
