(217330, 12609, 2123, '<td valign="top">KernEls. :-)  <br/>I like the diagonal of the ear of corn, I think it might have been a bit more effective to have the focus on the kernels, rather than the silk, though.  Nice job.</td>', 'KernEls. :-)  I like the diagonal of the ear of corn, I think it might have been a bit more effective to have the focus on the kernels, rather than the silk, though.  Nice job.', '2003-02-17 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
