(217609, 12552, 1796, '<td valign="top">total symmetry would have made this even better. Also, the highlights on the left are a bit distracting. really like it.</td>', 'total symmetry would have made this even better. Also, the highlights on the left are a bit distracting. really like it.', '2003-02-17 16:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
