(217664, 12637, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  I like the yellow against this color background.  I also like the shadows that are created by the bananas.  I found this funny also.  Thanks for giving me a chuckle.  :-)</td>', 'Very clever.  I like the yellow against this color background.  I also like the shadows that are created by the bananas.  I found this funny also.  Thanks for giving me a chuckle.  :-)', '2003-02-17 17:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
