(217681, 12552, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this, but am a bit distracted by the white reflection near the bottom left corner.</td>', 'I love the composition of this, but am a bit distracted by the white reflection near the bottom left corner.', '2003-02-17 17:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(217683, 12384, 1569, '<td valign="top">B  E  E  R ! ! ! Good one!!</td>', 'B  E  E  R ! ! ! Good one!!', '2003-02-17 17:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(217686, 12491, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked to see just a little more light on the stem.</td>', 'I''d have liked to see just a little more light on the stem.', '2003-02-17 17:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(217687, 12584, 1647, '<td valign="top">A classic shot (on this site at least) with a very different crop.  Personally I would have went for a more traditional crop - I find the top of the droplet missing to be frustrating.  Other than that though your focus is very good and the yellow is... well... very yellow.  Well done.</td>', 'A classic shot (on this site at least) with a very different crop.  Personally I would have went for a more traditional crop - I find the top of the droplet missing to be frustrating.  Other than that though your focus is very good and the yellow is... well... very yellow.  Well done.', '2003-02-17 17:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(217688, 12692, 1647, '<td valign="top">Your framing is quite good, however I find the image uncomfortable to look at.  Perhaps the whitish areas could have been dulled down a bit.</td>', 'Your framing is quite good, however I find the image uncomfortable to look at.  Perhaps the whitish areas could have been dulled down a bit.', '2003-02-17 17:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(217689, 12702, 1647, '<td valign="top">What a hot rod.  It''s definitely yellow and your shot is technically pretty good.  It''s a shame you couldn''t include mroe of the car though.</td>', 'What a hot rod.  It''s definitely yellow and your shot is technically pretty good.  It''s a shame you couldn''t include mroe of the car though.', '2003-02-17 17:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(217690, 12391, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very interesting piece.  This begs to be explained!  The how it''s done might just be as interesting as the photo itself.  While I like it very much, some parts give me the feeling of spot editting, but I cannot be certain (the face in front seems to be covering the faces behind as an overlay, but really I cannot say with any degree of certainty.  Would you be adverse to a PM conversation?  (Please???)  <br/>9 Swashbuckler</td>', 'Very interesting piece.  This begs to be explained!  The how it''s done might just be as interesting as the photo itself.  While I like it very much, some parts give me the feeling of spot editting, but I cannot be certain (the face in front seems to be covering the faces behind as an overlay, but really I cannot say with any degree of certainty.  Would you be adverse to a PM conversation?  (Please???)  9 Swashbuckler', '2003-02-17 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(217691, 12713, 1647, '<td valign="top">As a snapshot this is fine, although it''s perhaps a little too convential for the challenge.  Also, the dust infront of the child makes the photo look blurred.  Perhaps you could have taken the photo from closer to the ground - to bring the viewer into the childs world, rather than simply observing from above.</td>', 'As a snapshot this is fine, although it''s perhaps a little too convential for the challenge.  Also, the dust infront of the child makes the photo look blurred.  Perhaps you could have taken the photo from closer to the ground - to bring the viewer into the childs world, rather than simply observing from above.', '2003-02-17 17:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(217692, 12627, 1647, '<td valign="top">The flyscreen (mesh) really creates a mosaic effect.  This turns an otherwise "regular" photo into an interesting photo.</td>', 'The flyscreen (mesh) really creates a mosaic effect.  This turns an otherwise "regular" photo into an interesting photo.', '2003-02-17 17:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(217694, 12720, 2158, '<td valign="top">I think a plain background would have worked better.</td>', 'I think a plain background would have worked better.', '2003-02-17 17:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(217695, 12590, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot..I like it.</td>', 'Interesting shot..I like it.', '2003-02-17 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 1);
