(217702, 12634, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of the phone book - it''s very natural and realistic.  In some ways it''s a shame that there is some blue in the top left corner but it''s not a big issue.  I wonder if you are featured somewhere on this page?</td>', 'I like the lighting of the phone book - it''s very natural and realistic.  In some ways it''s a shame that there is some blue in the top left corner but it''s not a big issue.  I wonder if you are featured somewhere on this page?', '2003-02-17 18:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
