(217773, 12386, 3102, '<td valign="top">The best of its class in this challenge -- you did an awesome job of following the cap during the exposure of this one!  Well done!  The only thing keeping it from being a 10 is that it seems like it would have been slightly stronger to have included the full back end of the car, rather than cropping that tiny bit out.</td>', 'The best of its class in this challenge -- you did an awesome job of following the cap during the exposure of this one!  Well done!  The only thing keeping it from being a 10 is that it seems like it would have been slightly stronger to have included the full back end of the car, rather than cropping that tiny bit out.', '2003-02-17 18:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
