(217876, 12416, 3102, '<td valign="top">The "Yellow Gate Bridge...?"  Hmmm...<br/> <br/>This kind of shot definitely requires a tripod, I''m afraid.  This would have been a cool shot had it been held steadily.</td>', 'The "Yellow Gate Bridge...?"  Hmmm... This kind of shot definitely requires a tripod, I''m afraid.  This would have been a cool shot had it been held steadily.', '2003-02-17 19:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(217879, 12478, 1647, '<td valign="top">Your focus in this shot is really good.  It''s an interesting shot with several distinct textures / surfaces to look at.  Good work</td>', 'Your focus in this shot is really good.  It''s an interesting shot with several distinct textures / surfaces to look at.  Good work', '2003-02-17 19:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(217880, 12723, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think the white of the ground is a little too bright - perhaps overexposed.  I think it''s cropped perhaps a little too tightly - I prefer to see the edges of the person rather than them being just slightly cropped.  This would include both hands and streamers, and to a lesser degree her dress.  Other than that the photo is very nice.</td>', 'I think the white of the ground is a little too bright - perhaps overexposed.  I think it''s cropped perhaps a little too tightly - I prefer to see the edges of the person rather than them being just slightly cropped.  This would include both hands and streamers, and to a lesser degree her dress.  Other than that the photo is very nice.', '2003-02-17 19:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(217881, 12384, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - I like the variation in bubble sizes and the rings inside each bubble.  I also like the way the light fades in the corners.</td>', 'Nice work - I like the variation in bubble sizes and the rings inside each bubble.  I also like the way the light fades in the corners.', '2003-02-17 19:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(217883, 12417, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s yellow, but not terribly interesting.  Focus is good and composition is ok.  The white spot on the surface infront of the case is a shame.</td>', 'It''s yellow, but not terribly interesting.  Focus is good and composition is ok.  The white spot on the surface infront of the case is a shame.', '2003-02-17 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(217884, 12665, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of a boring subject.  Not much to it.  And the lighting is too dark I think.  What might have been better is a big bright yellow candle on the black background with soft light to expose the entire thing.</td>', 'It''s kind of a boring subject.  Not much to it.  And the lighting is too dark I think.  What might have been better is a big bright yellow candle on the black background with soft light to expose the entire thing.', '2003-02-17 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(217888, 12656, 6458, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition, the yellow offsets the white of the snow and the dark of the tree - however it is partially dulled by it as well..</td>', 'I really like this composition, the yellow offsets the white of the snow and the dark of the tree - however it is partially dulled by it as well..', '2003-02-17 20:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(217890, 12711, 6458, '<td valign="top">Good concept - more contrast between the balls and the background would have made it better. Also - the last ball is out of focus which is a distraction for me.</td>', 'Good concept - more contrast between the balls and the background would have made it better. Also - the last ball is out of focus which is a distraction for me.', '2003-02-17 20:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(217891, 12572, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot.  The flower head looks a tiny bit blurry - bit nothing major.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot.  The flower head looks a tiny bit blurry - bit nothing major.', '2003-02-17 20:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(217892, 12390, 1647, '<td valign="top">The clown is a bit out of focus and the lighting looks too harsh (especially the reflection in his head).  Other than that it''s a good shot - nice composition.  I don''t quite get why the bottle and clown are in the one shot (perhaps I shoud recognise the title).</td>', 'The clown is a bit out of focus and the lighting looks too harsh (especially the reflection in his head).  Other than that it''s a good shot - nice composition.  I don''t quite get why the bottle and clown are in the one shot (perhaps I shoud recognise the title).', '2003-02-17 20:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(217893, 12638, 6458, '<td valign="top">I think the border really detracts from the image, it''s too bright for the yellow of the custard. More light on the custard would have higlighted the yellowness, I think.</td>', 'I think the border really detracts from the image, it''s too bright for the yellow of the custard. More light on the custard would have higlighted the yellowness, I think.', '2003-02-17 20:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(217894, 12682, 1647, '<td valign="top">I suspect the image may have been recoloured which makes your question very difficult to answer.  The shot is ok, but doesn''t hold my attention - it''s just a close up of some unknown object.</td>', 'I suspect the image may have been recoloured which makes your question very difficult to answer.  The shot is ok, but doesn''t hold my attention - it''s just a close up of some unknown object.', '2003-02-17 20:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(217895, 12473, 1647, '<td valign="top">Why the blurred text?  Is this deliberate or a defect/limitation of the camera.  The composition is ok, however there is a little bit of black on the leftmost top edge which I would have cropped out.</td>', 'Why the blurred text?  Is this deliberate or a defect/limitation of the camera.  The composition is ok, however there is a little bit of black on the leftmost top edge which I would have cropped out.', '2003-02-17 20:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(217897, 12637, 1647, '<td valign="top">This is actually an ok photo - a little bit different and interesting.  I would have definitely removed the sticker from the banana though.  The perspective of the pavers adds an interesting element to the photo.</td>', 'This is actually an ok photo - a little bit different and interesting.  I would have definitely removed the sticker from the banana though.  The perspective of the pavers adds an interesting element to the photo.', '2003-02-17 20:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(217898, 12693, 1647, '<td valign="top">There is plenty of contrast and your decision to light the mug from behind - and make it glow - was definitely a good one.  I might have left a little more whitespace above the mug (ie: cropped less at the top).</td>', 'There is plenty of contrast and your decision to light the mug from behind - and make it glow - was definitely a good one.  I might have left a little more whitespace above the mug (ie: cropped less at the top).', '2003-02-17 20:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(217899, 12386, 6458, '<td valign="top">The sense of motion really makes this picture... At first I thought the border detracted but I have since changed my mind. It serves to ground the car body in place, making it look like the world is moving. 9!</td>', 'The sense of motion really makes this picture... At first I thought the border detracted but I have since changed my mind. It serves to ground the car body in place, making it look like the world is moving. 9!', '2003-02-17 20:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(217900, 12686, 6458, '<td valign="top">wow. very good composition. The lighting and the negative space work well together to create a striking effect.</td>', 'wow. very good composition. The lighting and the negative space work well together to create a striking effect.', '2003-02-17 20:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(217901, 12719, 6458, '<td valign="top">Original, eye catching -- the hints of yellow leave me wanting more, so I keep hunting.</td>', 'Original, eye catching -- the hints of yellow leave me wanting more, so I keep hunting.', '2003-02-17 20:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(217902, 12554, 6458, '<td valign="top">Grime, emotive subject.. some might not like it. Me.... I''m on the fence.</td>', 'Grime, emotive subject.. some might not like it. Me.... I''m on the fence.', '2003-02-17 20:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(217904, 12377, 6458, '<td valign="top">Seems washed out.. Instead of zesty, this seems bland. More contrast would have highlighted the difference in shades between the egg yolk and the lemon.</td>', 'Seems washed out.. Instead of zesty, this seems bland. More contrast would have highlighted the difference in shades between the egg yolk and the lemon.', '2003-02-17 20:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(217905, 12564, 6458, '<td valign="top">I''d recognize that sight anywhere! It''s a full English breakfast! Not sure about the composition tho..</td>', 'I''d recognize that sight anywhere! It''s a full English breakfast! Not sure about the composition tho..', '2003-02-17 20:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(217906, 12365, 6702, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh...and my wife roll her eyes.</td>', 'This made me laugh...and my wife roll her eyes.', '2003-02-17 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(217908, 12377, 6702, '<td valign="top">Great color, sharpness,  contrast, white space. The thought of eating was the only negative aspect of this picture.</td>', 'Great color, sharpness,  contrast, white space. The thought of eating was the only negative aspect of this picture.', '2003-02-17 20:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(217909, 12687, 6458, '<td valign="top">Love it! Good composition, good lighting. The contrast between the edge of the glass and the negative space is lovely - it makes the picture so much more interesting!</td>', 'Love it! Good composition, good lighting. The contrast between the edge of the glass and the negative space is lovely - it makes the picture so much more interesting!', '2003-02-17 20:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(217910, 12427, 6702, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. The blue stones against the white and yellow lemon is great. The white color of the inside of the fruit doesn''t look natural though. The black background is pretty harsh. I wonder how blue would have looked.</td>', 'Nice lighting. The blue stones against the white and yellow lemon is great. The white color of the inside of the fruit doesn''t look natural though. The black background is pretty harsh. I wonder how blue would have looked.', '2003-02-17 20:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(217911, 12644, 616, '<td valign="top">hahahaha, nice capture! Great subject! It''s nice to see someone who has a good sense of humor in one of those sour protests.</td>', 'hahahaha, nice capture! Great subject! It''s nice to see someone who has a good sense of humor in one of those sour protests.', '2003-02-17 20:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(217912, 12413, 6110, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and you''ve handled a challenging dynamic range very well.  I wish there was a bit more yellow in it.</td>', 'I like the composition and you''ve handled a challenging dynamic range very well.  I wish there was a bit more yellow in it.', '2003-02-17 20:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(217914, 12349, 616, '<td valign="top">whoa! Great idea!</td>', 'whoa! Great idea!', '2003-02-17 20:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(217915, 12609, 6110, '<td valign="top">Good composition</td>', 'Good composition', '2003-02-17 20:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(217916, 12372, 6702, '<td valign="top">This is a tough situation. You have the bright back light and dark objects to the right. Next time try less exposure (faster shutter, lower ISO, or smaller aperture) and more lighting from this side (somtimes even a simple fill flash will do the trick).  There is also a lot going on in the frame. If one didn''t know the challenge theme, the subject would not be obvious.</td>', 'This is a tough situation. You have the bright back light and dark objects to the right. Next time try less exposure (faster shutter, lower ISO, or smaller aperture) and more lighting from this side (somtimes even a simple fill flash will do the trick).  There is also a lot going on in the frame. If one didn''t know the challenge theme, the subject would not be obvious.', '2003-02-17 20:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(217917, 12718, 6110, '<td valign="top">Good work preserving he details in the petals.  IMO the photo would be more effective if it didn''t overflow the frame.</td>', 'Good work preserving he details in the petals.  IMO the photo would be more effective if it didn''t overflow the frame.', '2003-02-17 20:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(217918, 12555, 6110, '<td valign="top">Very "artsy" (and dare I say "eye catching" :-)).  Would like to know how you did this.</td>', 'Very "artsy" (and dare I say "eye catching" :-)).  Would like to know how you did this.', '2003-02-17 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(217919, 12494, 6110, '<td valign="top">Nice work with the lighting.</td>', 'Nice work with the lighting.', '2003-02-17 20:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(217922, 12610, 6110, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the things we do for a photo... :-)</td>', 'Ahh, the things we do for a photo... :-)', '2003-02-17 21:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(217924, 12763, 6110, '<td valign="top">Was thinking of doing something like this myself.  DOF is a little shallow and the bright spots detract a bit.  But an effective &amp; enjoyable photo.</td>', 'Was thinking of doing something like this myself.  DOF is a little shallow and the bright spots detract a bit.  But an effective & enjoyable photo.', '2003-02-17 21:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(217926, 12719, 6110, '<td valign="top">Good composition &amp; interesting subject.</td>', 'Good composition & interesting subject.', '2003-02-17 21:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(217927, 12610, 6702, '<td valign="top">I like it. Wish the focus was a little sharper. Nice idea.</td>', 'I like it. Wish the focus was a little sharper. Nice idea.', '2003-02-17 21:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(217928, 12614, 6110, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit distracting, but a good photo nonetheless.</td>', 'The background is a bit distracting, but a good photo nonetheless.', '2003-02-17 21:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(217929, 12501, 616, '<td valign="top">ncely done. I like your composition here. It''s simple so that there isn''t anything distracting in view, while it is still appealing to the eye. Your white background is also nice and flawless, I would like to know what you used.</td>', 'ncely done. I like your composition here. It''s simple so that there isn''t anything distracting in view, while it is still appealing to the eye. Your white background is also nice and flawless, I would like to know what you used.', '2003-02-17 21:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(217930, 12597, 616, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but the first time I saw this it made me smile. There isn''t anything here I would change, other than the background. It seems bit distracting from your cute little duck. Maybe a more solid black background would have worked better here, but that''s just my 2 cents.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but the first time I saw this it made me smile. There isn''t anything here I would change, other than the background. It seems bit distracting from your cute little duck. Maybe a more solid black background would have worked better here, but that''s just my 2 cents.', '2003-02-17 21:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(217933, 12391, 616, '<td valign="top">Awesome, I really like the ghost-like feeling that these figures give off.</td>', 'Awesome, I really like the ghost-like feeling that these figures give off.', '2003-02-17 21:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(217934, 12618, 6702, '<td valign="top">Creative. I like it.</td>', 'Creative. I like it.', '2003-02-17 21:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(217935, 12611, 1569, '<td valign="top">If you can --getting closer would have eliminated most of the background which is distracting.It keeps taking your attention away from the flowers in the fore ground.</td>', 'If you can --getting closer would have eliminated most of the background which is distracting.It keeps taking your attention away from the flowers in the fore ground.', '2003-02-17 21:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(217936, 12369, 616, '<td valign="top">Very awesome. The compostition is nicely executed. I''ve always liked the disorted look that water gives objects through a glass and you have used it very nicely here.</td>', 'Very awesome. The compostition is nicely executed. I''ve always liked the disorted look that water gives objects through a glass and you have used it very nicely here.', '2003-02-17 21:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(217937, 12733, 6014, '<td valign="top">i cant see any colour yellow....</td>', 'i cant see any colour yellow....', '2003-02-17 21:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(217939, 12374, 1569, '<td valign="top">Difusing the lighting on the right side would have helped with the blown out highlights on the bananna skin.</td>', 'Difusing the lighting on the right side would have helped with the blown out highlights on the bananna skin.', '2003-02-17 21:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
