(218217, 12605, 4049, '<td valign="top">The only thing I would like to see improved is the bit of cloth on the left side that''s bunched up, would be nice if it was just solid black.</td>', 'The only thing I would like to see improved is the bit of cloth on the left side that''s bunched up, would be nice if it was just solid black.', '2003-02-17 23:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
