(218220, 12668, 4049, '<td valign="top">Cute! the blue background works perfectly to bring out the yellow too.</td>', 'Cute! the blue background works perfectly to bring out the yellow too.', '2003-02-17 23:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(218229, 12730, 6182, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I really enjoy the perspective...much more fun than the other tape measure shot in the challenge.  Nice setting. Nice light.  Could use a bit more depth of field but other than that a really great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!  I really enjoy the perspective...much more fun than the other tape measure shot in the challenge.  Nice setting. Nice light.  Could use a bit more depth of field but other than that a really great shot!', '2003-02-17 23:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(218230, 12747, 6182, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here and enjoy the shot but I think I would like to see the playground equipment more close up....I don''t feel like the building in the background adds to the image.</td>', 'I like the idea here and enjoy the shot but I think I would like to see the playground equipment more close up....I don''t feel like the building in the background adds to the image.', '2003-02-17 23:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(218233, 12323, 6182, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but the halo effect you got really detracts...is that from oversharpening in photo shop?  Nicely cropped and framed.</td>', 'Interesting idea but the halo effect you got really detracts...is that from oversharpening in photo shop?  Nicely cropped and framed.', '2003-02-17 23:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(218237, 12701, 6182, '<td valign="top">One of the few cat shots in this challenge that I really appreciate. I like the way you cropped the kitties face.  Could have been really great if you had gotten a more symmetrical shot.</td>', 'One of the few cat shots in this challenge that I really appreciate. I like the way you cropped the kitties face.  Could have been really great if you had gotten a more symmetrical shot.', '2003-02-17 23:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(218240, 12724, 6182, '<td valign="top">Really interesting image.  This was really refreshing after looking at all the lemon and flower shots!   Thanks!!!  More focus is all this needs to be a real winner!    Maybe a little less sky at the top?</td>', 'Really interesting image.  This was really refreshing after looking at all the lemon and flower shots!   Thanks!!!  More focus is all this needs to be a real winner!    Maybe a little less sky at the top?', '2003-02-17 23:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(218242, 12682, 4648, '<td valign="top">That''s my question exactly.  But what ever it is, it is yellow, and it is decently photographyed.  Will admit, it''s not exciting.  Does the rest of it make it exciting?  Will have to give you credit for yellow.</td>', 'That''s my question exactly.  But what ever it is, it is yellow, and it is decently photographyed.  Will admit, it''s not exciting.  Does the rest of it make it exciting?  Will have to give you credit for yellow.', '2003-02-17 23:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(218243, 12366, 6182, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen such a yellow kiwi but I really like this shot...it is so luminous.    It''s interesting because it doesn''t really "say" fruit...it doesn''t look juicy at all in fact it looks rather dry but that lack of juiciness doesn''t detract from the image at all to me.   I think it deserves a wider frame...the shape of the seeds draw my eyes out and I think a wider black frame would draw my eyes back in.</td>', 'I''ve never seen such a yellow kiwi but I really like this shot...it is so luminous.    It''s interesting because it doesn''t really "say" fruit...it doesn''t look juicy at all in fact it looks rather dry but that lack of juiciness doesn''t detract from the image at all to me.   I think it deserves a wider frame...the shape of the seeds draw my eyes out and I think a wider black frame would draw my eyes back in.', '2003-02-17 23:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(218244, 12571, 4267, '<td valign="top">great snapshot!</td>', 'great snapshot!', '2003-02-17 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(218245, 12741, 4267, '<td valign="top">i like the cap being out of focus here.. works well... playing with hue to get the color more yellow than gold would have been cool too... good lighting...</td>', 'i like the cap being out of focus here.. works well... playing with hue to get the color more yellow than gold would have been cool too... good lighting...', '2003-02-17 23:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(218247, 12531, 4267, '<td valign="top">nothing to focus on here... needs to be a wider shot</td>', 'nothing to focus on here... needs to be a wider shot', '2003-02-17 23:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(218248, 12572, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful photo and very unique.  The composition is fantastic.  Love the texture of the rocks.  This looks like we are there in person.  Needless to say it is a 10.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful photo and very unique.  The composition is fantastic.  Love the texture of the rocks.  This looks like we are there in person.  Needless to say it is a 10.', '2003-02-17 23:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(218250, 12538, 4267, '<td valign="top">nice color but needs to be sharper... would be really cool with all the color except yellow desaturated so the only color in the shot was yellow... everything else would be black and white</td>', 'nice color but needs to be sharper... would be really cool with all the color except yellow desaturated so the only color in the shot was yellow... everything else would be black and white', '2003-02-17 23:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(218251, 12584, 4267, '<td valign="top">good stop motion, but I''d like a wider shot of the splash and a crop of the bottom of the photo</td>', 'good stop motion, but I''d like a wider shot of the splash and a crop of the bottom of the photo', '2003-02-17 23:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(218252, 12377, 6182, '<td valign="top">At first I hated this...I thought it was really gross but after looking at all the other lemon shots, I liked this for the originality involved.  Now I find it rather humorous.  I''m not crazy about the reflection in the yolk but other than that this is a really well executed shot.  I don''t like the framing choice but I can''t think of a better option right now...Maybe some color.  I think I''d try a complimentary color...blue or perhaps a blue violet frame.</td>', 'At first I hated this...I thought it was really gross but after looking at all the other lemon shots, I liked this for the originality involved.  Now I find it rather humorous.  I''m not crazy about the reflection in the yolk but other than that this is a really well executed shot.  I don''t like the framing choice but I can''t think of a better option right now...Maybe some color.  I think I''d try a complimentary color...blue or perhaps a blue violet frame.', '2003-02-17 23:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(218253, 12730, 4267, '<td valign="top">great dof and lighting... just not the most interesting of subjects</td>', 'great dof and lighting... just not the most interesting of subjects', '2003-02-17 23:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(218254, 12525, 4267, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and lighting. might be oversharpened a bit... plus the left needs a little crop... nice effort though</td>', 'I like the contrast and lighting. might be oversharpened a bit... plus the left needs a little crop... nice effort though', '2003-02-17 23:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(218255, 12647, 4267, '<td valign="top">good DoF and focus... nice light and color, just kinda boring</td>', 'good DoF and focus... nice light and color, just kinda boring', '2003-02-17 23:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(218256, 12755, 4648, '<td valign="top">Wish I totally understood how to do this to get this clear of black and white and then a different color.  My color fades too much.  This is really well done.  Not an overly exciting photo, but you sure nailed the yellow part of the challenge.  Good job.  Wish the nuckles on the left hand had been in as good of focus as the rest of the composition.  Still a nice job.</td>', 'Wish I totally understood how to do this to get this clear of black and white and then a different color.  My color fades too much.  This is really well done.  Not an overly exciting photo, but you sure nailed the yellow part of the challenge.  Good job.  Wish the nuckles on the left hand had been in as good of focus as the rest of the composition.  Still a nice job.', '2003-02-17 23:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(218258, 12316, 4267, '<td valign="top">great shot, but I don''t think the yellow is dominant enough for this theme...  maybe if it was a night so the blue was gone and the yellow lights were the dominant color</td>', 'great shot, but I don''t think the yellow is dominant enough for this theme...  maybe if it was a night so the blue was gone and the yellow lights were the dominant color', '2003-02-17 23:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
