(218260, 12571, 6182, '<td valign="top">Very adorable child.  Nice, refreshing subject!   I know that some people in this challenge think that the photoshop manipulation with desaturating all other colors is overdone but I think it''s really fun and think that this would be a great photo to try like that with the sled color being yellow, everything else b/w.</td>', 'Very adorable child.  Nice, refreshing subject!   I know that some people in this challenge think that the photoshop manipulation with desaturating all other colors is overdone but I think it''s really fun and think that this would be a great photo to try like that with the sled color being yellow, everything else b/w.', '2003-02-17 23:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(218261, 12574, 4267, '<td valign="top">gnice DOF.. adjusting the contrast a little so the wall seems more washed out and not so right there... acctually pulling the statue away from the wall a little might have done the trick as well if the DoF was set right for that situation</td>', 'gnice DOF.. adjusting the contrast a little so the wall seems more washed out and not so right there... acctually pulling the statue away from the wall a little might have done the trick as well if the DoF was set right for that situation', '2003-02-17 23:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
