(218276, 12335, 4648, '<td valign="top">How many "what does this have to do with yellow?" have you gotten?  I think this was a really different way to meet the challenge, and is nice for a change.  And the photo is absolutely beautiful.  I personally would have liked a deeper depth of focus, but that''s just me.  What kind of bird are these?  This is a great photo, and deserves an 8.</td>', 'How many "what does this have to do with yellow?" have you gotten?  I think this was a really different way to meet the challenge, and is nice for a change.  And the photo is absolutely beautiful.  I personally would have liked a deeper depth of focus, but that''s just me.  What kind of bird are these?  This is a great photo, and deserves an 8.', '2003-02-18 00:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
