(218283, 12344, 6702, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and focus. Try offsetting your main subject a little to the left or right and see what you think. Picture a tic-tac-toe board and center your subject over one of the lines. In most cases, I think you will like it better. In this case move the flower to the right to fill some of the empty space.</td>', 'Good lighting and focus. Try offsetting your main subject a little to the left or right and see what you think. Picture a tic-tac-toe board and center your subject over one of the lines. In most cases, I think you will like it better. In this case move the flower to the right to fill some of the empty space.', '2003-02-18 00:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(218284, 12571, 6702, '<td valign="top">Nothin like snow to bring out a smile. Great shot.</td>', 'Nothin like snow to bring out a smile. Great shot.', '2003-02-18 00:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(218285, 12655, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful.  Is it considered to be a flower, or a plant.  I love it.  This should be number 1.  It is a fantastically done photo, plus it is so unique.  You nailed this one.  Congratulations on your 10.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful.  Is it considered to be a flower, or a plant.  I love it.  This should be number 1.  It is a fantastically done photo, plus it is so unique.  You nailed this one.  Congratulations on your 10.', '2003-02-18 00:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(218286, 12441, 4648, '<td valign="top">Would never have thought of this.  So simple yet so right on.  Love the texture that comes thru so clearly.  Can''t fault you on this one.  Not exciting but right on photographicly.</td>', 'Would never have thought of this.  So simple yet so right on.  Love the texture that comes thru so clearly.  Can''t fault you on this one.  Not exciting but right on photographicly.', '2003-02-18 00:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
