(218433, 12676, 5728, '<td valign="top">I saw the same kind of photo as this in a stock photo catalogue only last week, but I must say your version is better by far. The lighting is optimal here. When I look at this my head wants to lean to the left for some reason. I now the subject is standing straight but you have given the illusion of her leaning to the left of the photo. The only thing that distracts me a little is the gray area next to the number 6. Great job,  Kiwi = 10!</td>', 'I saw the same kind of photo as this in a stock photo catalogue only last week, but I must say your version is better by far. The lighting is optimal here. When I look at this my head wants to lean to the left for some reason. I now the subject is standing straight but you have given the illusion of her leaning to the left of the photo. The only thing that distracts me a little is the gray area next to the number 6. Great job,  Kiwi = 10!', '2003-02-18 06:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(218434, 12427, 5728, '<td valign="top">I tried doing many things with lemons last week but nothing really impressed me at all. What you have done is exactly that what I was looking for. Congratulations, why didn''t I think of that? You have composed this wonderfully, I feel as if I want to bite into that lemon, it looks so fresh and crisp. You have really brought out the full charachter of it. Good job!</td>', 'I tried doing many things with lemons last week but nothing really impressed me at all. What you have done is exactly that what I was looking for. Congratulations, why didn''t I think of that? You have composed this wonderfully, I feel as if I want to bite into that lemon, it looks so fresh and crisp. You have really brought out the full charachter of it. Good job!', '2003-02-18 06:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(218435, 12652, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great shot! There are so many flowers in this week''s challenge but this is one of my favourites! I gave you a 9 for this because you have somehow composed this shot so that I can almost smell them!</td>', 'Great shot! There are so many flowers in this week''s challenge but this is one of my favourites! I gave you a 9 for this because you have somehow composed this shot so that I can almost smell them!', '2003-02-18 06:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
