(218437, 12473, 5728, '<td valign="top">You met the challenge with the color here although the Kodak part is out of focus. DId you do this on purpose for the effect? I would have cropped out the letter "P" in the upper righthand corner and not have put the word "Kodak" so far into the top left hand corner.</td>', 'You met the challenge with the color here although the Kodak part is out of focus. DId you do this on purpose for the effect? I would have cropped out the letter "P" in the upper righthand corner and not have put the word "Kodak" so far into the top left hand corner.', '2003-02-18 06:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
