(218690, 12593, 5266, '<td valign="top">Soft focus - distracting background and foreground.</td>', 'Soft focus - distracting background and foreground.', '2003-02-18 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(218696, 12349, 5728, '<td valign="top">I really thought we would see a lot of spaghetti shots in this challenge but you are the only one! I love the pattern formed here with ample space between the single strands. The  title fits the photo as there really is a kind of spiral effect there. Even with this shot you have been able to apply the rule of thirds by placing the center of the spiral to the lower left which is good. It pulls the eye over to it. I like it, good job!</td>', 'I really thought we would see a lot of spaghetti shots in this challenge but you are the only one! I love the pattern formed here with ample space between the single strands. The  title fits the photo as there really is a kind of spiral effect there. Even with this shot you have been able to apply the rule of thirds by placing the center of the spiral to the lower left which is good. It pulls the eye over to it. I like it, good job!', '2003-02-18 11:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(218697, 12375, 6100, '<td valign="top">The play on words is a good concept ... well illustrated.</td>', 'The play on words is a good concept ... well illustrated.', '2003-02-18 11:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
