(218706, 12428, 1880, '<td valign="top">I love this. It tells a story. Regardless of what anybody saays this could not have worked without the shallow depth of field and the low lighting. Congratulations on a very unique idea and a terrific image. (9)</td>', 'I love this. It tells a story. Regardless of what anybody saays this could not have worked without the shallow depth of field and the low lighting. Congratulations on a very unique idea and a terrific image. (9)', '2003-02-18 12:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
