(218731, 12384, 2690, '<td valign="top">very intresting shot</td>', 'very intresting shot', '2003-02-18 13:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(218733, 12728, 51, '<td valign="top">When you''ve got to dink around in Photoshop to get a picture that reflects the challenge, then maybe you need to find a better idea! 1!</td>', 'When you''ve got to dink around in Photoshop to get a picture that reflects the challenge, then maybe you need to find a better idea! 1!', '2003-02-18 13:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(218734, 12404, 3942, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and well done lightning! Here and there a little blown out and overexposed, but that''s only marginal and doesn''t disturb me that much. Perhaps I would have cropped a little different. IMHO this shot could be more impressive, if the core is not centered. In addition there ist too much uninteresting space on the bottom of your shot. But that''s just me ;-). Nevertheless a unique and interesting submission! (9)</td>', 'Nice colors and well done lightning! Here and there a little blown out and overexposed, but that''s only marginal and doesn''t disturb me that much. Perhaps I would have cropped a little different. IMHO this shot could be more impressive, if the core is not centered. In addition there ist too much uninteresting space on the bottom of your shot. But that''s just me ;-). Nevertheless a unique and interesting submission! (9)', '2003-02-18 13:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(218735, 12386, 4729, '<td valign="top">Nice job on this!</td>', 'Nice job on this!', '2003-02-18 13:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(218737, 12738, 70, '<td valign="top">Nice. Cropping off the top of the building would make this a strong picture.</td>', 'Nice. Cropping off the top of the building would make this a strong picture.', '2003-02-18 13:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(218738, 12565, 3942, '<td valign="top">IMHO!! not that much interesting as you are hoping for.  A cropping according to the rule of thirds and a higher saturation / contrast of the yellow sign and the blue sky could have been helpful here. But that''s just me ;-) Nevertheless best of luck! (6)</td>', 'IMHO!! not that much interesting as you are hoping for.  A cropping according to the rule of thirds and a higher saturation / contrast of the yellow sign and the blue sky could have been helpful here. But that''s just me ;-) Nevertheless best of luck! (6)', '2003-02-18 13:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(218743, 12472, 6593, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture: good color, composition! The upper left roof is a little imperfect but still a great picture!</td>', 'Very nice picture: good color, composition! The upper left roof is a little imperfect but still a great picture!', '2003-02-18 13:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(218748, 12513, 5885, '<td valign="top">I find the photo quite humorous</td>', 'I find the photo quite humorous', '2003-02-18 14:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(218749, 12384, 5885, '<td valign="top">OK, this photo is just cool</td>', 'OK, this photo is just cool', '2003-02-18 14:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(218756, 12491, 6458, '<td valign="top">Perfect!</td>', 'Perfect!', '2003-02-18 15:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(218760, 12691, 6458, '<td valign="top">only one word for this - wow</td>', 'only one word for this - wow', '2003-02-18 15:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(218767, 12545, 6593, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture - good idea and lghting!</td>', 'This is a great picture - good idea and lghting!', '2003-02-18 16:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(218768, 12416, 5753, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Would be a lot better if the bridge and distant objects were in focus (must have been windy that day?)</td>', 'Great idea.  Would be a lot better if the bridge and distant objects were in focus (must have been windy that day?)', '2003-02-18 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(218769, 12733, 4517, '<td valign="top">very nice pic but not that yellow, more red</td>', 'very nice pic but not that yellow, more red', '2003-02-18 16:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(218770, 12538, 4517, '<td valign="top">could do with brightening up</td>', 'could do with brightening up', '2003-02-18 16:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(218772, 12564, 4517, '<td valign="top">Thats my kind of breakfast.8</td>', 'Thats my kind of breakfast.8', '2003-02-18 16:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(218773, 12513, 4517, '<td valign="top">Oh yes.10</td>', 'Oh yes.10', '2003-02-18 16:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(218776, 12428, 6418, '<td valign="top">I quite like this image!  Good lighting, DOF and originality!</td>', 'I quite like this image!  Good lighting, DOF and originality!', '2003-02-18 17:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(218777, 12606, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting shot, but I would have preferred more contrast with the background - although I''m not sure which colour would look good.  Depth of field is ok - just a little blurry at the top of the pencil.  Composition is good.</td>', 'It''s an interesting shot, but I would have preferred more contrast with the background - although I''m not sure which colour would look good.  Depth of field is ok - just a little blurry at the top of the pencil.  Composition is good.', '2003-02-18 17:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(218778, 12703, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good work - The flower has great focus and colour and the lighting is fairly good.  Personally I find the leaves and stem a little distracting - especially the leaf on the left.</td>', 'Good work - The flower has great focus and colour and the lighting is fairly good.  Personally I find the leaves and stem a little distracting - especially the leaf on the left.', '2003-02-18 17:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(218779, 12479, 1647, '<td valign="top">Personally I think the yellow is too pale for this challenge (perhaps comparing to the other shots is unfair).  There are some interesting angles here and I would have liked to see more included.  Perhaps less shrub and more roof would have been good.  I''m not sure why you chose a green border.</td>', 'Personally I think the yellow is too pale for this challenge (perhaps comparing to the other shots is unfair).  There are some interesting angles here and I would have liked to see more included.  Perhaps less shrub and more roof would have been good.  I''m not sure why you chose a green border.', '2003-02-18 17:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(218781, 12643, 3111, '<td valign="top">The center of the flower seems a bit out of focus.  Also, it looks as though you were trying to create contrast with foreground and background.  Shadows hurt the attempt.  Try lighting this more directly and shooting it again.</td>', 'The center of the flower seems a bit out of focus.  Also, it looks as though you were trying to create contrast with foreground and background.  Shadows hurt the attempt.  Try lighting this more directly and shooting it again.', '2003-02-18 17:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(218782, 12705, 3111, '<td valign="top">It needs to be bigger.  Composition wise, I think it would have been more interesting without that blue.  Get much much closer so the viewer is more sure of what your subject is.</td>', 'It needs to be bigger.  Composition wise, I think it would have been more interesting without that blue.  Get much much closer so the viewer is more sure of what your subject is.', '2003-02-18 17:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(218783, 12593, 3111, '<td valign="top">Cute idea with an anarchist and a balloon, but it doesn''t look like he is the one holding the balloon.  Take the shot from a better angle to tie the two together.  Also, DOF is lacking.</td>', 'Cute idea with an anarchist and a balloon, but it doesn''t look like he is the one holding the balloon.  Take the shot from a better angle to tie the two together.  Also, DOF is lacking.', '2003-02-18 17:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(218784, 12344, 3111, '<td valign="top">Crop out the green leaves and you would have a nice shot there.  Also, look into The Rule of Thirds to add some zing to your composition.</td>', 'Crop out the green leaves and you would have a nice shot there.  Also, look into The Rule of Thirds to add some zing to your composition.', '2003-02-18 17:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(218785, 12657, 3111, '<td valign="top">Simple composition.  It looks as though you tried wetting the pepper to get some interest going.  A strategically placed light would have brought out the drops more.  Check out the Rule of Thirds, I think thi swould be an interesting picture if the left half of the pepper took up the right third of the frame. (Did that make sense)</td>', 'Simple composition.  It looks as though you tried wetting the pepper to get some interest going.  A strategically placed light would have brought out the drops more.  Check out the Rule of Thirds, I think thi swould be an interesting picture if the left half of the pepper took up the right third of the frame. (Did that make sense)', '2003-02-18 17:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(218786, 12674, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo, with lots of texture.  I think it might be taken a little too close though.  Focus is fine.  In some ways the reflection (near bottom centre) is a shame, but very difficult to avoid I imagine.  Well done.</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo, with lots of texture.  I think it might be taken a little too close though.  Focus is fine.  In some ways the reflection (near bottom centre) is a shame, but very difficult to avoid I imagine.  Well done.', '2003-02-18 17:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(218787, 12592, 3111, '<td valign="top">Is this a zoom picture?  Neat effect.  You lose some detail in the middle - but I dont think the middle of the flower is the interesting thing here.  Nice work.</td>', 'Is this a zoom picture?  Neat effect.  You lose some detail in the middle - but I dont think the middle of the flower is the interesting thing here.  Nice work.', '2003-02-18 17:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(218788, 12628, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, although the nearest part of the frame appears blurred.  I like the contrast of the yellow and blue.  The reflections in the glass are in some ways distracting but I can''t imagine any way of avoiding them without spot editing.</td>', 'Nice photo, although the nearest part of the frame appears blurred.  I like the contrast of the yellow and blue.  The reflections in the glass are in some ways distracting but I can''t imagine any way of avoiding them without spot editing.', '2003-02-18 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(218789, 12386, 4536, '<td valign="top">Great panning technique and good title, one of my favorites.</td>', 'Great panning technique and good title, one of my favorites.', '2003-02-18 17:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(218790, 12573, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot - the toy is well framed.  It looks like you suffered a little from low light perhaps.  Also, the white background is a little boring - perhaps a coloured sheet might have been more interesting.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot - the toy is well framed.  It looks like you suffered a little from low light perhaps.  Also, the white background is a little boring - perhaps a coloured sheet might have been more interesting.', '2003-02-18 17:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(218791, 12590, 3111, '<td valign="top">I would say you need to darken this up a bit to create more of a silhoutte of the flower.  Also, a lowering of the contrast might help with the spots that are showing on the vase.</td>', 'I would say you need to darken this up a bit to create more of a silhoutte of the flower.  Also, a lowering of the contrast might help with the spots that are showing on the vase.', '2003-02-18 17:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(218792, 12677, 4536, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Not sure I understand the composition, it''s not quite straight, but not quite angled.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Not sure I understand the composition, it''s not quite straight, but not quite angled.', '2003-02-18 17:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(218793, 12386, 3111, '<td valign="top">Great color in both back and fore ground.  Its a shame that the back of the cab is cropped.</td>', 'Great color in both back and fore ground.  Its a shame that the back of the cab is cropped.', '2003-02-18 17:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(218794, 12364, 3111, '<td valign="top">There are too many things going on the picture.  Focus in on the two main blooms and you would have a nice composition.  I would be interested in seeing a re-submit with a crop of just the two main blooms</td>', 'There are too many things going on the picture.  Focus in on the two main blooms and you would have a nice composition.  I would be interested in seeing a re-submit with a crop of just the two main blooms', '2003-02-18 17:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(218795, 12762, 4536, '<td valign="top">Scarey, reality shot. The fact that you used a child gives this much more impact.</td>', 'Scarey, reality shot. The fact that you used a child gives this much more impact.', '2003-02-18 17:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(218796, 12750, 5728, '<td valign="top">This really looks like a paper flower but I know it isn''t. It is so sharp around the edges, I like how you composed it. It is not centered which enhances it a lot. The leaves at the top are very focused maybe a lower DOF would have been better to blur them out a little.</td>', 'This really looks like a paper flower but I know it isn''t. It is so sharp around the edges, I like how you composed it. It is not centered which enhances it a lot. The leaves at the top are very focused maybe a lower DOF would have been better to blur them out a little.', '2003-02-18 17:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(218798, 12703, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is the best flower of the lot in this challenge, the focus is perfect. The blur in the background is exactly right and the balck background excellent. You have to be proud of this photo. The composition is very good and the lighting as well, good job!</td>', 'This is the best flower of the lot in this challenge, the focus is perfect. The blur in the background is exactly right and the balck background excellent. You have to be proud of this photo. The composition is very good and the lighting as well, good job!', '2003-02-18 18:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(218800, 12385, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I would have liked more light in this shot - although I realise that might have been very difficult.  I think more light would have bought out details in the hairs.  It was certainly a novel location to find something yellow though.</td>', 'Unfortunately I would have liked more light in this shot - although I realise that might have been very difficult.  I think more light would have bought out details in the hairs.  It was certainly a novel location to find something yellow though.', '2003-02-18 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(218801, 12552, 5728, '<td valign="top">This looks like the eye of an insect, but that was my first thought although I know it isn''t of course.... It is all in focus and very sharp. I like it a lot despite the very tight crop! That yellow just jumps out at you, you have captured this very well with no reflections at all! Good job!</td>', 'This looks like the eye of an insect, but that was my first thought although I know it isn''t of course.... It is all in focus and very sharp. I like it a lot despite the very tight crop! That yellow just jumps out at you, you have captured this very well with no reflections at all! Good job!', '2003-02-18 18:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(218802, 12321, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites in this challenge! I love the abstract feeling of it, those yellow straws just want to throw me off the right side of the photo but the vertical straws brake that somehow. Good photo, I love it!</td>', 'This is one of my favourites in this challenge! I love the abstract feeling of it, those yellow straws just want to throw me off the right side of the photo but the vertical straws brake that somehow. Good photo, I love it!', '2003-02-18 18:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(218805, 12720, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting. I love the sharpness of the fork going into the sofness of the pineapple. The DOF is excellent here and the composition couldn''t be better. you did well with this one, congratulations!</td>', 'This is really interesting. I love the sharpness of the fork going into the sofness of the pineapple. The DOF is excellent here and the composition couldn''t be better. you did well with this one, congratulations!', '2003-02-18 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(218806, 12473, 1005, '<td valign="top">You have lots of yellow, challenge met.  Focus seems WAY off, to the extent that I want to ask, was this on purpose?  I am open to PM''s, so feel free to explain if you would like to, even during the challenge week.  I''m having a hard time offering positive comments, bear with me.  Even the exposure seems less than even handed, did you use a flash? (centered on the right side of your camera?)  The best I can go is a 4, sorry.  Swash</td>', 'You have lots of yellow, challenge met.  Focus seems WAY off, to the extent that I want to ask, was this on purpose?  I am open to PM''s, so feel free to explain if you would like to, even during the challenge week.  I''m having a hard time offering positive comments, bear with me.  Even the exposure seems less than even handed, did you use a flash? (centered on the right side of your camera?)  The best I can go is a 4, sorry.  Swash', '2003-02-18 18:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(218807, 12739, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow beautiful! This photo is excellent! I would only have cropped out that light part at the bottom but other than that....10 points!</td>', 'Wow beautiful! This photo is excellent! I would only have cropped out that light part at the bottom but other than that....10 points!', '2003-02-18 18:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(218810, 12501, 5483, '<td valign="top">great idea</td>', 'great idea', '2003-02-18 18:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(218811, 12582, 5728, '<td valign="top">I really thought there would be more peppers in this challenge but there weren''t so you get an extra point for that. The composition is good, the colour is very mellow! The angle of the stalks to the left creates a harmony here. The little gray spot at the top bothers me a little though. Good job!</td>', 'I really thought there would be more peppers in this challenge but there weren''t so you get an extra point for that. The composition is good, the colour is very mellow! The angle of the stalks to the left creates a harmony here. The little gray spot at the top bothers me a little though. Good job!', '2003-02-18 18:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(218813, 12369, 1005, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I see another view of this arrangement in the rhythm challenge?  I think I like the leaves sideways better.  Focus is very good.  Framing - works well, but there''s something about the sides that seems less appealing.  Color seems good, but I would have been tempted to make the yellow more vivid (increased saturation).  Sorry, I was very rash with my first view of this shot and scored it a 4, so you get a nice upgrade!  7 Swash</td>', 'Didn''t I see another view of this arrangement in the rhythm challenge?  I think I like the leaves sideways better.  Focus is very good.  Framing - works well, but there''s something about the sides that seems less appealing.  Color seems good, but I would have been tempted to make the yellow more vivid (increased saturation).  Sorry, I was very rash with my first view of this shot and scored it a 4, so you get a nice upgrade!  7 Swash', '2003-02-18 18:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(218814, 12743, 4536, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I find the upper/lighter background distracting, I wish it were green foliage like the bottom portion. Also the crop is a little unconventional, on the sides you have cut off just the tips, maybe a bit of room on either side or cropped in more, it just seems to be in between :).</td>', 'Very nice! I find the upper/lighter background distracting, I wish it were green foliage like the bottom portion. Also the crop is a little unconventional, on the sides you have cut off just the tips, maybe a bit of room on either side or cropped in more, it just seems to be in between :).', '2003-02-18 18:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(218815, 12761, 4536, '<td valign="top">Nice, I bet you were soooo tempted to clone out the white specks :).</td>', 'Nice, I bet you were soooo tempted to clone out the white specks :).', '2003-02-18 18:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(218816, 12587, 5728, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed is the border, it is far to bright for this photo! The photo is wonderful, you have got a crisp sharp capture here. The lighting is excellent and the main subject is enhanced by the blur of the background. The composition follows the rule of thirds but like I said the border is a little to distracting.</td>', 'The first thing I noticed is the border, it is far to bright for this photo! The photo is wonderful, you have got a crisp sharp capture here. The lighting is excellent and the main subject is enhanced by the blur of the background. The composition follows the rule of thirds but like I said the border is a little to distracting.', '2003-02-18 18:24:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(218818, 12718, 5728, '<td valign="top">A beautiful crisp photo. Very tightly cropped but you can get away with it here because the red in the middle pulls the eyes into it. One of my favourites good job!</td>', 'A beautiful crisp photo. Very tightly cropped but you can get away with it here because the red in the middle pulls the eyes into it. One of my favourites good job!', '2003-02-18 18:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(218820, 12694, 1005, '<td valign="top">Please argue against me, but it is my impression that this is OPA.  See site rules - Subject Matter/Artwork.  This is a VERY well taken shot.  Focus is good.  Color seems right on!  The glare from the lighting might need a little softening.  I am open to PM, even during the challenge week.  Sorry, 4, Swashbuckler</td>', 'Please argue against me, but it is my impression that this is OPA.  See site rules - Subject Matter/Artwork.  This is a VERY well taken shot.  Focus is good.  Color seems right on!  The glare from the lighting might need a little softening.  I am open to PM, even during the challenge week.  Sorry, 4, Swashbuckler', '2003-02-18 18:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(218821, 12423, 5728, '<td valign="top">You have cropped this one wonderfully, the yellow in the hair really stands out.</td>', 'You have cropped this one wonderfully, the yellow in the hair really stands out.', '2003-02-18 18:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(218823, 12618, 5728, '<td valign="top">How did you stick those two together? It looks good, that shadow looks like a hole, so dark! I like the use of negative space at the top right and the blurry transition.</td>', 'How did you stick those two together? It looks good, that shadow looks like a hole, so dark! I like the use of negative space at the top right and the blurry transition.', '2003-02-18 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(218824, 12707, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute title!  I am sorry, but I''m gonna get restrictive with you.  I need to see the color yellow for this challenge.  The handle and some of the foil is nicely in focus.  Framing is a little tight on the left.  I will give you a point for bravery, to submit a black and white shot to represent a color, but that''s it.  total 4.  Swash</td>', 'Cute title!  I am sorry, but I''m gonna get restrictive with you.  I need to see the color yellow for this challenge.  The handle and some of the foil is nicely in focus.  Framing is a little tight on the left.  I will give you a point for bravery, to submit a black and white shot to represent a color, but that''s it.  total 4.  Swash', '2003-02-18 18:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(218825, 12319, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice! The focus here is excellent, that flower looks so crisp! Very centered though! At least the little slant keeps it from being too sqaure. Great shot, good luck!</td>', 'Wow, nice! The focus here is excellent, that flower looks so crisp! Very centered though! At least the little slant keeps it from being too sqaure. Great shot, good luck!', '2003-02-18 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(218826, 12555, 1005, '<td valign="top">interesting color manip, but IMO it''s kinda heavy handed as it seems to have bled over to the skin, too.  Good detail, but again the color manip seems to me to have affected the definition (like the pupil''s edges).  It''s more artistic than photographic.  Sorry, 4, Swash</td>', 'interesting color manip, but IMO it''s kinda heavy handed as it seems to have bled over to the skin, too.  Good detail, but again the color manip seems to me to have affected the definition (like the pupil''s edges).  It''s more artistic than photographic.  Sorry, 4, Swash', '2003-02-18 18:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(218827, 12705, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Focus seems more on the background than the subject.  Photo is very small, so it''s hard to see a lot of detail.  Challenge met.  4 Swash</td>', 'Cute!  Focus seems more on the background than the subject.  Photo is very small, so it''s hard to see a lot of detail.  Challenge met.  4 Swash', '2003-02-18 18:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(218828, 12763, 5728, '<td valign="top">This was one of my first ideas but I didn''t go with it. But you did it and did it well! They all look so shiney and the color comes out well! The light or flash might be a little too strong especially in the top left M &amp; M.</td>', 'This was one of my first ideas but I didn''t go with it. But you did it and did it well! They all look so shiney and the color comes out well! The light or flash might be a little too strong especially in the top left M & M.', '2003-02-18 18:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(218829, 12406, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lots of yellow.  While the reflections IN the glass are really neat, the reflection of light back onto the boxes makes the photo seem grainy in places.  Framing - boxes are cropped in places that don''t seem to add meaning, interest or beauty.  (But then again, I can''t see what may have been cropped out!)  Sorry, 4 Swash</td>', 'Lots of yellow.  While the reflections IN the glass are really neat, the reflection of light back onto the boxes makes the photo seem grainy in places.  Framing - boxes are cropped in places that don''t seem to add meaning, interest or beauty.  (But then again, I can''t see what may have been cropped out!)  Sorry, 4 Swash', '2003-02-18 18:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(218830, 12552, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent yellow shot :)  this has a nice futuristic look to it... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'excellent yellow shot :)  this has a nice futuristic look to it... = 10 - setzler', '2003-02-18 18:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(218831, 12714, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yes, that''s yellow!  Can the subject (yellow domino) be negative space, too?  (I am really asking as I don''t know!)  Focus seems good, but not alot to go by.  Interest - low (sorry!)  4 Swash</td>', 'Yes, that''s yellow!  Can the subject (yellow domino) be negative space, too?  (I am really asking as I don''t know!)  Focus seems good, but not alot to go by.  Interest - low (sorry!)  4 Swash', '2003-02-18 18:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(218832, 12600, 1005, '<td valign="top">That''s very, very yellow!  This reminds me of an outside sculpture gallery I once visitied in St. Louis.  JPEG artifacts are heavy (loook at the inner edges of this piece).  Besides the surroundings of trees, I don''t see what YOU added to make this art your own, see site rules Subject Matter/Artwork.  Framing seems uneven both top/bottom and sides.  Sorry, 4, Swash</td>', 'That''s very, very yellow!  This reminds me of an outside sculpture gallery I once visitied in St. Louis.  JPEG artifacts are heavy (loook at the inner edges of this piece).  Besides the surroundings of trees, I don''t see what YOU added to make this art your own, see site rules Subject Matter/Artwork.  Framing seems uneven both top/bottom and sides.  Sorry, 4, Swash', '2003-02-18 18:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(218834, 12351, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset.  On my monitor, this scene looks red, with blue skys and silhouetted mountains.  Our Sun may be a yellow one, but our pollution makes it appear red.    5 Swash</td>', 'Nice sunset.  On my monitor, this scene looks red, with blue skys and silhouetted mountains.  Our Sun may be a yellow one, but our pollution makes it appear red.    5 Swash', '2003-02-18 19:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(218836, 12410, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a drinking fountain.  It is kinda yellow, but a very pale version.  Cropping seems a bit off (see upper left corner).  Focus is good.  Difficult subject/setting as there''s not enough light (grainy), but more light would have just made the glare much worse.  5 Swash</td>', 'Well, it''s a drinking fountain.  It is kinda yellow, but a very pale version.  Cropping seems a bit off (see upper left corner).  Focus is good.  Difficult subject/setting as there''s not enough light (grainy), but more light would have just made the glare much worse.  5 Swash', '2003-02-18 19:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(218839, 12545, 2178, '<td valign="top">Very creative, makes the yolk a very strong focal point..</td>', 'Very creative, makes the yolk a very strong focal point..', '2003-02-18 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(218840, 12349, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but could be sharper.</td>', 'Nice photo, but could be sharper.', '2003-02-18 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(218848, 12727, 1647, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.  I love the composition, especially the way the left arm fades away into darkness.  Washing the person out to b&amp;w helps bring attention to the yellow rope very well.  And I love the way the rope twists around the person so symmetrically.  Focus is ok - perhaps a tiny bit soft, but I think a little bit soft is appropriate here.  Well done.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.  I love the composition, especially the way the left arm fades away into darkness.  Washing the person out to b&w helps bring attention to the yellow rope very well.  And I love the way the rope twists around the person so symmetrically.  Focus is ok - perhaps a tiny bit soft, but I think a little bit soft is appropriate here.  Well done.', '2003-02-18 19:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(218849, 12761, 616, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Personally I can''t see one flaw or anything I would change about this photo. Nicely done!</td>', 'Beautiful! Personally I can''t see one flaw or anything I would change about this photo. Nicely done!', '2003-02-18 19:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(218851, 12418, 1647, '<td valign="top">What a pretty shiny car - has it left the pavement ever?  Composition of the vehicle is very good, but the gate and shadow under the vehicle are slightly distracting.  Focus is very good and lighting is good given the tough morning sun you are working with.  Is this car yours?</td>', 'What a pretty shiny car - has it left the pavement ever?  Composition of the vehicle is very good, but the gate and shadow under the vehicle are slightly distracting.  Focus is very good and lighting is good given the tough morning sun you are working with.  Is this car yours?', '2003-02-18 20:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(218852, 12529, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - a very interesting angle.  I would have cropped a little looser at the top (its a bit too close for my liking), and I might have tried to hide the ceiling light behind the mirror so it doesn''t distract.  Focus is good, and colours are nice and vivid.  What''s the stringlike object on the front wheel?</td>', 'Nice work - a very interesting angle.  I would have cropped a little looser at the top (its a bit too close for my liking), and I might have tried to hide the ceiling light behind the mirror so it doesn''t distract.  Focus is good, and colours are nice and vivid.  What''s the stringlike object on the front wheel?', '2003-02-18 20:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(218859, 12436, 6593, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot! Great color and a brilliant idea. But the sizes of cup and bowl are a little too big - my personal opinion.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot! Great color and a brilliant idea. But the sizes of cup and bowl are a little too big - my personal opinion.', '2003-02-18 20:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(218866, 12723, 6600, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors, nice looking dancer to boot!</td>', 'I like the bright colors, nice looking dancer to boot!', '2003-02-18 20:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(218895, 12427, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors in this shot.  The yellow, the white and the blues really compliment and contrast each other very well.  Excellent focus and clarity.  Awesome shot!!!</td>', 'I really love the colors in this shot.  The yellow, the white and the blues really compliment and contrast each other very well.  Excellent focus and clarity.  Awesome shot!!!', '2003-02-18 21:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(218899, 12616, 6097, '<td valign="top">Excellent color.  Very nice detail and focus.  I really like the lines and shadows that were captured in this shot.  My guess is that it was captured through a shot window or through a display case.(?)  Just looks as though there is a little glare toward the bottom of the image.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent color.  Very nice detail and focus.  I really like the lines and shadows that were captured in this shot.  My guess is that it was captured through a shot window or through a display case.(?)  Just looks as though there is a little glare toward the bottom of the image.  Nicely done.', '2003-02-18 21:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(218901, 12338, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  This image has excellent focus but it still has that soft focus sort of feeling.  I really like the yellow of the lime and the greenish that is in reflected from the glass.  They compliment each other well.  I really like the seamless background.</td>', 'Very nice.  This image has excellent focus but it still has that soft focus sort of feeling.  I really like the yellow of the lime and the greenish that is in reflected from the glass.  They compliment each other well.  I really like the seamless background.', '2003-02-18 21:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(218905, 12492, 4536, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the shot of blue paint from the blue challenge, this one also has star points. I think this one has a stronger composition, but the other one had more stars.</td>', 'This reminds me of the shot of blue paint from the blue challenge, this one also has star points. I think this one has a stronger composition, but the other one had more stars.', '2003-02-18 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
