(218908, 12683, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the graininess of this shot - very appropriate for a manhole.  Framing is great and the border compliments the shading around the plug nicely.  Focus is also very good.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the graininess of this shot - very appropriate for a manhole.  Framing is great and the border compliments the shading around the plug nicely.  Focus is also very good.  Well done.', '2003-02-18 22:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(218912, 12476, 1647, '<td valign="top">Such vivid colours.  I like the crop, except for the fact that the name is partly cut off.  Blue and yellow sit together very well and your focus is quite good.  It''s perhaps a tiny bit overexposed but in some ways this adds to the image.</td>', 'Such vivid colours.  I like the crop, except for the fact that the name is partly cut off.  Blue and yellow sit together very well and your focus is quite good.  It''s perhaps a tiny bit overexposed but in some ways this adds to the image.', '2003-02-18 22:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(218913, 12705, 1647, '<td valign="top">The photo is a bit small and also looks blurred.  Perhaps you were working with a camera that doesn''t do macro well though.  Adding more light can also help since it reduces shutter open time - giving a sharper image often.</td>', 'The photo is a bit small and also looks blurred.  Perhaps you were working with a camera that doesn''t do macro well though.  Adding more light can also help since it reduces shutter open time - giving a sharper image often.', '2003-02-18 22:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
