(219220, 12513, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is so original! I love it! This one will get a ribbon for sure. I can''t find anything wrong with it at all. The composition is excellent, the look on the subject''s face is so believable, she is just crying out "I hate being a housewife!"... The angle and crop is well done, and the yellows of the gloves and the wall complement each other wonderfully. Great job!</td>', 'This is so original! I love it! This one will get a ribbon for sure. I can''t find anything wrong with it at all. The composition is excellent, the look on the subject''s face is so believable, she is just crying out "I hate being a housewife!"... The angle and crop is well done, and the yellows of the gloves and the wall complement each other wonderfully. Great job!', '2003-02-19 14:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(219224, 12651, 5728, '<td valign="top">The best lemon shot this week! Great..... The lighting is excellent, the border fits and yellow is just crying out at me! You make me thirsty with this photo.... good one!</td>', 'The best lemon shot this week! Great..... The lighting is excellent, the border fits and yellow is just crying out at me! You make me thirsty with this photo.... good one!', '2003-02-19 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(219228, 12515, 806, '<td valign="top">this is a provocative shot! I really like the use of the shadow to pull my eye direction to the exiting yellow. Also, I like how the spots mirror the pattern on the fence. Wonderful work! I would call this art!</td>', 'this is a provocative shot! I really like the use of the shadow to pull my eye direction to the exiting yellow. Also, I like how the spots mirror the pattern on the fence. Wonderful work! I would call this art!', '2003-02-19 14:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(219230, 12715, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful! I love it. You somehow got that lemon to hover over your background. The crop is excellent and the background itself fits in perfectly. You have to be proud of this one.</td>', 'Wow, wonderful! I love it. You somehow got that lemon to hover over your background. The crop is excellent and the background itself fits in perfectly. You have to be proud of this one.', '2003-02-19 14:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(219231, 12762, 806, '<td valign="top">well, now here''s an emotive and breath stopping image. the innocence of the child behind the mask. look how he clutches to it, yet is naive to it''s true purpose. alarming. well done.</td>', 'well, now here''s an emotive and breath stopping image. the innocence of the child behind the mask. look how he clutches to it, yet is naive to it''s true purpose. alarming. well done.', '2003-02-19 14:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
