(219237, 12395, 5728, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful sunset! The yellow really comes through, good job! I like the crop particularly, and it was good leaving the dark part at the bottom. The rock on the right gives this photo that extra boost. You''ll score high for this one.</td>', 'A very beautiful sunset! The yellow really comes through, good job! I like the crop particularly, and it was good leaving the dark part at the bottom. The rock on the right gives this photo that extra boost. You''ll score high for this one.', '2003-02-19 14:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(219240, 12361, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! You captured this one perfectly! It looks so sharp and I love the way the background goes from blue to black. The water drops create extra charachter here, and the lighting is perfect, not too bright and not to dark. Good one!</td>', 'Beautiful! You captured this one perfectly! It looks so sharp and I love the way the background goes from blue to black. The water drops create extra charachter here, and the lighting is perfect, not too bright and not to dark. Good one!', '2003-02-19 14:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
