(219255, 12727, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! You took all the saturation out of all colors except yellow and it worked very well. The crop is excellent and the angle slightly tilted to the left gives this photo that extra effect. It is a piece of art this one, great job! 9 from me.</td>', 'Wonderful! You took all the saturation out of all colors except yellow and it worked very well. The crop is excellent and the angle slightly tilted to the left gives this photo that extra effect. It is a piece of art this one, great job! 9 from me.', '2003-02-19 14:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
