(219269, 12501, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Clever.  Everything stands out and contrasts very nice against the white background that was used.  I also like the way the shadow from the can falls across the brush handle.  Very nice shot.  Simple but very nice.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Clever.  Everything stands out and contrasts very nice against the white background that was used.  I also like the way the shadow from the can falls across the brush handle.  Very nice shot.  Simple but very nice.', '2003-02-19 15:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
