(219289, 12605, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Same idea as TWO TONE TONIC which was in the BLUE challenge.  I like that you can see the area which the vase is resting on.  The black cloth used for the base is very nice and adds to the image IMO.  I also really like the lines in the vase that cross over one another.  Really adds and draws my eye to the center of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Same idea as TWO TONE TONIC which was in the BLUE challenge.  I like that you can see the area which the vase is resting on.  The black cloth used for the base is very nice and adds to the image IMO.  I also really like the lines in the vase that cross over one another.  Really adds and draws my eye to the center of the photo.', '2003-02-19 15:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(219294, 12361, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Nice choice of blue/black background.  I especially like the gradient background how it fades from dark blue on the left to black on the left.  Very nice lighting and very nice color of yellow.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Nice choice of blue/black background.  I especially like the gradient background how it fades from dark blue on the left to black on the left.  Very nice lighting and very nice color of yellow.', '2003-02-19 15:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(219302, 12728, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is a really excellent photo.  I especially like your choice to de-saturate all colors, leaving just the yellow.  The yellow Washington Monument on the T-shirt is a nice added touch.  Would be an excellent photo for the wall in your home.  Very nice.</td>', 'This is a really excellent photo.  I especially like your choice to de-saturate all colors, leaving just the yellow.  The yellow Washington Monument on the T-shirt is a nice added touch.  Would be an excellent photo for the wall in your home.  Very nice.', '2003-02-19 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(219305, 12687, 6097, '<td valign="top">IMO this is a very nice and interesting photo.  I really like the way that the side of the glass seems to distort the lemon so that it isn''t a perfect circle.  Nice choice to use the glass to divide the photo into halves.  I think the negative space helps make this a more interesting photo.</td>', 'IMO this is a very nice and interesting photo.  I really like the way that the side of the glass seems to distort the lemon so that it isn''t a perfect circle.  Nice choice to use the glass to divide the photo into halves.  I think the negative space helps make this a more interesting photo.', '2003-02-19 15:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(219311, 12583, 2764, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, it feels a little crowded at the bottom. 9</td>', 'I like this a lot, it feels a little crowded at the bottom. 9', '2003-02-19 15:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
