(219342, 12369, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice - the patterns and texture make this interesting. Focus is excellent, and I really like the shades of yellow. Nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice - the patterns and texture make this interesting. Focus is excellent, and I really like the shades of yellow. Nicely done.', '2003-02-19 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
