(219555, 12423, 4648, '<td valign="top">Those aren''t bad ones.  I was really expecting something gross.  Nice photo though.  Good clean and clear.  Like the focus, not bad lighting, just a little extra on the right side but not much.  Green eyes?  Knowing people, even though it''s a good photo it won''s score well.  And that''s a shame.  Nice one and wishing you the best on it.</td>', 'Those aren''t bad ones.  I was really expecting something gross.  Nice photo though.  Good clean and clear.  Like the focus, not bad lighting, just a little extra on the right side but not much.  Green eyes?  Knowing people, even though it''s a good photo it won''s score well.  And that''s a shame.  Nice one and wishing you the best on it.', '2003-02-19 21:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(219556, 12484, 4494, '<td valign="top">The yellow is too weak.  The bright building on the left is also distracting, and the tilt of the pic doesn''t really do anything for me.</td>', 'The yellow is too weak.  The bright building on the left is also distracting, and the tilt of the pic doesn''t really do anything for me.', '2003-02-19 21:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
