(219614, 12378, 4648, '<td valign="top">Now that''s different.  And is it ever clear.  Almost think I see a thorn, like from a rose bush, on he stem.  Really nice macro.</td>', 'Now that''s different.  And is it ever clear.  Almost think I see a thorn, like from a rose bush, on he stem.  Really nice macro.', '2003-02-19 22:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
