(219619, 12626, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t want to nit-pic, but.....since it does have writing on it, I personally think the writing should have been turned toward the camera so it could be read, or turned away so no one would know there was any writing.  Other than this I really love this photo.  The blue is so beautiful, and the whitish ice is so neat floating on top of the water.  Really nice one.</td>', 'Don''t want to nit-pic, but.....since it does have writing on it, I personally think the writing should have been turned toward the camera so it could be read, or turned away so no one would know there was any writing.  Other than this I really love this photo.  The blue is so beautiful, and the whitish ice is so neat floating on top of the water.  Really nice one.', '2003-02-19 22:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(219621, 12656, 4494, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but I have to remove 2 points because of the small size. :(   The only reason I can think that anyone would do this is because they had to crop the picture so much, and it wouldn''t look good at a larger size.</td>', 'I like this picture but I have to remove 2 points because of the small size. :(   The only reason I can think that anyone would do this is because they had to crop the picture so much, and it wouldn''t look good at a larger size.', '2003-02-19 22:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(219623, 12452, 4648, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful rose and baby''s breath, but too busy of a background.  Also would have taken the red one out and had all the flowers in focus. Personally the back of the photo in focus, moving to the front to out of focus is not my forte.  This would have been beautiful with a solid black background and all in focus.  Nice composition, but badly needs better execution.</td>', 'Really beautiful rose and baby''s breath, but too busy of a background.  Also would have taken the red one out and had all the flowers in focus. Personally the back of the photo in focus, moving to the front to out of focus is not my forte.  This would have been beautiful with a solid black background and all in focus.  Nice composition, but badly needs better execution.', '2003-02-19 22:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(219624, 12375, 6313, '<td valign="top">good idea..funny</td>', 'good idea..funny', '2003-02-19 22:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(219625, 12385, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nicely done macro.  Not an easy one to get as sharp and clean as you did.  Congratulations on that.  Almost looks like an owls eye as open as it is.</td>', 'Nicely done macro.  Not an easy one to get as sharp and clean as you did.  Congratulations on that.  Almost looks like an owls eye as open as it is.', '2003-02-19 22:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(219628, 12321, 4648, '<td valign="top">Like the angle of the shot.  Well done.  Is there a scheme to the color arrangements of the other one?.  Nice focus.  Wouldn''t have hurt it to be a little ighter, but didn''t hurt it not to be either.</td>', 'Like the angle of the shot.  Well done.  Is there a scheme to the color arrangements of the other one?.  Nice focus.  Wouldn''t have hurt it to be a little ighter, but didn''t hurt it not to be either.', '2003-02-19 22:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(219629, 12634, 6313, '<td valign="top">hello uk</td>', 'hello uk', '2003-02-19 22:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(219654, 12586, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the way you captured two distinct yellow objects in the one shot (three if you count the sign).  Focus is quite good and composition is well suited given the two focal points of the image.  Well done</td>', 'I like the way you captured two distinct yellow objects in the one shot (three if you count the sign).  Focus is quite good and composition is well suited given the two focal points of the image.  Well done', '2003-02-19 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(219657, 12720, 1647, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF works well.  I think it''s cropped a little too close at the top.  Focus on the fork is wonderful but I wish I could see more detail in the pineapple.  Well done on a nice shot though.</td>', 'The shallow DOF works well.  I think it''s cropped a little too close at the top.  Focus on the fork is wonderful but I wish I could see more detail in the pineapple.  Well done on a nice shot though.', '2003-02-19 23:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(219659, 12706, 1647, '<td valign="top">This image is a tiny bit too soft for my liking - epsecially on the bananas.  The arrangement is good but the bananas are nearing the end of their life. :-)</td>', 'This image is a tiny bit too soft for my liking - epsecially on the bananas.  The arrangement is good but the bananas are nearing the end of their life. :-)', '2003-02-19 23:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(219660, 12677, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great texture in this shot.  I don''t think Black and Yellow is any less effective than Black and White in this instance.  I like the black bits being mainly at the bottom of the image - good composition.</td>', 'Great texture in this shot.  I don''t think Black and Yellow is any less effective than Black and White in this instance.  I like the black bits being mainly at the bottom of the image - good composition.', '2003-02-19 23:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(219670, 12676, 3280, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, I love the colors and the clarity of focus. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Awesome shot, I love the colors and the clarity of focus. One of my favorites.', '2003-02-19 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(219671, 12369, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, I love the colors. The border seems to take away from it some, perhaps a white or gold  line with a black border would have worked better</td>', 'Nice abstract, I love the colors. The border seems to take away from it some, perhaps a white or gold  line with a black border would have worked better', '2003-02-19 23:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(219674, 12358, 3280, '<td valign="top">Top pepper is a bit out of focus and you might want to bring the subject further from the backdrop so it doesn''t show so much. Good color.</td>', 'Top pepper is a bit out of focus and you might want to bring the subject further from the backdrop so it doesn''t show so much. Good color.', '2003-02-19 23:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(219675, 12499, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice macro and color.  I can''t decide whether the pollen is a distraction or not.</td>', 'Nice macro and color.  I can''t decide whether the pollen is a distraction or not.', '2003-02-19 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(219677, 12569, 3280, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. I''m not sure you needed the yellow background, white may have made the fries stand out more.  Creative and good idea.</td>', 'Simple but effective. I''m not sure you needed the yellow background, white may have made the fries stand out more.  Creative and good idea.', '2003-02-19 23:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(219678, 12571, 3280, '<td valign="top">Cute, she looks ready to go! Good job with a tough background and difference in contrast with the snow.</td>', 'Cute, she looks ready to go! Good job with a tough background and difference in contrast with the snow.', '2003-02-19 23:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(219679, 12370, 6325, '<td valign="top">I think cropping out the door edges and leaving just the louveres  and boosting the contrast would have been more impactful. Is this the correct color?</td>', 'I think cropping out the door edges and leaving just the louveres  and boosting the contrast would have been more impactful. Is this the correct color?', '2003-02-19 23:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(219680, 12572, 3280, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene from "The Bachelor" or something!  A bit out of focus but a captivating idea.</td>', 'Looks like a scene from "The Bachelor" or something!  A bit out of focus but a captivating idea.', '2003-02-19 23:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(219681, 12648, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool. I even like the yellow border. Might have left some more room around the bottom of the marker.</td>', 'Pretty cool. I even like the yellow border. Might have left some more room around the bottom of the marker.', '2003-02-19 23:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(219684, 12335, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat photo, might have worked better in the Rhythm challenge!</td>', 'Neat photo, might have worked better in the Rhythm challenge!', '2003-02-19 23:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(219685, 12692, 3280, '<td valign="top">Actually, in pretty good shape for 150 years.  Nice capture, a black border would have set it off IMHO.</td>', 'Actually, in pretty good shape for 150 years.  Nice capture, a black border would have set it off IMHO.', '2003-02-19 23:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(219686, 12703, 5044, '<td valign="top">Perfect flower. Focus is great. Colour is right on. That leaf to the left is a little distracting though.</td>', 'Perfect flower. Focus is great. Colour is right on. That leaf to the left is a little distracting though.', '2003-02-19 23:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(219687, 12374, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot, lighting is a bit too harsh on the right and a bit too shadowed in the middle. A softener (sheet or even a paper towel) over the bulb would cut down on the glare and a reflector on the left would fill in some of the shadows.</td>', 'Pretty good shot, lighting is a bit too harsh on the right and a bit too shadowed in the middle. A softener (sheet or even a paper towel) over the bulb would cut down on the glare and a reflector on the left would fill in some of the shadows.', '2003-02-19 23:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(219688, 12424, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Flower seems a little overexposed, though.</td>', 'Nice composition. Flower seems a little overexposed, though.', '2003-02-19 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(219690, 12320, 3280, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot, I wouldn''t have cropped the couple of pills that you did.</td>', 'Pretty good shot, I wouldn''t have cropped the couple of pills that you did.', '2003-02-19 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(219691, 12581, 6325, '<td valign="top">Might have tried a contrasting or black background. Black would have absorbed the shadows.</td>', 'Might have tried a contrasting or black background. Black would have absorbed the shadows.', '2003-02-19 23:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(219692, 12378, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like this a lot. The positioning of the apple and stem is perfect.  A black border may have set this off.</td>', 'Very nice, I like this a lot. The positioning of the apple and stem is perfect.  A black border may have set this off.', '2003-02-19 23:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(219693, 12418, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear, but this side view without any angle at all makes it too one dimensional.  It is hard to tell whether it is the real thing or a picture of a hummer.</td>', 'Nice and clear, but this side view without any angle at all makes it too one dimensional.  It is hard to tell whether it is the real thing or a picture of a hummer.', '2003-02-19 23:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(219694, 12606, 6325, '<td valign="top">A dark backgound would have made this more dramatic.</td>', 'A dark backgound would have made this more dramatic.', '2003-02-19 23:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(219695, 12515, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really like this, one of my favorites this week.  I wish I could see the entire shadow of the leopard though.  Really great!</td>', 'I really like this, one of my favorites this week.  I wish I could see the entire shadow of the leopard though.  Really great!', '2003-02-19 23:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(219697, 12632, 6325, '<td valign="top">Maybe crop out the planter.</td>', 'Maybe crop out the planter.', '2003-02-19 23:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(219698, 12384, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat shot although I would have had no idea that was what it was without the title.</td>', 'Neat shot although I would have had no idea that was what it was without the title.', '2003-02-19 23:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(219699, 12747, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good image. Seems so lonesome.</td>', 'Good image. Seems so lonesome.', '2003-02-19 23:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(219700, 12525, 3280, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Great focus and use of Negative space. The lighting is perfect.  I can''t tell if it is just a bit over-sharpened or not.</td>', 'One of my favorites. Great focus and use of Negative space. The lighting is perfect.  I can''t tell if it is just a bit over-sharpened or not.', '2003-02-19 23:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(219702, 12322, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Captured the lemons. Lighting a little harsh on the cut lemon. Maybe crop most of the foreground and show a little more beyond the lemons.</td>', 'Good composition. Captured the lemons. Lighting a little harsh on the cut lemon. Maybe crop most of the foreground and show a little more beyond the lemons.', '2003-02-19 23:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(219706, 12414, 6325, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nice flowing edges to the petals. Bee is focused well.</td>', 'Beautiful. Nice flowing edges to the petals. Bee is focused well.', '2003-02-19 23:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(219708, 12630, 6325, '<td valign="top">Maybe show more of the hands.</td>', 'Maybe show more of the hands.', '2003-02-19 23:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(219709, 12579, 6325, '<td valign="top">Much too busy for me.</td>', 'Much too busy for me.', '2003-02-19 23:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(219711, 12372, 6325, '<td valign="top">Did you try a shot of just the back lighted vase? I think that would have been more interesting.</td>', 'Did you try a shot of just the back lighted vase? I think that would have been more interesting.', '2003-02-19 23:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(219720, 12618, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice clearity and lighting, good job</td>', 'nice clearity and lighting, good job', '2003-02-20 00:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(219721, 12427, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice close up, i like the texture of the lemon, good image</td>', 'nice close up, i like the texture of the lemon, good image', '2003-02-20 00:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(219722, 12484, 1647, '<td valign="top">Such an aggressive angle for this shot - it helps create an uneasy feeling.  Focus is fine.  The image looks washed out, but the building in the lower left implies that the levels are already maxxed out.  Focus is good.</td>', 'Such an aggressive angle for this shot - it helps create an uneasy feeling.  Focus is fine.  The image looks washed out, but the building in the lower left implies that the levels are already maxxed out.  Focus is good.', '2003-02-20 00:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(219723, 12492, 5044, '<td valign="top">Blue?</td>', 'Blue?', '2003-02-20 00:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(219724, 12630, 1647, '<td valign="top">Focus is great.  The lighting is interesting - almost too harsh and shallow, but kind of adds to the mood you seem to be creating.  The left corner of the rope is almost too bright though.</td>', 'Focus is great.  The lighting is interesting - almost too harsh and shallow, but kind of adds to the mood you seem to be creating.  The left corner of the rope is almost too bright though.', '2003-02-20 00:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(219725, 12728, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the yellow has a very strong green tinge to it.  The border suits the image very well and focus and composition are good.</td>', 'Unfortunately the yellow has a very strong green tinge to it.  The border suits the image very well and focus and composition are good.', '2003-02-20 00:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(219726, 12478, 6425, '<td valign="top">good idea, i like the lighting and the rounded texture of the teeth</td>', 'good idea, i like the lighting and the rounded texture of the teeth', '2003-02-20 00:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(219727, 12574, 1647, '<td valign="top">This image has a reall golden glow to it.  I love the composition and the lighting you chose to work with.  Focus is also good.  Well done.</td>', 'This image has a reall golden glow to it.  I love the composition and the lighting you chose to work with.  Focus is also good.  Well done.', '2003-02-20 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(219728, 12743, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice clear image, good job</td>', 'nice clear image, good job', '2003-02-20 00:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(219729, 12739, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice image, i think that this is a high quality image even though the sunlight seems more orange than yellow</td>', 'nice image, i think that this is a high quality image even though the sunlight seems more orange than yellow', '2003-02-20 00:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(219730, 12477, 6425, '<td valign="top">i like the texture of the seeds and the brightness of the flower, nice image</td>', 'i like the texture of the seeds and the brightness of the flower, nice image', '2003-02-20 00:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(219731, 12386, 1647, '<td valign="top">You did very well to get such a sharp shop of the moving taxi - I''ve always wanted to try following a subject like this, but would probably do a terrible job.  It really brings the yellow taxi into the centre of attention.  Great job.</td>', 'You did very well to get such a sharp shop of the moving taxi - I''ve always wanted to try following a subject like this, but would probably do a terrible job.  It really brings the yellow taxi into the centre of attention.  Great job.', '2003-02-20 00:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(219732, 12582, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice image.  The peppers really stand out with the black background.  nice image</td>', 'nice image.  The peppers really stand out with the black background.  nice image', '2003-02-20 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(219733, 12698, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at a macro shot.  I light a little more light might have helped to have the entire car lit well.  Also I might have tried to remove the background somehow, including the plaque since it cannot be read.  I like the composition and angle of this shot - it displays the car very well.</td>', 'Good attempt at a macro shot.  I light a little more light might have helped to have the entire car lit well.  Also I might have tried to remove the background somehow, including the plaque since it cannot be read.  I like the composition and angle of this shot - it displays the car very well.', '2003-02-20 00:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(219735, 12333, 6425, '<td valign="top">good image, the yellow bouye seems small compared to the background and the background also seems a little cluttered</td>', 'good image, the yellow bouye seems small compared to the background and the background also seems a little cluttered', '2003-02-20 00:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(219736, 12615, 6425, '<td valign="top">nice image but where did the border come from?</td>', 'nice image but where did the border come from?', '2003-02-20 00:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(219737, 12410, 6425, '<td valign="top">a little blurry, and the water fountain looks more pale</td>', 'a little blurry, and the water fountain looks more pale', '2003-02-20 00:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
