(219807, 12555, 4267, '<td valign="top">use some closeup filters or back the camera up just a little..that way focus will be easier to achieve... if your intention was soft focus here, it doesn\''t work, as macros are about detail... plus the heavy saturation makes it look like digital art and not photography... try saturating the color a little at a time and in layers for a more natural loom... adjust color lightness/darkness helps with this too</td>', 'use some closeup filters or back the camera up just a little..that way focus will be easier to achieve... if your intention was soft focus here, it doesn\''t work, as macros are about detail... plus the heavy saturation makes it look like digital art and not photography... try saturating the color a little at a time and in layers for a more natural loom... adjust color lightness/darkness helps with this too', '2003-02-20 01:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(219808, 12428, 4267, '<td valign="top">yes the mm is yellow, but the color is not dominant enough for this weeks theme... even out of focus, taz seems to be the dominant subject...  however I can see that you inended shallow DoF and you did acheieve that to the T. nice job</td>', 'yes the mm is yellow, but the color is not dominant enough for this weeks theme... even out of focus, taz seems to be the dominant subject...  however I can see that you inended shallow DoF and you did acheieve that to the T. nice job', '2003-02-20 01:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(219809, 12358, 4267, '<td valign="top">oh my you need contrast... adjusting the brightness and contrast so the background is just washed out black negative space will add a whole lot more drama and really make the colors pop... great focus and DoF though... you make have needed some camera adjustments to help with the lighting issue as well</td>', 'oh my you need contrast... adjusting the brightness and contrast so the background is just washed out black negative space will add a whole lot more drama and really make the colors pop... great focus and DoF though... you make have needed some camera adjustments to help with the lighting issue as well', '2003-02-20 01:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
