(219832, 12338, 1829, '<td valign="top">Love it, love it, love it.  Excellent composition and choice of subject.  The background really highlights the lemon and the lighing is awesome.  I love how you have created a simple effect yet it''s so effective.  Excellent photo and GL.  A big 10 from me :)</td>', 'Love it, love it, love it.  Excellent composition and choice of subject.  The background really highlights the lemon and the lighing is awesome.  I love how you have created a simple effect yet it''s so effective.  Excellent photo and GL.  A big 10 from me :)', '2003-02-20 04:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(219833, 12337, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting technique in your photo.  Excellent choice of subject.  The black background really blends in nicely with the yellow balloon.  Well done and GL.  A 10 from me :)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting technique in your photo.  Excellent choice of subject.  The black background really blends in nicely with the yellow balloon.  Well done and GL.  A 10 from me :)', '2003-02-20 04:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(219834, 12761, 1829, '<td valign="top">Ok so there are a lot of flower shots in this challenge, however this one takes the ''cake''.  Beautiful lighting.  Composition, clarity, colour and subject is just fantastic.  I really like this shot.  The black background hightlights the subject very well.  A big 10 from me :)  GL.</td>', 'Ok so there are a lot of flower shots in this challenge, however this one takes the ''cake''.  Beautiful lighting.  Composition, clarity, colour and subject is just fantastic.  I really like this shot.  The black background hightlights the subject very well.  A big 10 from me :)  GL.', '2003-02-20 04:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(219835, 12427, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and colour.  The choice in which you chose for this challenge is really interesting.  Colour, lighting, composition are all awesome.  Well done and GL.</td>', 'Excellent composition and colour.  The choice in which you chose for this challenge is really interesting.  Colour, lighting, composition are all awesome.  Well done and GL.', '2003-02-20 04:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(219836, 12676, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Love how you have saturated the colour to B&amp;W leaving the main colour intact.  Composition is very interesting and this shot caught my eye because your image is different and very creative.  Overall an excellent shot showing the colour yellow.  GL</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Love how you have saturated the colour to B&W leaving the main colour intact.  Composition is very interesting and this shot caught my eye because your image is different and very creative.  Overall an excellent shot showing the colour yellow.  GL', '2003-02-20 04:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(219837, 12515, 1829, '<td valign="top">Your picture gives a sense of mystery.  What a top shot!!  Excellent choice of subject and that shadow is just awesome.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'Your picture gives a sense of mystery.  What a top shot!!  Excellent choice of subject and that shadow is just awesome.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-02-20 04:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
