(219993, 12569, 5728, '<td valign="top">You have succeeded in making my mouth water! Those chips look so crispy, yum. The colors complement each other well here, the crop is great, the border and title both fit very well.</td>', 'You have succeeded in making my mouth water! Those chips look so crispy, yum. The colors complement each other well here, the crop is great, the border and title both fit very well.', '2003-02-20 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(219998, 12443, 1005, '<td valign="top">At first, this looked a bit ho-hum, but the more I gaze upon it, the more striking it appears to me.  The sun is more yellow than most suns in this challenge, so challenge met.  The nearly total lack of sun flares is impressive!  The silhouetted person is interesting (a bit hard to see, but I think that adds to the mystery).  The far background isn''t great, but could I ask you to mow down these buildings?  I don''t think so.  Score upgrade from 5 to 7.  Swash</td>', 'At first, this looked a bit ho-hum, but the more I gaze upon it, the more striking it appears to me.  The sun is more yellow than most suns in this challenge, so challenge met.  The nearly total lack of sun flares is impressive!  The silhouetted person is interesting (a bit hard to see, but I think that adds to the mystery).  The far background isn''t great, but could I ask you to mow down these buildings?  I don''t think so.  Score upgrade from 5 to 7.  Swash', '2003-02-20 13:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(220011, 12352, 1005, '<td valign="top">Bizarre shot!  I''d really like to know what this is and how it was done!  (I''ll make a mental note to read the description after the challenge, hint - if you description is N/A or something like that, could you describe this and it''s process in a comment on the photo after the challenge?? Please?)  The sunglasses and smile strike me as funny/odd (in a good way!).  Yellow challenge met!  The yellow object is just purplexing, seems like flame, but that just can''t be (how would one hang sunglasses on a flame?).  Some of the dark details say "lots of post processing" to me (see the various artifacts in the shadow?).  Cool artsy image.  Now for the slight downside....Due to the cool effects, this seems less like a photo and more like a made up art piece (really this isn''t totally bad effect, but this a photo contest, so I have an up-front expectation that the image will "look" like a photo.  (Probably my bad!)  Score upgrade from 5 to 6.  Swash</td>', 'Bizarre shot!  I''d really like to know what this is and how it was done!  (I''ll make a mental note to read the description after the challenge, hint - if you description is N/A or something like that, could you describe this and it''s process in a comment on the photo after the challenge?? Please?)  The sunglasses and smile strike me as funny/odd (in a good way!).  Yellow challenge met!  The yellow object is just purplexing, seems like flame, but that just can''t be (how would one hang sunglasses on a flame?).  Some of the dark details say "lots of post processing" to me (see the various artifacts in the shadow?).  Cool artsy image.  Now for the slight downside....Due to the cool effects, this seems less like a photo and more like a made up art piece (really this isn''t totally bad effect, but this a photo contest, so I have an up-front expectation that the image will "look" like a photo.  (Probably my bad!)  Score upgrade from 5 to 6.  Swash', '2003-02-20 13:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(220012, 12754, 1379, '<td valign="top">Oh, now THIS I like!</td>', 'Oh, now THIS I like!', '2003-02-20 13:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(220013, 12755, 1005, '<td valign="top">A very good color desaturation (whenever I try this, it looks funny, colors bleeding and such).  Image seems very sharp!  Yellow challenge well met.  Odd shot, you have quite the imagination!  Score upgrade from 5 to 7. Swash</td>', 'A very good color desaturation (whenever I try this, it looks funny, colors bleeding and such).  Image seems very sharp!  Yellow challenge well met.  Odd shot, you have quite the imagination!  Score upgrade from 5 to 7. Swash', '2003-02-20 13:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
