(220123, 12422, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wildly interesting effect!  I know I''m asking for too much, but the level of detail isn''t very high (I know this wasn''t the BEST reflecting surface).  The yellow row is just off the center of the globe/thing - to me, this takes the emphasis away from that box and generalizes it.  (The box above seems to have really bright yellow <br/>?jellybeans?)  I do like how the boxes seem to roll off the edge of the ball into infinity (good for last week''s challenge, too!).  Are those fingers holding the ?ball? on the lower right?  (No score issue, just asking)  Crop - I think the top and bottom needed to be included, but I think you might have been trying to hide the fingers, so I''ll not gripe too much.  6 Swash</td>', 'Wildly interesting effect!  I know I''m asking for too much, but the level of detail isn''t very high (I know this wasn''t the BEST reflecting surface).  The yellow row is just off the center of the globe/thing - to me, this takes the emphasis away from that box and generalizes it.  (The box above seems to have really bright yellow ?jellybeans?)  I do like how the boxes seem to roll off the edge of the ball into infinity (good for last week''s challenge, too!).  Are those fingers holding the ?ball? on the lower right?  (No score issue, just asking)  Crop - I think the top and bottom needed to be included, but I think you might have been trying to hide the fingers, so I''ll not gripe too much.  6 Swash', '2003-02-20 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(220126, 12746, 1005, '<td valign="top">I do like the green highlights, it seems to add extra flavor to the shot.  Focus seems pretty sharp.  No distracting background issues (though it doesn\''t appear to me to be all the same shade of dark - brighter spot in the middle).  Shading on the rope is nice, adds depth.  I kinda missed the point behind the title, sorry, my bad!  Just off cemetrical cropping, doesn\''t seem to add anything.  Interest - sorry, but it doesn\''t really grab me and hold me.  6 Swash</td>', 'I do like the green highlights, it seems to add extra flavor to the shot.  Focus seems pretty sharp.  No distracting background issues (though it doesn\''t appear to me to be all the same shade of dark - brighter spot in the middle).  Shading on the rope is nice, adds depth.  I kinda missed the point behind the title, sorry, my bad!  Just off cemetrical cropping, doesn\''t seem to add anything.  Interest - sorry, but it doesn\''t really grab me and hold me.  6 Swash', '2003-02-20 19:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
