(220620, 12638, 5728, '<td valign="top">I love custard! Yummy! It is a little dark but I see that if you had lightened it up any more the edge of the spoon would have blown out, so you were right to keep it this way. The reflections in the custard give this image more charachter. I would have prefered the shadow on only one side of the spoon though.</td>', 'I love custard! Yummy! It is a little dark but I see that if you had lightened it up any more the edge of the spoon would have blown out, so you were right to keep it this way. The reflections in the custard give this image more charachter. I would have prefered the shadow on only one side of the spoon though.', '2003-02-21 15:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(220622, 12390, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great idea here! Two things I''d like to mention though. The bottle is fully in focus but the clown just a tad out, I would have set the aperture at a higher number. The lighting or the flash is glaring a little too much on the clown''s leg, shoulder and face. However the composition is excellent. Good crop.</td>', 'Great idea here! Two things I''d like to mention though. The bottle is fully in focus but the clown just a tad out, I would have set the aperture at a higher number. The lighting or the flash is glaring a little too much on the clown''s leg, shoulder and face. However the composition is excellent. Good crop.', '2003-02-21 15:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(220623, 12677, 5728, '<td valign="top">That''s a wonderful texture you captured here! You''ve really pulled out the old age of that leaf. The lightening is perfect and the crop also. The spine of the leaf almost looks as if it is hairy! You can be proud of this one I can find no faults.</td>', 'That''s a wonderful texture you captured here! You''ve really pulled out the old age of that leaf. The lightening is perfect and the crop also. The spine of the leaf almost looks as if it is hairy! You can be proud of this one I can find no faults.', '2003-02-21 15:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(220626, 12719, 5728, '<td valign="top">And someone lives here??? Yep it is yellow alright, challenge met for sure. I like that you didn''t center the door and cropped it to the left. I like also that you brought that bush in on the right it gives the image more charachter, good one!</td>', 'And someone lives here??? Yep it is yellow alright, challenge met for sure. I like that you didn''t center the door and cropped it to the left. I like also that you brought that bush in on the right it gives the image more charachter, good one!', '2003-02-21 15:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(220628, 12591, 5728, '<td valign="top">The candles are yellow for sure, so you met the challenge. The crop is good but somehow the light of the flash (or lighting) on the top candle is distracting me, it seems a little glary there. My wife just said to me it would have been better if one or two of the candles were lit, and come to think of it I agree with her. I think the light would have been completely different that way. You could have had less ambient light and a slower shutter speed to create a cool effect.</td>', 'The candles are yellow for sure, so you met the challenge. The crop is good but somehow the light of the flash (or lighting) on the top candle is distracting me, it seems a little glary there. My wife just said to me it would have been better if one or two of the candles were lit, and come to think of it I agree with her. I think the light would have been completely different that way. You could have had less ambient light and a slower shutter speed to create a cool effect.', '2003-02-21 15:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(220630, 12597, 3846, '<td valign="top">Cute, yu must have kids.</td>', 'Cute, yu must have kids.', '2003-02-21 16:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(220631, 12702, 3846, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and good exposure. CP</td>', 'Nice lines and good exposure. CP', '2003-02-21 16:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(220637, 12649, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  Very cute!  Focus is great!  It''s yellow!  Challenge met.  Great detail, I see the lines on the chick''s feet.  (Naked chick, full frontal nudity!!!)  9 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot!  Very cute!  Focus is great!  It''s yellow!  Challenge met.  Great detail, I see the lines on the chick''s feet.  (Naked chick, full frontal nudity!!!)  9 Swash', '2003-02-21 16:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(220638, 12761, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot!  Wonderful yellow flower.  Great amount of detail.  Lighting is very nice.  Small nit - two white spots on the left side of the flower (in the black), could be dead pixels, or a small fault in your lighting.  9 Swash</td>', 'Very beautiful shot!  Wonderful yellow flower.  Great amount of detail.  Lighting is very nice.  Small nit - two white spots on the left side of the flower (in the black), could be dead pixels, or a small fault in your lighting.  9 Swash', '2003-02-21 16:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(220639, 12547, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really fun shot!  Sparks stopped in mid-spark.  It''s almost white, but I''ll go with this as yellow.  9 Swash</td>', 'Really fun shot!  Sparks stopped in mid-spark.  It''s almost white, but I''ll go with this as yellow.  9 Swash', '2003-02-21 16:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(220640, 12605, 2109, '<td valign="top">This photo is good, but could be INCREDIBLE if the black line beneath the yellow on the left was straight.  Technically a nice shot - 8</td>', 'This photo is good, but could be INCREDIBLE if the black line beneath the yellow on the left was straight.  Technically a nice shot - 8', '2003-02-21 16:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(220644, 12733, 2109, '<td valign="top">yellow?</td>', 'yellow?', '2003-02-21 16:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(220650, 12384, 6870, '<td valign="top">Seems so simple, and it makes a statement. Conforms to theme very nicely. I''m sure you didn''t arrange the bubbles (!), but they are sure "well placed," demonstrating excellent cropping. Bubbles on edges seem slightly out of focus--actually, the bubbles on the extreme right seem most in focus. I can''t help feeling that there should be even focus in this image. Nice work!</td>', 'Seems so simple, and it makes a statement. Conforms to theme very nicely. I''m sure you didn''t arrange the bubbles (!), but they are sure "well placed," demonstrating excellent cropping. Bubbles on edges seem slightly out of focus--actually, the bubbles on the extreme right seem most in focus. I can''t help feeling that there should be even focus in this image. Nice work!', '2003-02-21 16:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(220657, 12554, 5728, '<td valign="top">You centered this one but it isn''t negaitve here. Brutal but I like it somehow. You got the light coming in well from the right and it hits it with a real yellow so you met the challenge with it. The longer I look at it the more I like it, I hope everyone takes a bit longer to look at this one. It''s just hard light and then shadow, nothing in between.  8 from me.</td>', 'You centered this one but it isn''t negaitve here. Brutal but I like it somehow. You got the light coming in well from the right and it hits it with a real yellow so you met the challenge with it. The longer I look at it the more I like it, I hope everyone takes a bit longer to look at this one. It''s just hard light and then shadow, nothing in between.  8 from me.', '2003-02-21 17:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(220659, 12503, 4411, '<td valign="top">I nearly submitted a macro of a sponge that looked quite similar to this, so yeah I like it!<br/>Having seperate parts of whatever it is works really well and breaks the light up nicely. Good job with the focus &amp; DoF too. Well done.</td>', 'I nearly submitted a macro of a sponge that looked quite similar to this, so yeah I like it!Having seperate parts of whatever it is works really well and breaks the light up nicely. Good job with the focus & DoF too. Well done.', '2003-02-21 17:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(220661, 12411, 4411, '<td valign="top">I can honestly say I''ve never seen one of these from this angle before! Great thinking and good composition, the leaves fill out the top of the frame nicely. Well done.</td>', 'I can honestly say I''ve never seen one of these from this angle before! Great thinking and good composition, the leaves fill out the top of the frame nicely. Well done.', '2003-02-21 17:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(220663, 12668, 4411, '<td valign="top">Heh, great idea! The top down angle works really well and the lighting &amp; focus are superb - the soft texture of the ducks comes across really well. Great shot.</td>', 'Heh, great idea! The top down angle works really well and the lighting & focus are superb - the soft texture of the ducks comes across really well. Great shot.', '2003-02-21 17:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(220665, 12428, 4411, '<td valign="top">LOL! Fantastic. Really brings a smile to my face : )<br/>I really like the tracks, very nicely done, and the DoF with the focus on the yellow m&amp;m ensures it meets the challenge. Lighting is spot on, giving a never-ending snowfield effect and nice shadows.<br/>Great work, can''t resist giving it a 10.</td>', 'LOL! Fantastic. Really brings a smile to my face : )I really like the tracks, very nicely done, and the DoF with the focus on the yellow m&m ensures it meets the challenge. Lighting is spot on, giving a never-ending snowfield effect and nice shadows.Great work, can''t resist giving it a 10.', '2003-02-21 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(220666, 12714, 4411, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but there''s no detail or texture to hold the eye.</td>', 'A good idea, but there''s no detail or texture to hold the eye.', '2003-02-21 17:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(220669, 12610, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool action shot!  While I like the streaki-ness of the juice flying, I would also wonder how it looked with a faster exposure, so the juice was just hanging in mid-air.  (The thumb looks like it''s pressing pretty hard!)  9 Swash</td>', 'Cool action shot!  While I like the streaki-ness of the juice flying, I would also wonder how it looked with a faster exposure, so the juice was just hanging in mid-air.  (The thumb looks like it''s pressing pretty hard!)  9 Swash', '2003-02-21 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(220670, 12652, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot.  Very yellow, challenge well met.  Color and focus seem very good.  Framing - your choice, but it seems to work well.  Interest - well, I like it, so I find it interesting.  (The Odd flower really helps!)  9 Swash</td>', 'Very pretty shot.  Very yellow, challenge well met.  Color and focus seem very good.  Framing - your choice, but it seems to work well.  Interest - well, I like it, so I find it interesting.  (The Odd flower really helps!)  9 Swash', '2003-02-21 18:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(220672, 12615, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like bee/insect photos.  Your perspective is a hard one, but I like it well enough.  There''s NO way you''re going to get the wings and stinger in focus, as well as the head from this close.  The head is the cool part.  I am assuming this fella is dead and that it''s not "holding" the silver rod, but that it''s stuck with it.  I twists of the antennea strike me as sort of funny(humours).  9 Swash</td>', 'I really like bee/insect photos.  Your perspective is a hard one, but I like it well enough.  There''s NO way you''re going to get the wings and stinger in focus, as well as the head from this close.  The head is the cool part.  I am assuming this fella is dead and that it''s not "holding" the silver rod, but that it''s stuck with it.  I twists of the antennea strike me as sort of funny(humours).  9 Swash', '2003-02-21 18:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(220674, 12382, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower shot!  Very yellow, challenge well met.  Background is wonderfully black (good contrast).  Focus seems very good.  Framing - I don''t know, but it seems to work well for me.  9 Swash</td>', 'Pretty flower shot!  Very yellow, challenge well met.  Background is wonderfully black (good contrast).  Focus seems very good.  Framing - I don''t know, but it seems to work well for me.  9 Swash', '2003-02-21 18:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(220675, 12499, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat flower shot.  (Impossible request - could you clean up the excess pollen?)  Striking color!  Stamen seem in good focus as well as the throat, very difficult and well done!  9 Swash</td>', 'Neat flower shot.  (Impossible request - could you clean up the excess pollen?)  Striking color!  Stamen seem in good focus as well as the throat, very difficult and well done!  9 Swash', '2003-02-21 18:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(220677, 12545, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool and bizarre, you gotta like that!  Color seems very good, as does the focus.  Nice blank background.  Lighting - it''s your choice, but I''m not certain about the finger shadows (i''m not going to "ding" you for it, I really don''t know!)  8 Swash</td>', 'Cool and bizarre, you gotta like that!  Color seems very good, as does the focus.  Nice blank background.  Lighting - it''s your choice, but I''m not certain about the finger shadows (i''m not going to "ding" you for it, I really don''t know!)  8 Swash', '2003-02-21 18:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(220681, 12395, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice, but a little too orange for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice, but a little too orange for this challenge.', '2003-02-21 18:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(220682, 12581, 2158, '<td valign="top">Looks more orange than yellow to me.</td>', 'Looks more orange than yellow to me.', '2003-02-21 18:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(220684, 12651, 4411, '<td valign="top">Beautifully exposed, has a nice soft feel to it. Good composition &amp; strong colour. <br/>Outside of the challenge I think it would look even better with a bigger frame - 800x600 but with the current part of the photo at the same size so there''s more empty space.<br/>Great shot, well done.</td>', 'Beautifully exposed, has a nice soft feel to it. Good composition & strong colour. Outside of the challenge I think it would look even better with a bigger frame - 800x600 but with the current part of the photo at the same size so there''s more empty space.Great shot, well done.', '2003-02-21 18:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(220686, 12614, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and composition. I like the angle you''ve shot it from, but the background is very distracting.</td>', 'Nice focus and composition. I like the angle you''ve shot it from, but the background is very distracting.', '2003-02-21 18:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(220688, 12477, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great focus &amp; detail and the light makes the petals glow nicely. I think I would have liked it even tighter to lose the background completely, or maybe a black background but it''s still a great shot. Well done.</td>', 'Great focus & detail and the light makes the petals glow nicely. I think I would have liked it even tighter to lose the background completely, or maybe a black background but it''s still a great shot. Well done.', '2003-02-21 18:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(220689, 12491, 4411, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great job on the lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great job on the lighting.', '2003-02-21 19:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(220692, 12351, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but it really doesn''t look yellow to me.</td>', 'Nice picture, but it really doesn''t look yellow to me.', '2003-02-21 19:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(220694, 12703, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very good. Too central, but great detail &amp; lighting.</td>', 'Very good. Too central, but great detail & lighting.', '2003-02-21 19:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(220697, 12377, 3981, '<td valign="top">Clever!   I wish the focus were a bit sharper, but a 7 nevertheless for composition, lighting and creativity.</td>', 'Clever!   I wish the focus were a bit sharper, but a 7 nevertheless for composition, lighting and creativity.', '2003-02-21 19:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(220700, 12727, 2207, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2003-02-21 20:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(220703, 12433, 1570, '<td valign="top">can''t really mark you down anyway...</td>', 'can''t really mark you down anyway...', '2003-02-21 20:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(220705, 12644, 4411, '<td valign="top">LOL, cool sign, and a sentiment I couldn''t agree with more &lt;cough&gt; I mean the ''Money for Jobs'' one of course!<br/>Nicely composed &amp; framed though yellow isn''t exactly the focal point.</td>', 'LOL, cool sign, and a sentiment I couldn''t agree with more <cough> I mean the ''Money for Jobs'' one of course!Nicely composed & framed though yellow isn''t exactly the focal point.', '2003-02-21 20:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(220706, 12733, 1570, '<td valign="top">yellow?</td>', 'yellow?', '2003-02-21 20:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(220707, 12626, 4049, '<td valign="top">The pixelation and graininess of the shot is the only bad thing about it.</td>', 'The pixelation and graininess of the shot is the only bad thing about it.', '2003-02-21 20:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(220708, 12711, 4049, '<td valign="top">The light and focus could be better.</td>', 'The light and focus could be better.', '2003-02-21 21:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(220710, 12605, 6593, '<td valign="top">Great color, abstract, and composition!</td>', 'Great color, abstract, and composition!', '2003-02-21 21:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(220711, 12343, 5351, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very cool shot, however, It would be even better if you could reduce the glare on the bottom half a bit  I really really like the composition.  Good score:)</td>', 'I think this is a very cool shot, however, It would be even better if you could reduce the glare on the bottom half a bit  I really really like the composition.  Good score:)', '2003-02-21 21:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(220712, 12539, 5351, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Excellent focus - can even see the detail of the seats!  Also, I think you did a great job of not having a lot of glare - would like to know how you achieved that.  Very high score!</td>', 'Great shot!  Excellent focus - can even see the detail of the seats!  Also, I think you did a great job of not having a lot of glare - would like to know how you achieved that.  Very high score!', '2003-02-21 21:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(220713, 12719, 6593, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot! very nice.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot! very nice.', '2003-02-21 21:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(220714, 12405, 4049, '<td valign="top">Way to dull, needs more light and color.</td>', 'Way to dull, needs more light and color.', '2003-02-21 21:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(220715, 12499, 6593, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo! I like it.</td>', 'An interesting photo! I like it.', '2003-02-21 21:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(220716, 12733, 4049, '<td valign="top">That''s not yellow</td>', 'That''s not yellow', '2003-02-21 21:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(220717, 12491, 5351, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image!  Definately could see this hanging on a wall - preferably mine!  Excellent composition, color, lighting and meets the challenge very well.  I also love the border selection.  Very high score!  Good luck in the Challenge :)</td>', 'What a beautiful image!  Definately could see this hanging on a wall - preferably mine!  Excellent composition, color, lighting and meets the challenge very well.  I also love the border selection.  Very high score!  Good luck in the Challenge :)', '2003-02-21 21:30:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(220718, 12586, 5351, '<td valign="top">Neat shot - interesting architecture - meets challenge.  Good score :)</td>', 'Neat shot - interesting architecture - meets challenge.  Good score :)', '2003-02-21 21:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(220719, 12676, 6593, '<td valign="top">I like the way you used the B &amp; W colors for the body. Great composition!</td>', 'I like the way you used the B & W colors for the body. Great composition!', '2003-02-21 21:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(220720, 12727, 6593, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo - great idea and composition!</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo - great idea and composition!', '2003-02-21 21:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(220721, 12655, 5351, '<td valign="top">Good shot - though I''m not quite sure what I am looking at (hope that doesn''t make me incredably oblivious), it definately meets the challenge, the composition is good and the focus and colors are good as well!</td>', 'Good shot - though I''m not quite sure what I am looking at (hope that doesn''t make me incredably oblivious), it definately meets the challenge, the composition is good and the focus and colors are good as well!', '2003-02-21 21:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(220722, 12701, 6593, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much! It is absolutely not a usual cat photo.</td>', 'I like this photo very much! It is absolutely not a usual cat photo.', '2003-02-21 21:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(220723, 12569, 6593, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors!</td>', 'Great composition and colors!', '2003-02-21 21:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(220724, 12640, 1570, '<td valign="top">sorry, but this looks kind of sickly...</td>', 'sorry, but this looks kind of sickly...', '2003-02-21 21:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(220726, 12739, 6870, '<td valign="top">You really did capture amber! There is a lot of negative space here, so the yellow really sticks out. You might try splitting your upper half and lower half bymore or less than a half next time you take a similar picture. In other words, show more water or show more sky. That may make a more dynamic picture. Nice job.</td>', 'You really did capture amber! There is a lot of negative space here, so the yellow really sticks out. You might try splitting your upper half and lower half bymore or less than a half next time you take a similar picture. In other words, show more water or show more sky. That may make a more dynamic picture. Nice job.', '2003-02-21 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(220727, 12619, 6870, '<td valign="top">A well composed shot with the flower in the lower left third. I wish we had flowers blooming here in chilly, rainy Utah! Your most interesting light is found on the leaves to the right of the flower and on the leaf under the flower. Perhaps in a few minutes, the light may have shifted to the flower itself, or somehow set off the flower to its best advantage, but a nice shot.</td>', 'A well composed shot with the flower in the lower left third. I wish we had flowers blooming here in chilly, rainy Utah! Your most interesting light is found on the leaves to the right of the flower and on the leaf under the flower. Perhaps in a few minutes, the light may have shifted to the flower itself, or somehow set off the flower to its best advantage, but a nice shot.', '2003-02-21 21:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(220730, 12692, 6870, '<td valign="top">You may be a lichen lover like me! I love the contrasts between the black lettering amid the yellow and then the white/black lettering to the right of the photo. The variety adds a lot of interest. Luckily, the lichen is not consistent throughout, yet the levels are, so it works and it''s engaging.</td>', 'You may be a lichen lover like me! I love the contrasts between the black lettering amid the yellow and then the white/black lettering to the right of the photo. The variety adds a lot of interest. Luckily, the lichen is not consistent throughout, yet the levels are, so it works and it''s engaging.', '2003-02-21 21:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(220731, 12338, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well composed photograph. Try it in the Stock Photo challenge,too! The way the light bounces around the glass and ends up on the sides is very effective. There is some distracting noise above and behind the glass, however. Nice work.</td>', 'Well composed photograph. Try it in the Stock Photo challenge,too! The way the light bounces around the glass and ends up on the sides is very effective. There is some distracting noise above and behind the glass, however. Nice work.', '2003-02-21 21:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(220732, 12676, 6870, '<td valign="top">Bold, original idea that works for me. The theme is clearly yellow, and I like the composition. Have you tried fiddling with the light so that there is more dark, especially on the left side of the photo? That may create more contrast and more interest. Very cool work.</td>', 'Bold, original idea that works for me. The theme is clearly yellow, and I like the composition. Have you tried fiddling with the light so that there is more dark, especially on the left side of the photo? That may create more contrast and more interest. Very cool work.', '2003-02-21 22:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(220733, 12406, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ha! Film we don''t need in digital photography! Nice arrangement of this still life. The various angles of the boxes lead my eye all around to explore the photograph. The lighting helps the angles do their work. The only distraction I find is the photo''s graininess. I love grain, but I can''t see the reason for it here. Very nice work.</td>', 'Ha! Film we don''t need in digital photography! Nice arrangement of this still life. The various angles of the boxes lead my eye all around to explore the photograph. The lighting helps the angles do their work. The only distraction I find is the photo''s graininess. I love grain, but I can''t see the reason for it here. Very nice work.', '2003-02-21 22:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(220734, 12490, 6870, '<td valign="top">You really caught good light with this photo. The flower seems almost glowing, especially that ring just outside the stamens. I really enjoyed how you filled the background at the top instead of leaving a void. The flower, though stunning, isn''t enough for me, and the background still leaves things to be explored.</td>', 'You really caught good light with this photo. The flower seems almost glowing, especially that ring just outside the stamens. I really enjoyed how you filled the background at the top instead of leaving a void. The flower, though stunning, isn''t enough for me, and the background still leaves things to be explored.', '2003-02-21 22:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(220735, 12414, 6870, '<td valign="top">What you''ve captured here better than anything else are the various textures which I want to keep exploring endlessly. To this end, the lighting and depth of field are impeccable.</td>', 'What you''ve captured here better than anything else are the various textures which I want to keep exploring endlessly. To this end, the lighting and depth of field are impeccable.', '2003-02-21 22:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(220736, 12762, 6870, '<td valign="top">While the theme of this photo is only arguably yellow, the color does stand out nicely and helps to frame the child''s face in a subtle and clever way.</td>', 'While the theme of this photo is only arguably yellow, the color does stand out nicely and helps to frame the child''s face in a subtle and clever way.', '2003-02-21 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(220737, 12697, 6870, '<td valign="top">This photo caught my eye as I was browsing. I really enjoy the different shades of yellow here, the darker containing a fascinating texture.</td>', 'This photo caught my eye as I was browsing. I really enjoy the different shades of yellow here, the darker containing a fascinating texture.', '2003-02-21 22:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(220738, 12416, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the blur of the lights and the people--it shows that this is an active, engaging place. I kind of wish the bridge itself was in focus, though. Your colors and composition work well together.</td>', 'I like the blur of the lights and the people--it shows that this is an active, engaging place. I kind of wish the bridge itself was in focus, though. Your colors and composition work well together.', '2003-02-21 22:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(220739, 12705, 2170, '<td valign="top">is that a piece of paper towel?</td>', 'is that a piece of paper towel?', '2003-02-21 22:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(220740, 12405, 2170, '<td valign="top">color is not very vibrant.</td>', 'color is not very vibrant.', '2003-02-21 22:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(220741, 12562, 6870, '<td valign="top">A little blurry, but I like the rich dark textures you counter point with the yellow of the eyes.</td>', 'A little blurry, but I like the rich dark textures you counter point with the yellow of the eyes.', '2003-02-21 22:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(220742, 12723, 2170, '<td valign="top">Well, I can only guess whose shot this is -- LOL.  Congrats on two great photos this week.</td>', 'Well, I can only guess whose shot this is -- LOL.  Congrats on two great photos this week.', '2003-02-21 22:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(220743, 12421, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent excellent photo.  Great DOF.</td>', 'Excellent excellent photo.  Great DOF.', '2003-02-21 22:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(220744, 12754, 6870, '<td valign="top">A beautiful sky, and I''m curious about the weird shape on the apex of the roofline. The silhouettes set the yellows of the sky quite nicely. Try experimenting more with how much silhouette you include. For me, darks always seem more interesting (more mysterious?) than the lackluster sky colors at the top fourth of the image.</td>', 'A beautiful sky, and I''m curious about the weird shape on the apex of the roofline. The silhouettes set the yellows of the sky quite nicely. Try experimenting more with how much silhouette you include. For me, darks always seem more interesting (more mysterious?) than the lackluster sky colors at the top fourth of the image.', '2003-02-21 22:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(220745, 12386, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I''ve never gotten this technique to work...</td>', 'Nicely done.  I''ve never gotten this technique to work...', '2003-02-21 22:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(220746, 12586, 2170, '<td valign="top">Subtle and very effective.  I enjoy how the yellow is not IN YOUR FACE like so many other shots.</td>', 'Subtle and very effective.  I enjoy how the yellow is not IN YOUR FACE like so many other shots.', '2003-02-21 22:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(220747, 12501, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Good lighting.  And, best of all, you can''t see the photographer in the reflection on the can!</td>', 'Nice concept.  Good lighting.  And, best of all, you can''t see the photographer in the reflection on the can!', '2003-02-21 22:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(220748, 12584, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of this drip/drop. The most interesting thing about the drip are the little tendrils that emanate from the center. Which is why I''m puzzled at why you would crop the photo so as not to include them. It does make the image as a whole interesting to have such a void on the bottom, and I happen to really enjoy dramatically cropped images like this.</td>', 'Nice capture of this drip/drop. The most interesting thing about the drip are the little tendrils that emanate from the center. Which is why I''m puzzled at why you would crop the photo so as not to include them. It does make the image as a whole interesting to have such a void on the bottom, and I happen to really enjoy dramatically cropped images like this.', '2003-02-21 22:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(220749, 12713, 2170, '<td valign="top">I enjoy that the yellow is not the focus of the photo.</td>', 'I enjoy that the yellow is not the focus of the photo.', '2003-02-21 22:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(220750, 12389, 2170, '<td valign="top">Well captured.  A bit small, but very nice.</td>', 'Well captured.  A bit small, but very nice.', '2003-02-21 22:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(220751, 12682, 2170, '<td valign="top">i don''t know.  what am i looking at?</td>', 'i don''t know.  what am i looking at?', '2003-02-21 22:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(220752, 12655, 6870, '<td valign="top">Weird and unearthly, this photo is not only about yellow, it speaks to me that yellow can be fascinating and interesting. The pure void in the background is a perfect backdrop for the ever interesting textures. The focus or sharpness could possibly be better, but this is a nice photo for me.</td>', 'Weird and unearthly, this photo is not only about yellow, it speaks to me that yellow can be fascinating and interesting. The pure void in the background is a perfect backdrop for the ever interesting textures. The focus or sharpness could possibly be better, but this is a nice photo for me.', '2003-02-21 22:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(220753, 12515, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  One of my favorites of the week.</td>', 'Excellent!  One of my favorites of the week.', '2003-02-21 22:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(220755, 12431, 2170, '<td valign="top">i can see the seams in the towel.</td>', 'i can see the seams in the towel.', '2003-02-21 22:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(220758, 12626, 6870, '<td valign="top">A really nice photo for me. We''ve seen yellow objects on black and on other dark backgrounds, but this is original and really captivating. The colors work so well together, too. I like the yellow object in the upper left of the photo; the ice below creates a nice base that supports the whole photo.</td>', 'A really nice photo for me. We''ve seen yellow objects on black and on other dark backgrounds, but this is original and really captivating. The colors work so well together, too. I like the yellow object in the upper left of the photo; the ice below creates a nice base that supports the whole photo.', '2003-02-21 22:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(220760, 12517, 4049, '<td valign="top">you should have had him on the other side to cover up the bart in the background and be able to see homer. And bart is rather well behaved compared to most of todays children.</td>', 'you should have had him on the other side to cover up the bart in the background and be able to see homer. And bart is rather well behaved compared to most of todays children.', '2003-02-21 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(220761, 12694, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fascinating, intriguing photo. What strikes me most is the use of light. The blue sets off the yellow quite nicely.</td>', 'Fascinating, intriguing photo. What strikes me most is the use of light. The blue sets off the yellow quite nicely.', '2003-02-21 22:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(220762, 12738, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really interesting and engaging pattern; good eye. I wish there were more light/dark contrasts to keep my interest even further.</td>', 'Really interesting and engaging pattern; good eye. I wish there were more light/dark contrasts to keep my interest even further.', '2003-02-21 22:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(220763, 12324, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and nice light. the textures are fascinating, and the title is apt. Good stock photo for the other challenge, too!</td>', 'Nicely composed and nice light. the textures are fascinating, and the title is apt. Good stock photo for the other challenge, too!', '2003-02-21 22:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(220765, 12707, 6870, '<td valign="top">A really fine idea to have a B/W photo for a colored theme. The clever idea is that the yellow object is covered up, yet the focus of the photo seems to be the plug, center and left.</td>', 'A really fine idea to have a B/W photo for a colored theme. The clever idea is that the yellow object is covered up, yet the focus of the photo seems to be the plug, center and left.', '2003-02-21 22:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(220766, 12639, 6870, '<td valign="top">The photo is yellow all right. The light and dark contrasts are okay, but the yellow almost hurts my eyes because there is so much of it.</td>', 'The photo is yellow all right. The light and dark contrasts are okay, but the yellow almost hurts my eyes because there is so much of it.', '2003-02-21 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(220767, 12743, 6870, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject. I''m not sure that choosing to center the flower and the bee is the right choice here, despite the lines that lead to the center. Look how sharp the little fibres are on the step, but the bee, the center of attention, is slightly out of focus. I like the light levels at the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'An interesting subject. I''m not sure that choosing to center the flower and the bee is the right choice here, despite the lines that lead to the center. Look how sharp the little fibres are on the step, but the bee, the center of attention, is slightly out of focus. I like the light levels at the bottom of the photo.', '2003-02-21 22:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(220768, 12531, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like abstracts, and the lines here lend themselves well to it. Have you experimented with different light levels to help you pack a punch?</td>', 'I like abstracts, and the lines here lend themselves well to it. Have you experimented with different light levels to help you pack a punch?', '2003-02-21 22:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(220770, 12547, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea. Have you tried cropping so the rule of thirds could work for you? I can see why it is tempting to put the sparks right in the center, but I feel the radial nature of the event could be even more accentuated by only showing us part of it.</td>', 'Fun idea. Have you tried cropping so the rule of thirds could work for you? I can see why it is tempting to put the sparks right in the center, but I feel the radial nature of the event could be even more accentuated by only showing us part of it.', '2003-02-21 22:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(220771, 12316, 6870, '<td valign="top">A nice landscape shot. the colors really do stand against each other well.</td>', 'A nice landscape shot. the colors really do stand against each other well.', '2003-02-21 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(220772, 12653, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well composed with placement and crop. Try experimenting with contrasts; it may increase the vibrancy of your spunky lines.</td>', 'Well composed with placement and crop. Try experimenting with contrasts; it may increase the vibrancy of your spunky lines.', '2003-02-21 23:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(220773, 12690, 6870, '<td valign="top">What a great expression on this hen! I like the colors and contrasts. Experiment with raising or lowering your camera so that the photo isn''t split right in the middle by the line contrasting the straw and the blackness above.</td>', 'What a great expression on this hen! I like the colors and contrasts. Experiment with raising or lowering your camera so that the photo isn''t split right in the middle by the line contrasting the straw and the blackness above.', '2003-02-21 23:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(220774, 12684, 6870, '<td valign="top">This hydrant is quite a find! It''s bizarre textures are well captured here by the direct light that you use. Its personality may be captured even better with a little more off center cropping than is already present.</td>', 'This hydrant is quite a find! It''s bizarre textures are well captured here by the direct light that you use. Its personality may be captured even better with a little more off center cropping than is already present.', '2003-02-21 23:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(220775, 12664, 6870, '<td valign="top">An engaging, interesting image. Have you tried moving the camera around so the yellow isn''t so far to the side? The focus here is the bike.</td>', 'An engaging, interesting image. Have you tried moving the camera around so the yellow isn''t so far to the side? The focus here is the bike.', '2003-02-21 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(220776, 12711, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very formal,and formally yellow. Nice line angles created with round objects.</td>', 'Very formal,and formally yellow. Nice line angles created with round objects.', '2003-02-21 23:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(220777, 12582, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of peppers. Have you tried exploring with shadows and light? This may improve the capture of the texture of the peppers.</td>', 'Nice placement of peppers. Have you tried exploring with shadows and light? This may improve the capture of the texture of the peppers.', '2003-02-21 23:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
