(220895, 12421, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really good contrasting colours and excellent use of DOF. Did you try cropping a little lower so that the black area at the top isn''t seen?</td>', 'Really good contrasting colours and excellent use of DOF. Did you try cropping a little lower so that the black area at the top isn''t seen?', '2003-02-22 06:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(220896, 12631, 2780, '<td valign="top">I very much like the DOF here.</td>', 'I very much like the DOF here.', '2003-02-22 06:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(220897, 12755, 2780, '<td valign="top">Simple composition... and that is why I like it!</td>', 'Simple composition... and that is why I like it!', '2003-02-22 06:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(220898, 12687, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the glass seems to curve inwards nearing the top, which looks a little bit strange</td>', 'Nice composition, but the glass seems to curve inwards nearing the top, which looks a little bit strange', '2003-02-22 06:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(220899, 12503, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice.... texture! I like the little bit of black in the top right, it helps add some good contrast to the photo.</td>', 'Nice.... texture! I like the little bit of black in the top right, it helps add some good contrast to the photo.', '2003-02-22 06:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(220900, 12379, 2780, '<td valign="top">The yellow and the blue/purple work great together, and I really like the gradient. The slightly soft focus looks very effective too!</td>', 'The yellow and the blue/purple work great together, and I really like the gradient. The slightly soft focus looks very effective too!', '2003-02-22 06:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(220901, 12393, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composed well, except that the needle goes off the top of the frame slightly.</td>', 'Nice idea, composed well, except that the needle goes off the top of the frame slightly.', '2003-02-22 06:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(220902, 12529, 2780, '<td valign="top">Not a lemon? Oh, I thought it was.<br/>Anyway, nice photo, with an interesting angle you have taken it from. I like the desaturation of all the colours except yellow.</td>', 'Not a lemon? Oh, I thought it was.Anyway, nice photo, with an interesting angle you have taken it from. I like the desaturation of all the colours except yellow.', '2003-02-22 06:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(220903, 12584, 2780, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop on this, I think it works quite well.</td>', 'Interesting crop on this, I think it works quite well.', '2003-02-22 06:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(220904, 12415, 2780, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an EXCELLENT photo, I love everything about it. 10!</td>', 'Wow, this is an EXCELLENT photo, I love everything about it. 10!', '2003-02-22 06:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(220906, 12741, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice product shot, good use of DOF</td>', 'Very nice product shot, good use of DOF', '2003-02-22 06:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(220907, 12569, 2780, '<td valign="top">I agree! Ketchup makes chips (or fries if you''re american) taste so much better! Nice photo here, good vibrant colours and well composed.</td>', 'I agree! Ketchup makes chips (or fries if you''re american) taste so much better! Nice photo here, good vibrant colours and well composed.', '2003-02-22 06:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(220908, 12615, 2780, '<td valign="top">Thats a pretty nice macro!</td>', 'Thats a pretty nice macro!', '2003-02-22 06:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(220909, 12413, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept, and framed through the window looks excellent. Boosting your score to a 10.</td>', 'Very nice concept, and framed through the window looks excellent. Boosting your score to a 10.', '2003-02-22 06:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(220910, 12552, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I love the curves and the contrasts of yellow and black... Awesome</td>', 'Very nice! I love the curves and the contrasts of yellow and black... Awesome', '2003-02-22 06:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(220911, 12465, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of the flowers, and nice and sharp.</td>', 'Nice composition of the flowers, and nice and sharp.', '2003-02-22 06:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(220912, 12747, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this, good composition, and original idea for this challenge too.</td>', 'I like this, good composition, and original idea for this challenge too.', '2003-02-22 06:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(220913, 12382, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The yellow against the black background looks really good.</td>', 'Very nice photo. The yellow against the black background looks really good.', '2003-02-22 06:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(220940, 12683, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is great! Very sharp, and the desaturation of all channels but yellow is very effective in this photo. 9</td>', 'This is great! Very sharp, and the desaturation of all channels but yellow is very effective in this photo. 9', '2003-02-22 07:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(220941, 12545, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very good and original idea, I like it. I think however the hand looks a little too pink. Maybe desaturating all channels except yellow would help it.</td>', 'Very good and original idea, I like it. I think however the hand looks a little too pink. Maybe desaturating all channels except yellow would help it.', '2003-02-22 07:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(220942, 12492, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I''m not too keen on the very bright highlights on the ink.</td>', 'I like this, but I''m not too keen on the very bright highlights on the ink.', '2003-02-22 07:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(220943, 12316, 2780, '<td valign="top">The yellow and the blue work great together in this photo. Its really good, 9.</td>', 'The yellow and the blue work great together in this photo. Its really good, 9.', '2003-02-22 07:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(220944, 12685, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think this would be greatly improved by not having the shadow cut off at the bottom, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'I think this would be greatly improved by not having the shadow cut off at the bottom, but that''s just my opinion.', '2003-02-22 07:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(220948, 12323, 4815, '<td valign="top">A technically well done image. Just the perfect mix of blur and sharpness. You must have taken zillions of shots just to get the one you are happt with. The vertical format and elegant simple frame are excellent choices to accent your theme. Some folks may pick on you because of that eerie green shade. Doesn''t bother me though. I love the edge highlights on the top balloon. Good solid image.</td>', 'A technically well done image. Just the perfect mix of blur and sharpness. You must have taken zillions of shots just to get the one you are happt with. The vertical format and elegant simple frame are excellent choices to accent your theme. Some folks may pick on you because of that eerie green shade. Doesn''t bother me though. I love the edge highlights on the top balloon. Good solid image.', '2003-02-22 08:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(220949, 12738, 2978, '<td valign="top">Cool angle and rhythm of pattern. I thought I was looking at a 3-D image. I don\''t know if the apex was cropped out would make it more effective or not. Maybe it\''s distracting in someway.</td>', 'Cool angle and rhythm of pattern. I thought I was looking at a 3-D image. I don\''t know if the apex was cropped out would make it more effective or not. Maybe it\''s distracting in someway.', '2003-02-22 08:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(220950, 12754, 4815, '<td valign="top">An interesting title which encourages thoughts in a different than expected direction. And I like that. Unusual yellow greenish hues in the sky which is kinda cool. Too bad about the plane trail beside the roof peak. It looks a little bit like a bothersome hair.  But that is only a minor quibble. I would be happy with just the antennae alone without the other roof structures. But that was probably not practical from your vantage point. The brooding heavy clouds and silhouettes in the foreground are very attractive visually.Thank you for stumbling outta bed to share this lovely dawn sky with the rest of us DPC''ers.</td>', 'An interesting title which encourages thoughts in a different than expected direction. And I like that. Unusual yellow greenish hues in the sky which is kinda cool. Too bad about the plane trail beside the roof peak. It looks a little bit like a bothersome hair.  But that is only a minor quibble. I would be happy with just the antennae alone without the other roof structures. But that was probably not practical from your vantage point. The brooding heavy clouds and silhouettes in the foreground are very attractive visually.Thank you for stumbling outta bed to share this lovely dawn sky with the rest of us DPC''ers.', '2003-02-22 08:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(220951, 12618, 4815, '<td valign="top">Way sharp concept there ! Simple, graphic and nice colour. Somebody will likely get on your case about the orangeish hue. Not me. Love the spectrum of shades graduating from white through yellow/red to black. Composition, lighting, color and all that other technical blah blah stuff is up to regular pro quality. What counts in my books are your superior creativity and sense of humour. You excell there. Thank you for the refreshing entertaining perspective.</td>', 'Way sharp concept there ! Simple, graphic and nice colour. Somebody will likely get on your case about the orangeish hue. Not me. Love the spectrum of shades graduating from white through yellow/red to black. Composition, lighting, color and all that other technical blah blah stuff is up to regular pro quality. What counts in my books are your superior creativity and sense of humour. You excell there. Thank you for the refreshing entertaining perspective.', '2003-02-22 08:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(220953, 12684, 2978, '<td valign="top">I like the subject very much. But I would spend more time with it to make out the best of it.</td>', 'I like the subject very much. But I would spend more time with it to make out the best of it.', '2003-02-22 08:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(220954, 12683, 2978, '<td valign="top">Hey good catch :-) Have you tired rotate the cross to make it ''X'' or ''+''. IMO, it might make more impact.</td>', 'Hey good catch :-) Have you tired rotate the cross to make it ''X'' or ''+''. IMO, it might make more impact.', '2003-02-22 08:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(220955, 12517, 4815, '<td valign="top">Now there''s americana deluxe for you ! A lovely job of selective focus. Like your choice of composition and above all your refreshing subject matter. Nice color arrangement with the bold yellow being offset by larger areas of quiet gray and complementary patches of blue. I like this relatively informal image compared to harsh tack sharp studio shots. This feels more like human vision where the human eye normally has a very narrow plane of focus. A pleasant playful theme. Well done.</td>', 'Now there''s americana deluxe for you ! A lovely job of selective focus. Like your choice of composition and above all your refreshing subject matter. Nice color arrangement with the bold yellow being offset by larger areas of quiet gray and complementary patches of blue. I like this relatively informal image compared to harsh tack sharp studio shots. This feels more like human vision where the human eye normally has a very narrow plane of focus. A pleasant playful theme. Well done.', '2003-02-22 09:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(220956, 12333, 2978, '<td valign="top">About the composition, I would try 1/3 to give the frame more space and relate to the title.</td>', 'About the composition, I would try 1/3 to give the frame more space and relate to the title.', '2003-02-22 09:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(220959, 12656, 6803, '<td valign="top">The snow backgroud really brings out the yellow.</td>', 'The snow backgroud really brings out the yellow.', '2003-02-22 09:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(220960, 12645, 6803, '<td valign="top"></td>', '', '2003-02-22 09:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(220961, 12414, 6551, '<td valign="top">AWESOME COMPOSITION!!!!!!!</td>', 'AWESOME COMPOSITION!!!!!!!', '2003-02-22 10:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(220962, 12427, 6551, '<td valign="top">GREAT PICTURE</td>', 'GREAT PICTURE', '2003-02-22 10:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(220973, 12687, 2978, '<td valign="top">Cool macro and interesting point of view you have. However, IMO, I found that top of the frame makes the image should be cropped out a bit to balance the horizon. And is the lemon reflex on the glass is intentional?</td>', 'Cool macro and interesting point of view you have. However, IMO, I found that top of the frame makes the image should be cropped out a bit to balance the horizon. And is the lemon reflex on the glass is intentional?', '2003-02-22 10:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(220975, 12628, 2978, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love your detail on the reflex. I wonder what it is in the whole.</td>', 'Great shot. I love your detail on the reflex. I wonder what it is in the whole.', '2003-02-22 11:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(220976, 12499, 2978, '<td valign="top">This is groovy. Unfortunately, the photo is not sharp to let myself in, if I were a bee.</td>', 'This is groovy. Unfortunately, the photo is not sharp to let myself in, if I were a bee.', '2003-02-22 11:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(220978, 12321, 2978, '<td valign="top">Nice abstarct. Optical effect works. My main comment is just the background is supposed to be black: one, it hides the shadow, and two, it creates depth.</td>', 'Nice abstarct. Optical effect works. My main comment is just the background is supposed to be black: one, it hides the shadow, and two, it creates depth.', '2003-02-22 11:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(220981, 12349, 2978, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.</td>', 'Cool shot.', '2003-02-22 11:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(220982, 12351, 2978, '<td valign="top">This is more likely to be purple than yellow. It a good shot anyway. Sorry to be fuzzy about it.</td>', 'This is more likely to be purple than yellow. It a good shot anyway. Sorry to be fuzzy about it.', '2003-02-22 11:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(220983, 12638, 6597, '<td valign="top">yellow doesn''t show much</td>', 'yellow doesn''t show much', '2003-02-22 11:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(220984, 12751, 2978, '<td valign="top">The colour seems to be bleached out by the sun. I think a liitle work on post process will help, or have you done it?</td>', 'The colour seems to be bleached out by the sun. I think a liitle work on post process will help, or have you done it?', '2003-02-22 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(220986, 12404, 6597, '<td valign="top">The seeds really stand outshowing colors</td>', 'The seeds really stand outshowing colors', '2003-02-22 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(220987, 12477, 2978, '<td valign="top">wow another cool flower shot. Perfect in composition and in macro shot. I like DOF and it blurs out in the pedal. Well done. Good luck.</td>', 'wow another cool flower shot. Perfect in composition and in macro shot. I like DOF and it blurs out in the pedal. Well done. Good luck.', '2003-02-22 11:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(220989, 12334, 2978, '<td valign="top">Good shot. but the border is too fancy. It would have been better without it.</td>', 'Good shot. but the border is too fancy. It would have been better without it.', '2003-02-22 11:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(220994, 12733, 2978, '<td valign="top">Fiery image, not so yellow but I like it. The monochome is just great. What''s the white dot there? (just wonder if it''s frome the camera)</td>', 'Fiery image, not so yellow but I like it. The monochome is just great. What''s the white dot there? (just wonder if it''s frome the camera)', '2003-02-22 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(221011, 12642, 6349, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the vertical tilt, but the picture clarity color and composition are nice</td>', 'I don''t like the vertical tilt, but the picture clarity color and composition are nice', '2003-02-22 12:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(221013, 12765, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast on this and the composition is interesting as well.  I would have perhaps tried playing with the green saturation.</td>', 'I like the contrast on this and the composition is interesting as well.  I would have perhaps tried playing with the green saturation.', '2003-02-22 12:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(221014, 12593, 6349, '<td valign="top">Peace rally.  interesting place to find the yellow, much more interesting than the studio shots.  I like the contrast with the red mohawk.</td>', 'Peace rally.  interesting place to find the yellow, much more interesting than the studio shots.  I like the contrast with the red mohawk.', '2003-02-22 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(221015, 12337, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice and simple.  The lighting is interesting and the water drops add a lot to it.</td>', 'nice and simple.  The lighting is interesting and the water drops add a lot to it.', '2003-02-22 12:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(221016, 12372, 6349, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to know what this is.  I like the vine flowers and the framing but I think the composition is a bit busy.</td>', 'I''m curious to know what this is.  I like the vine flowers and the framing but I think the composition is a bit busy.', '2003-02-22 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(221018, 12557, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice rose.  Im seen so many since the cliche challenge though.  Good DOF.  I would have cut off the top outer leaf.</td>', 'Nice rose.  Im seen so many since the cliche challenge though.  Good DOF.  I would have cut off the top outer leaf.', '2003-02-22 12:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(221019, 12391, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  Nice composition and color.  What and where is this?</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  Nice composition and color.  What and where is this?', '2003-02-22 12:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(221023, 12510, 6349, '<td valign="top">no.  its one duck and his reflection.  I like the lighting on (or through) the duck.  Ther is a bit of grainyness to it and highlights along the edges that make it a big jagged.</td>', 'no.  its one duck and his reflection.  I like the lighting on (or through) the duck.  Ther is a bit of grainyness to it and highlights along the edges that make it a big jagged.', '2003-02-22 12:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(221026, 12316, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice complimentary blues and yellows/oranges.  I''m not so sure about the angle it was shot from.  It seems like the main building and the telephone tower should not be conflicting.  Great colors though.  And title.</td>', 'nice complimentary blues and yellows/oranges.  I''m not so sure about the angle it was shot from.  It seems like the main building and the telephone tower should not be conflicting.  Great colors though.  And title.', '2003-02-22 12:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(221027, 12632, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  It reminds me of all the yellow buildings i just saw on vacation in St.Croix.  The green of the window and the palm go well together.  I would have perhaps shot it either straight on or more at an angle and gotten rid of the brick wall under the tree.</td>', 'nice shot.  It reminds me of all the yellow buildings i just saw on vacation in St.Croix.  The green of the window and the palm go well together.  I would have perhaps shot it either straight on or more at an angle and gotten rid of the brick wall under the tree.', '2003-02-22 12:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(221028, 12686, 6349, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting.  Don''t like the placement in the far left bottom.  I would have liked it at the thirds or at the side with the top cut off or the right so that it wasn''t in a square frame.</td>', 'Interesting lighting.  Don''t like the placement in the far left bottom.  I would have liked it at the thirds or at the side with the top cut off or the right so that it wasn''t in a square frame.', '2003-02-22 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(221029, 12576, 6349, '<td valign="top">Well, I have no idea what this is, but I really like the refelction of the light on the knife and the serated edge.</td>', 'Well, I have no idea what this is, but I really like the refelction of the light on the knife and the serated edge.', '2003-02-22 12:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(221032, 12714, 6349, '<td valign="top">lol.  interesting.  Very modern.</td>', 'lol.  interesting.  Very modern.', '2003-02-22 12:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(221038, 12700, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Good for yellow challenge.  I would have liked to have it zoomed out to see where this phone is and who is around it that might use it.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Good for yellow challenge.  I would have liked to have it zoomed out to see where this phone is and who is around it that might use it.', '2003-02-22 13:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(221039, 12720, 6349, '<td valign="top">yum.  pineapple.  it is a bit bright for my taste.  the DOF is good, but I would like the colors to be darker in the front and lighter in the back instead.</td>', 'yum.  pineapple.  it is a bit bright for my taste.  the DOF is good, but I would like the colors to be darker in the front and lighter in the back instead.', '2003-02-22 13:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(221044, 12439, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Interesting composition.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Interesting composition.', '2003-02-22 13:07:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(221045, 12690, 6349, '<td valign="top">that hen looks grumpy.  I would have liked a little more contrast and beter lighting, but thats not your fault, I''m sure you didn''t want to disturb it.</td>', 'that hen looks grumpy.  I would have liked a little more contrast and beter lighting, but thats not your fault, I''m sure you didn''t want to disturb it.', '2003-02-22 13:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(221047, 12734, 6349, '<td valign="top">pinwheel.  Interesting idea.  Would have liked it moer on perhaps a slightly faster shutter speed. or with a group of pinwheels.</td>', 'pinwheel.  Interesting idea.  Would have liked it moer on perhaps a slightly faster shutter speed. or with a group of pinwheels.', '2003-02-22 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(221049, 12707, 6349, '<td valign="top">what?!  I was thinkning of doing a black and white as well.  Thats really a banana in the foil.  I would have liked it more if there was something I clearly would identify as yellow but lacking in saturation.  Still, I like the shot.</td>', 'what?!  I was thinkning of doing a black and white as well.  Thats really a banana in the foil.  I would have liked it more if there was something I clearly would identify as yellow but lacking in saturation.  Still, I like the shot.', '2003-02-22 13:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(221062, 12351, 6349, '<td valign="top">Um, I don''t see even a hint of a yellow sun in there.  It is a nice picture though.  I would have cropped off some of the bottom.</td>', 'Um, I don''t see even a hint of a yellow sun in there.  It is a nice picture though.  I would have cropped off some of the bottom.', '2003-02-22 13:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(221063, 12503, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture.  i would like to know what it is.  Honeycomb?</td>', 'Very nice texture.  i would like to know what it is.  Honeycomb?', '2003-02-22 13:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(221064, 12743, 4267, '<td valign="top">hocus focus.... maybe more fstop?</td>', 'hocus focus.... maybe more fstop?', '2003-02-22 13:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(221070, 12325, 6349, '<td valign="top">i would have liked different shades of yellows that were closer to actual yellow.  This was a great idea though, but I don''t really like the way the colors were arranged.</td>', 'i would have liked different shades of yellows that were closer to actual yellow.  This was a great idea though, but I don''t really like the way the colors were arranged.', '2003-02-22 13:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(221071, 12606, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Interesting perspectibe.  I like how it looks rotated 90 degrees clockwise with the shadow on the bottom, in pops out nicely.</td>', 'Nice.  Interesting perspectibe.  I like how it looks rotated 90 degrees clockwise with the shadow on the bottom, in pops out nicely.', '2003-02-22 13:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(221072, 12529, 6349, '<td valign="top">lol.  nice title.  nice hummer.  good picture.  Would have liked to see all of it and in a more interesting setting.</td>', 'lol.  nice title.  nice hummer.  good picture.  Would have liked to see all of it and in a more interesting setting.', '2003-02-22 13:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(221073, 12416, 6349, '<td valign="top">the golden gate bridge?  Great long shutter.  I would have liked the beidge to be straightened: a little rotate clockwise.</td>', 'the golden gate bridge?  Great long shutter.  I would have liked the beidge to be straightened: a little rotate clockwise.', '2003-02-22 13:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(221074, 12639, 6349, '<td valign="top">im suprised I haven''t seen more bananas.  This is a nice shot.</td>', 'im suprised I haven''t seen more bananas.  This is a nice shot.', '2003-02-22 13:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(221075, 12634, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hmm... Are Mark Wood, Martin Haswell, or one of the others?  I would have liked it made really yellow.</td>', 'Hmm... Are Mark Wood, Martin Haswell, or one of the others?  I would have liked it made really yellow.', '2003-02-22 13:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(221076, 12524, 6349, '<td valign="top">Intersting.  The colors arew a bit dull, but seeing as how this is a photograph of other art its not really your fault.</td>', 'Intersting.  The colors arew a bit dull, but seeing as how this is a photograph of other art its not really your fault.', '2003-02-22 13:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(221081, 12656, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of the yelow slicker and the composition over the shoulder looking at the winter scene.  It seems a bit snapshotish however.  I would have liked the actual scene to have been better framed and planned.</td>', 'I really like the use of the yelow slicker and the composition over the shoulder looking at the winter scene.  It seems a bit snapshotish however.  I would have liked the actual scene to have been better framed and planned.', '2003-02-22 13:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(221082, 12600, 4267, '<td valign="top">looks like a lot of jpeg artifacts.. after taking the original shot as a jpeg, when you begin editin try saving first as an uncompressed tiff file, and then save only your final image as a Jpeg</td>', 'looks like a lot of jpeg artifacts.. after taking the original shot as a jpeg, when you begin editin try saving first as an uncompressed tiff file, and then save only your final image as a Jpeg', '2003-02-22 13:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(221083, 12638, 6349, '<td valign="top">too dark, but nice composition.  should have yellowed it up.</td>', 'too dark, but nice composition.  should have yellowed it up.', '2003-02-22 13:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
