(221186, 12691, 616, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! The shadow of the banana really adds to the shot. The curvy background was a great idea. It gives the photo some substance, while not being distracting. Normally I''m not too fond of saturated photos like this, but you have done it in a way that works really well here.</td>', 'Nicely done! The shadow of the banana really adds to the shot. The curvy background was a great idea. It gives the photo some substance, while not being distracting. Normally I''m not too fond of saturated photos like this, but you have done it in a way that works really well here.', '2003-02-22 16:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
