(221203, 12555, 616, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! I just wish that it was in focus. I think that if the idea of this shot had taken another approach it would have fit in better. For a macro shot like this a clear focused shot probably works best, but thats just my two cents. Other than that this is a great shot!</td>', 'Awesome shot! I just wish that it was in focus. I think that if the idea of this shot had taken another approach it would have fit in better. For a macro shot like this a clear focused shot probably works best, but thats just my two cents. Other than that this is a great shot!', '2003-02-22 17:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
