(221219, 12490, 3032, '<td valign="top">Despite the seemingly soft focus this is one of my two favourites for this week. The color is so powerful, the composition of the front subject works out great and the background provides good balance subjectwise and great contrast lightwise.<br/>Perhaps the soft focus look is what makes this image have such a big impact on me. I just love it. 10.</td>', 'Despite the seemingly soft focus this is one of my two favourites for this week. The color is so powerful, the composition of the front subject works out great and the background provides good balance subjectwise and great contrast lightwise.Perhaps the soft focus look is what makes this image have such a big impact on me. I just love it. 10.', '2003-02-22 18:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(221220, 12642, 3032, '<td valign="top">This photo in a way communicates "liquid gold". I am not familiar with this drink and make. The colors are very powerful and the composition is very nice. Good lighting, very cleans and sharp. High rating.</td>', 'This photo in a way communicates "liquid gold". I am not familiar with this drink and make. The colors are very powerful and the composition is very nice. Good lighting, very cleans and sharp. High rating.', '2003-02-22 18:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
