(221223, 12733, 3032, '<td valign="top">Lovely pic. It looks like a very dramatic scene, like the forest is on fire and this beautiful tree in the foreground is threatened by a bush fire.  Very good capture of the tree and great background. Nice to see a bright star/planet and that the exposure didn''t leave a star trail.<br/>I like it how the trees at the right provide some framing and scale.</td>', 'Lovely pic. It looks like a very dramatic scene, like the forest is on fire and this beautiful tree in the foreground is threatened by a bush fire.  Very good capture of the tree and great background. Nice to see a bright star/planet and that the exposure didn''t leave a star trail.I like it how the trees at the right provide some framing and scale.', '2003-02-22 18:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(221224, 12674, 5684, '<td valign="top">It''s cropped too tight</td>', 'It''s cropped too tight', '2003-02-22 18:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
