(221226, 12414, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great use of dof here. The background is completely blurred and provides great background contrast for the bee. The lower right corner is soft as well and thus transfers all attention to the bee.<br/>I love the detail of the wings. Good strong color.</td>', 'Great use of dof here. The background is completely blurred and provides great background contrast for the bee. The lower right corner is soft as well and thus transfers all attention to the bee.I love the detail of the wings. Good strong color.', '2003-02-22 18:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(221229, 12727, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great concept, good lighting and setup. I would have liked it to be sharper though and the rope around the neck is pushing it a bit.<br/>Good artistic nude shot. 7<br/></td>', 'Great concept, good lighting and setup. I would have liked it to be sharper though and the rope around the neck is pushing it a bit.Good artistic nude shot. 7', '2003-02-22 18:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(221232, 12691, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice background and the shadow adds a lot of power to this image. Could benefit from a third to two third stop faster shutter I think. The right side with is more balance lighting is much nicer to look at than the highlighted left side.</td>', 'Nice background and the shadow adds a lot of power to this image. Could benefit from a third to two third stop faster shutter I think. The right side with is more balance lighting is much nicer to look at than the highlighted left side.', '2003-02-22 18:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
