(221235, 12571, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great pic. The joy on the face is wonderfull and the sledge she''s holding seems to explain that expression. Good camerawork, nice soft background and excellent exposure (good snow, great yellow and no blowouts/highlights).</td>', 'Great pic. The joy on the face is wonderfull and the sledge she''s holding seems to explain that expression. Good camerawork, nice soft background and excellent exposure (good snow, great yellow and no blowouts/highlights).', '2003-02-22 19:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
