(221272, 12723, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  This is a good example I think of a candid, not set up shot that still manages to look professional and not like a snap shot.  I would have liked her on the right side of the frame instead so the dress could sweep into the space behind her, but you caught it how you caught it and its fine.  Th colors are nice and the image is crisp and clear.  nice job. 7</td>', 'Very nice shot.  This is a good example I think of a candid, not set up shot that still manages to look professional and not like a snap shot.  I would have liked her on the right side of the frame instead so the dress could sweep into the space behind her, but you caught it how you caught it and its fine.  Th colors are nice and the image is crisp and clear.  nice job. 7', '2003-02-22 19:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
