(221327, 12533, 4815, '<td valign="top">Very funny creative take ! I like the basic composition. Although it would have been even more extreme I would have covered one black eye totally with the curled pinky. So that the viewer''s attention doesn''t bounce back and forth between two black spots. A minor suggestion only. I very much like the smile curve being repeated by the thumb and finger . Although this may not have been practical in your situation I would have opted for stronger harsh side lighting to bring a darker more oppressive mood to the image. The advantage of flash is getting color when you need it. But the highlights and glare have a tendency to flatten objects by eliminating texture with front lighting. Close up photography is challenging always. Thank you for the humourous light hearted entry.</td>', 'Very funny creative take ! I like the basic composition. Although it would have been even more extreme I would have covered one black eye totally with the curled pinky. So that the viewer''s attention doesn''t bounce back and forth between two black spots. A minor suggestion only. I very much like the smile curve being repeated by the thumb and finger . Although this may not have been practical in your situation I would have opted for stronger harsh side lighting to bring a darker more oppressive mood to the image. The advantage of flash is getting color when you need it. But the highlights and glare have a tendency to flatten objects by eliminating texture with front lighting. Close up photography is challenging always. Thank you for the humourous light hearted entry.', '2003-02-22 19:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(221328, 12572, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice image.  i would have gotten lower to the ground for a more interesting perspective and probablly used a slower shutter speed to get the feeling of the water flowing and also a better depth of field so the flower would be a little crisper.  5</td>', 'nice image.  i would have gotten lower to the ground for a more interesting perspective and probablly used a slower shutter speed to get the feeling of the water flowing and also a better depth of field so the flower would be a little crisper.  5', '2003-02-22 19:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(221331, 12738, 6349, '<td valign="top">i was surprised to not see more buses in this challenge.  Even if there were others, I''m sure this would have been the best one.  I really like the composition.  I think it would have been interesting to crop out the top and bottom and just make a long strip and to have had a smaller aperature. 5</td>', 'i was surprised to not see more buses in this challenge.  Even if there were others, I''m sure this would have been the best one.  I really like the composition.  I think it would have been interesting to crop out the top and bottom and just make a long strip and to have had a smaller aperature. 5', '2003-02-22 19:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(221333, 12335, 6349, '<td valign="top">lol.  Love the subject.  Would have benefited from a larger or smaller aperature (its just a little bit blurry in the back which i find bothersome, choose one or the other) and the composition is very good except for the one in the foreground that is too much in the corner.  I would have swung around to the right a little and left him out all together.  It''s not really that yellow either, but I don''t mind :)  5</td>', 'lol.  Love the subject.  Would have benefited from a larger or smaller aperature (its just a little bit blurry in the back which i find bothersome, choose one or the other) and the composition is very good except for the one in the foreground that is too much in the corner.  I would have swung around to the right a little and left him out all together.  It''s not really that yellow either, but I don''t mind :)  5', '2003-02-22 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(221334, 12369, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and artistic.  I picked out your rhythm one as well but I can''t vote since I''m not a member.  It was great too.  7</td>', 'Very interesting and artistic.  I picked out your rhythm one as well but I can''t vote since I''m not a member.  It was great too.  7', '2003-02-22 19:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
