(221469, 12706, 714, '<td valign="top">This shot is pretty good.  I would suggest using less ripe bananas.  The lighting is to bright on the pinapple.  When I take a picture for a challeng I usually take 20-100 pictures.  I end up deleting all but about 5 pictures.  Try to use different angles and lighting the subject at different angles.  I like the table cloth and wooded background but some might not.  Try to think of different backgrounds that you think would make the subject stand out and look better.  Do you know how to use your aperture settings?  It is very interesting to mess with the dof and shutter speeds.  Good luck and hope this helps.</td>', 'This shot is pretty good.  I would suggest using less ripe bananas.  The lighting is to bright on the pinapple.  When I take a picture for a challeng I usually take 20-100 pictures.  I end up deleting all but about 5 pictures.  Try to use different angles and lighting the subject at different angles.  I like the table cloth and wooded background but some might not.  Try to think of different backgrounds that you think would make the subject stand out and look better.  Do you know how to use your aperture settings?  It is very interesting to mess with the dof and shutter speeds.  Good luck and hope this helps.', '2003-02-23 00:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
