(221607, 12676, 5475, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but for the life of me, I can''t figureout what her waist size is!!  Idon''t understand your measuring tape.  How did you get this to desaturate flesh tones without affecting the yellow of the tape?  I''ve tried this technique and I''ve had a hard time separating fleshtones from yellows.  Great job, nice image and good luck in the challenge.  8</td>', 'Nice image, but for the life of me, I can''t figureout what her waist size is!!  Idon''t understand your measuring tape.  How did you get this to desaturate flesh tones without affecting the yellow of the tape?  I''ve tried this technique and I''ve had a hard time separating fleshtones from yellows.  Great job, nice image and good luck in the challenge.  8', '2003-02-23 13:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
