(221648, 12515, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love this (and it''s not just because I''m desperate to go back on safari). It puts into mind the safari pictures of old - and also reminds me of a magazine advert in style. I like the way we only see the back of the cheetah but see the shape of the rest of him in his silhouette. <br/>Lighting is just a touch harsh on his legs and the bowl behind his back feet distracts from the legs/ feet.<br/>Overall a great shot (and well cropped).<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'I love this (and it''s not just because I''m desperate to go back on safari). It puts into mind the safari pictures of old - and also reminds me of a magazine advert in style. I like the way we only see the back of the cheetah but see the shape of the rest of him in his silhouette. Lighting is just a touch harsh on his legs and the bowl behind his back feet distracts from the legs/ feet.Overall a great shot (and well cropped).8, Kavey', '2003-02-23 14:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
