(221672, 12630, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent composition... the color of the rope is very strong here and the diagonal orientation of the arms intersecting with the rope makes the composition very strong.. nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent composition... the color of the rope is very strong here and the diagonal orientation of the arms intersecting with the rope makes the composition very strong.. nice work :) - setzler', '2003-02-23 14:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(221673, 12754, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours and cloud shapes in the sky - romanticism bought back down to earth with a bump by the silhouette shapes. I''d love to see this with something more interesting as the silhouette shape.</td>', 'Wonderful colours and cloud shapes in the sky - romanticism bought back down to earth with a bump by the silhouette shapes. I''d love to see this with something more interesting as the silhouette shape.', '2003-02-23 14:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(221674, 12645, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the CF card is doing in the frame... I must be missing something?<br/>I would have scored this 6 or 7 without the CF card.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Not sure what the CF card is doing in the frame... I must be missing something?I would have scored this 6 or 7 without the CF card.5, Kavey', '2003-02-23 14:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(221678, 12638, 3087, '<td valign="top">The vivid yellowness of the border makes the much paler yellow of the custard look much less yellow in comparison.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'The vivid yellowness of the border makes the much paler yellow of the custard look much less yellow in comparison.5, Kavey', '2003-02-23 14:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(221680, 12580, 6930, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed.  Fits the brief well too.</td>', 'Great idea and well executed.  Fits the brief well too.', '2003-02-23 15:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(221683, 12344, 6930, '<td valign="top">Never photogaraph flowers with direct sunlight on them.<br/>Never photograph leaves that have been eaten by insects.</td>', 'Never photogaraph flowers with direct sunlight on them.Never photograph leaves that have been eaten by insects.', '2003-02-23 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(221684, 12692, 6930, '<td valign="top">There must have been other headstones in the graveyard that haven''t been scraped clean.  The only thing good is the sidelighting.  I don''t think that dead kids are good subject material either.</td>', 'There must have been other headstones in the graveyard that haven''t been scraped clean.  The only thing good is the sidelighting.  I don''t think that dead kids are good subject material either.', '2003-02-23 16:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(221685, 12531, 1570, '<td valign="top">nice colors and contrast! yellow is a bit flat...</td>', 'nice colors and contrast! yellow is a bit flat...', '2003-02-23 16:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(221686, 12476, 1570, '<td valign="top">lovely blue... your yellow contrasts very well with it... i would''ve cropped more on the left and left more blue on the right, but either way, great job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-04-10 19:32:44.</i></td>', 'lovely blue... your yellow contrasts very well with it... i would''ve cropped more on the left and left more blue on the right, but either way, great job!', '2003-02-23 16:08:50.000000', '2003-04-10 20:32:44.000000', 1),
(221688, 12619, 4411, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of DoF to lose the background but not to the point where it''s unrecognisable. I like this a lot. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely use of DoF to lose the background but not to the point where it''s unrecognisable. I like this a lot. Well done.', '2003-02-23 16:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(221690, 12538, 4338, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot, but looks too dark . Some different lighting or more lighting would help this pic out.</td>', 'this is a nice shot, but looks too dark . Some different lighting or more lighting would help this pic out.', '2003-02-23 16:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(221691, 12702, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and a cool looking car. I don''t like the chain across the door, but I guess you couldn''t do much about that. I really like all the catch lights. Framing is great, as is exposure &amp; focus. Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot and a cool looking car. I don''t like the chain across the door, but I guess you couldn''t do much about that. I really like all the catch lights. Framing is great, as is exposure & focus. Well done.', '2003-02-23 16:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(221696, 12575, 4411, '<td valign="top">Heh I nearly submitted a sponge shot! Would have preferred a black background to contrast with the sponge but otherwise this is very good. Well done.</td>', 'Heh I nearly submitted a sponge shot! Would have preferred a black background to contrast with the sponge but otherwise this is very good. Well done.', '2003-02-23 17:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(221697, 12427, 4411, '<td valign="top">Wow. Fantastic detail &amp; texture on the lemon. Not sure about the blue pebbles, but the composition of the lemon is perfect. Great shot, well done.</td>', 'Wow. Fantastic detail & texture on the lemon. Not sure about the blue pebbles, but the composition of the lemon is perfect. Great shot, well done.', '2003-02-23 17:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(221699, 12382, 4411, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Great focus &amp; detail and well lit. I really like the layered look to this which gives it a real feeling of depth. Well done.</td>', 'Stunning. Great focus & detail and well lit. I really like the layered look to this which gives it a real feeling of depth. Well done.', '2003-02-23 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(221700, 12637, 4411, '<td valign="top">Looks like you ran out of bananas half way through! ; )<br/>I don''t like the orange being in shot, and you should have pulled the label off the banana, but otherwise it''s pretty cool. The bananas contrast well against the paving slabs, and there''s a nice mix of soft natural texture and harsh man made texture.</td>', 'Looks like you ran out of bananas half way through! ; )I don''t like the orange being in shot, and you should have pulled the label off the banana, but otherwise it''s pretty cool. The bananas contrast well against the paving slabs, and there''s a nice mix of soft natural texture and harsh man made texture.', '2003-02-23 17:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(221701, 12761, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''ll ignore the hotspots - not your fault.<br/>This is lovely. Focus &amp; detail are great. What I really like is the deep yellow colour and the strong lines &amp; shadows on the petals. Excellent work, well done.</td>', 'I''ll ignore the hotspots - not your fault.This is lovely. Focus & detail are great. What I really like is the deep yellow colour and the strong lines & shadows on the petals. Excellent work, well done.', '2003-02-23 17:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(221704, 12610, 4411, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture, you must have a great deal of patience to do this! Great shot, well done.</td>', 'Stunning capture, you must have a great deal of patience to do this! Great shot, well done.', '2003-02-23 17:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(221705, 12539, 2158, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity one cannot see the headlights.</td>', 'It''s a pity one cannot see the headlights.', '2003-02-23 17:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(221706, 12637, 2337, '<td valign="top">Possibly so... But you certainly have a unique viewpoint, and a refreshing sense of humor :)  Also,  it has a lot of technical merit as well.  I like the angle... Very creative...</td>', 'Possibly so... But you certainly have a unique viewpoint, and a refreshing sense of humor :)  Also,  it has a lot of technical merit as well.  I like the angle... Very creative...', '2003-02-23 18:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(221707, 12338, 6405, '<td valign="top">Your color is orange!!</td>', 'Your color is orange!!', '2003-02-23 18:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(221708, 12484, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice angle... An image with a message.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice angle... An image with a message.  Well done.', '2003-02-23 18:02:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(221709, 12351, 6405, '<td valign="top">It is PINK to me!!</td>', 'It is PINK to me!!', '2003-02-23 18:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(221716, 12524, 4815, '<td valign="top">I like the rough informal hand drawn elements in this image. The colors are comfortable to view.  Your chioce of composition is quite unusual compared to standard rules of the road. Good for you. Measures versus freestyle lines.  Order versus spontaneity. The red blossum on the left does drag my attention over to that edge strongly. And  the numbers plus the top edge of the grey triangle also encourage the viewer to be more attentive along the horizontal centre of the frame compared to elsewhere. To increase the movement in the image I would personally skew the ruler on a diagonal and hide a portion of the rose beneath the ruled corner. But that is just me. Other than that your technique is fine. Compostion and choice of subject matter is a personal choice. If you are happy with it that is all that matters. An interesting image. Thank you for participating this week.</td>', 'I like the rough informal hand drawn elements in this image. The colors are comfortable to view.  Your chioce of composition is quite unusual compared to standard rules of the road. Good for you. Measures versus freestyle lines.  Order versus spontaneity. The red blossum on the left does drag my attention over to that edge strongly. And  the numbers plus the top edge of the grey triangle also encourage the viewer to be more attentive along the horizontal centre of the frame compared to elsewhere. To increase the movement in the image I would personally skew the ruler on a diagonal and hide a portion of the rose beneath the ruled corner. But that is just me. Other than that your technique is fine. Compostion and choice of subject matter is a personal choice. If you are happy with it that is all that matters. An interesting image. Thank you for participating this week.', '2003-02-23 18:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(221717, 12614, 4815, '<td valign="top">Ah the irresistable allure of blossums. At such close range the DOF is very shallow. And you have done an admirable job getting that pistil in focus. The red, soft yellows and fuzzy greens in the background are all easy on the eye colors. The red blotch and the stamen tips do compete for the viewer''s attention in my opinion.  Although you may object to this could I offer the suggestion of perhaps holding your own backdrop behind the subject. It could be fuzzy green, flat black or even another handful of petals. Just to make the background more uniform and more supportive to the main visual element of interest. I think this may have been interesting also as a vertical format. With a single blossum placed atop a mirror reflecting blue sky with a few white puffies. Another study on those beautiful lines and folds of the petals themselves would also be nice with strong warm backlighting. This is a pleasant flower shot that meets the challenge. Good work.</td>', 'Ah the irresistable allure of blossums. At such close range the DOF is very shallow. And you have done an admirable job getting that pistil in focus. The red, soft yellows and fuzzy greens in the background are all easy on the eye colors. The red blotch and the stamen tips do compete for the viewer''s attention in my opinion.  Although you may object to this could I offer the suggestion of perhaps holding your own backdrop behind the subject. It could be fuzzy green, flat black or even another handful of petals. Just to make the background more uniform and more supportive to the main visual element of interest. I think this may have been interesting also as a vertical format. With a single blossum placed atop a mirror reflecting blue sky with a few white puffies. Another study on those beautiful lines and folds of the petals themselves would also be nice with strong warm backlighting. This is a pleasant flower shot that meets the challenge. Good work.', '2003-02-23 18:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(221720, 12626, 4815, '<td valign="top">Vivid powerful colors in this image hold the viewer''s attention. Love the deep deep blue of the textured ice. Perfect composition, color and DOF. Yes you need lots of blue to balance that punch of yellow.  It almost feels like a marble rolling on broken glass because you think twice about the scale. I must say that the foreground ice bits really steal the show for me. Such a beautiful abstract pattern right in that portion of the frame. A well executed shot.</td>', 'Vivid powerful colors in this image hold the viewer''s attention. Love the deep deep blue of the textured ice. Perfect composition, color and DOF. Yes you need lots of blue to balance that punch of yellow.  It almost feels like a marble rolling on broken glass because you think twice about the scale. I must say that the foreground ice bits really steal the show for me. Such a beautiful abstract pattern right in that portion of the frame. A well executed shot.', '2003-02-23 18:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(221723, 12315, 4815, '<td valign="top">OK we have two kittens as well so you automatically get a 10...there. You have done a superb job of capturing a rather hyperactive creature. No blur and no red eye which is common in about the other 999 shots. I love the playful pose and how the subject is framed by beautiful yellow folds. Not to mention those gorgeous yellow peepers. The fur color and blanket color are a touch off the normal beaten path. But artistic license is legal in my jurisdiction. The pink paw pads and whiskies are heart melting...ahhhhh. Purrfection if you ask me (ha ha).</td>', 'OK we have two kittens as well so you automatically get a 10...there. You have done a superb job of capturing a rather hyperactive creature. No blur and no red eye which is common in about the other 999 shots. I love the playful pose and how the subject is framed by beautiful yellow folds. Not to mention those gorgeous yellow peepers. The fur color and blanket color are a touch off the normal beaten path. But artistic license is legal in my jurisdiction. The pink paw pads and whiskies are heart melting...ahhhhh. Purrfection if you ask me (ha ha).', '2003-02-23 19:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(221724, 12627, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like this abstract and I think this is very creative (well, creativity inspired by Mr. Close probably, but that''s ok).<br/>The grid maybe is a little bit too thick because the flower is almost not recognisable, but maybe that was intened.<br/>It takes some time until you notice that some of the spaces are filled with water and create a refraction. There seems to be no pattern though.<br/>If this photo was inspired by a spcific painting from Chuck Close, I would like to know which one. I looked on the Web for a while but didn''t fine one.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like this abstract and I think this is very creative (well, creativity inspired by Mr. Close probably, but that''s ok).The grid maybe is a little bit too thick because the flower is almost not recognisable, but maybe that was intened.It takes some time until you notice that some of the spaces are filled with water and create a refraction. There seems to be no pattern though.If this photo was inspired by a spcific painting from Chuck Close, I would like to know which one. I looked on the Web for a while but didn''t fine one.', '2003-02-23 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(221725, 12413, 2221, '<td valign="top">Good use of framing. I like the idea you had, showing how the roof is "touched" by nature i.e. the moss. A good title, really poetic.</td>', 'Good use of framing. I like the idea you had, showing how the roof is "touched" by nature i.e. the moss. A good title, really poetic.', '2003-02-23 19:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(221727, 12491, 2221, '<td valign="top">A cliche, but perfectly done! Lighting, focus, composition, even the finishing border is very professional. Excellent job!</td>', 'A cliche, but perfectly done! Lighting, focus, composition, even the finishing border is very professional. Excellent job!', '2003-02-23 19:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(221729, 12564, 5995, '<td valign="top">call me next time</td>', 'call me next time', '2003-02-23 19:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(221730, 12643, 5995, '<td valign="top">nice job, I get pictures like that but never can get the back ground that nice</td>', 'nice job, I get pictures like that but never can get the back ground that nice', '2003-02-23 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(221732, 12416, 2221, '<td valign="top">Could have been a great shot if you had used a tripod or something. The colour contrast between the blue sky and the yellow lighting is nice, though.</td>', 'Could have been a great shot if you had used a tripod or something. The colour contrast between the blue sky and the yellow lighting is nice, though.', '2003-02-23 19:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(221735, 12719, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful! I love the yellow/green colours. Looks almost a bit "magical".</td>', 'Very beautiful! I love the yellow/green colours. Looks almost a bit "magical".', '2003-02-23 19:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(221736, 12733, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow! I like the colouring. Not exactly yellow but it comes close. The dark spot on the lower left side is a bit distracting, but that''s only a minor issue. Great photo!</td>', 'Wow! I like the colouring. Not exactly yellow but it comes close. The dark spot on the lower left side is a bit distracting, but that''s only a minor issue. Great photo!', '2003-02-23 19:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(221757, 12324, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot. Very nice back lighting. Good colors &amp; contrast.</td>', 'Great macro shot. Very nice back lighting. Good colors & contrast.', '2003-02-23 20:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(221759, 12627, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Very creative.</td>', 'Great shot. Very creative.', '2003-02-23 20:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(221760, 12513, 2716, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why but this picture is engrained into my bain.  i absolutely love it.  has a tiny bit of an absurd edge to it; which i good.  Beautiful placement of the subjects in the frame.  Good luck.  My favorite so far.  Jacko.   10</td>', 'Don''t know why but this picture is engrained into my bain.  i absolutely love it.  has a tiny bit of an absurd edge to it; which i good.  Beautiful placement of the subjects in the frame.  Good luck.  My favorite so far.  Jacko.   10', '2003-02-23 20:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(221762, 12683, 6536, '<td valign="top">.</td>', '.', '2003-02-23 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(221763, 12723, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a cutie.  Must in Mexico, taken by a classy older guy.  Good job.</td>', 'Wow, what a cutie.  Must in Mexico, taken by a classy older guy.  Good job.', '2003-02-23 20:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(221764, 12386, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Wonderful panning shot.  I''d like to see the whole car (rear bumper cut out), however still a great shot.  Jacko.   9</td>', 'Wow!  Wonderful panning shot.  I''d like to see the whole car (rear bumper cut out), however still a great shot.  Jacko.   9', '2003-02-23 20:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(221767, 12431, 3419, '<td valign="top">Due to light reflection back towards the camera, the photo seems out of focus. The blue chips seem especially soft.</td>', 'Due to light reflection back towards the camera, the photo seems out of focus. The blue chips seem especially soft.', '2003-02-23 21:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(221768, 12733, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo - great capture of detail. However, this is orange, not yellow, so does not meet the challenge..</td>', 'Very nice photo - great capture of detail. However, this is orange, not yellow, so does not meet the challenge..', '2003-02-23 21:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(221769, 12377, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very yellow! What I like about this photo is the various shades and textures of yellow.The title is appropriate as well, and sets the tone for the image. The subtle shadows work well for me, making it three dimensional yet not calling attention to the shadows themselves. Had you considered shooting against a dark or black background? I''m not sure if this would help or not, but it may be worth exploring. Nice work.</td>', 'Very yellow! What I like about this photo is the various shades and textures of yellow.The title is appropriate as well, and sets the tone for the image. The subtle shadows work well for me, making it three dimensional yet not calling attention to the shadows themselves. Had you considered shooting against a dark or black background? I''m not sure if this would help or not, but it may be worth exploring. Nice work.', '2003-02-23 21:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(221770, 12724, 3419, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh and bright. Would prefer softer lighting. Did you try capturing this at different times of the day?</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh and bright. Would prefer softer lighting. Did you try capturing this at different times of the day?', '2003-02-23 21:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(221772, 12335, 3419, '<td valign="top">There isn''t much yellow here, and I would call the legs "more orange" than yellow. Does not meet the challenge well. Good eye for catching this scene. White chests look over-exposed, causing loss of feather detail.</td>', 'There isn''t much yellow here, and I would call the legs "more orange" than yellow. Does not meet the challenge well. Good eye for catching this scene. White chests look over-exposed, causing loss of feather detail.', '2003-02-23 21:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(221773, 12730, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, especially to see the yellow tape on the wood--right where it belongs. So it isn''t just a shot of yellow or of tape measure, but a suggestion of task and practicality as well. Well composed: the angles work for me, especially the horizontal shadow behind the tape contrasting with the tape itself.</td>', 'I like this photo, especially to see the yellow tape on the wood--right where it belongs. So it isn''t just a shot of yellow or of tape measure, but a suggestion of task and practicality as well. Well composed: the angles work for me, especially the horizontal shadow behind the tape contrasting with the tape itself.', '2003-02-23 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(221774, 12372, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the yellow glass . . . thing . . . diffusing the light from the window. The direction from the left creates some nice textures on the glass. It seems out of focus to me, which is puzzling since the glass is so sharply textured.</td>', 'I like the idea of the yellow glass . . . thing . . . diffusing the light from the window. The direction from the left creates some nice textures on the glass. It seems out of focus to me, which is puzzling since the glass is so sharply textured.', '2003-02-23 21:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(221775, 12693, 3419, '<td valign="top">Creative idea - I like the contrast between the blue and the yellow. The cups handle is too soft, and while focus looks good on the yellow ?smarties?, the light reflecting off them is a little bright.</td>', 'Creative idea - I like the contrast between the blue and the yellow. The cups handle is too soft, and while focus looks good on the yellow ?smarties?, the light reflecting off them is a little bright.', '2003-02-23 21:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(221777, 12735, 3419, '<td valign="top">Could use some sharpening. Good color, composition and lighting.</td>', 'Could use some sharpening. Good color, composition and lighting.', '2003-02-23 21:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(221778, 12323, 6870, '<td valign="top">A clever idea and good suggestion of movement. I''m sure this took many tries, but I kind of wish the blurry balloon ghost image were more even. Have you also tried only one light source? It may be interesting to experiment with.</td>', 'A clever idea and good suggestion of movement. I''m sure this took many tries, but I kind of wish the blurry balloon ghost image were more even. Have you also tried only one light source? It may be interesting to experiment with.', '2003-02-23 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(221780, 12524, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice - good color and capture of detail.</td>', 'Very nice - good color and capture of detail.', '2003-02-23 21:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(221781, 12642, 6870, '<td valign="top">This all-yellow photo works for me more than most others because the yellow is a softer, less intense hue, and the lines of the bottles and the shadows provide lots of interest, not to mention the lettering. Nice lines, nice angles. A well done photo!</td>', 'This all-yellow photo works for me more than most others because the yellow is a softer, less intense hue, and the lines of the bottles and the shadows provide lots of interest, not to mention the lettering. Nice lines, nice angles. A well done photo!', '2003-02-23 21:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(221782, 12575, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, color, and capture of detail. Interesting composition and subject matter.</td>', 'Good lighting, color, and capture of detail. Interesting composition and subject matter.', '2003-02-23 21:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(221783, 12525, 3419, '<td valign="top">The bright spot is a little distracting, but very nicely done otherwise.</td>', 'The bright spot is a little distracting, but very nicely done otherwise.', '2003-02-23 21:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(221784, 12491, 6870, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this photo is impeccable, I feel. There is a good, simple elegance to the lines and to the balance. Add a sense of mystery to it with the deep shadows, and this is a solid photo. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'The lighting on this photo is impeccable, I feel. There is a good, simple elegance to the lines and to the balance. Add a sense of mystery to it with the deep shadows, and this is a solid photo. Thanks for sharing.', '2003-02-23 21:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(221785, 12415, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Very pretty scene. Nicely captured.', '2003-02-23 21:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(221786, 12409, 6870, '<td valign="top">An interesting study of lines. The chrome frames and adds structure to the dull yellow. It is quite a simple photograph, and I don''t find myself wanting to look at it for a long time. Is there a way to add interest or mystery?</td>', 'An interesting study of lines. The chrome frames and adds structure to the dull yellow. It is quite a simple photograph, and I don''t find myself wanting to look at it for a long time. Is there a way to add interest or mystery?', '2003-02-23 21:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(221787, 12570, 3419, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - I know what shade of yellow I think these are supposed to be.  Are the buttons supposed to be the same shade? They look green to me. Perhaps brighter lighting would have captured the color more accurately?</td>', 'Hmmm - I know what shade of yellow I think these are supposed to be.  Are the buttons supposed to be the same shade? They look green to me. Perhaps brighter lighting would have captured the color more accurately?', '2003-02-23 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(221788, 12365, 3419, '<td valign="top">Bright reflection off the lemons is a little distracting. I''m not a guy, but do you know what these look like to me? Deliberately composed this way?  hee hee hee! Cute!</td>', 'Bright reflection off the lemons is a little distracting. I''m not a guy, but do you know what these look like to me? Deliberately composed this way?  hee hee hee! Cute!', '2003-02-23 21:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(221789, 12415, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the twigs reach up toward the sky in this photo,and the placement of the sun balanced against the tallest bush/tree. The most interesting thing about the photo, after the initial noticing the sun and trees are the smaller clouds, which seem to glow. I wish there were a way to give them even more attention, for they are the objects with the interesting light.</td>', 'I like how the twigs reach up toward the sky in this photo,and the placement of the sun balanced against the tallest bush/tree. The most interesting thing about the photo, after the initial noticing the sun and trees are the smaller clouds, which seem to glow. I wish there were a way to give them even more attention, for they are the objects with the interesting light.', '2003-02-23 21:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(221791, 12473, 3419, '<td valign="top">Color is good, but would be a better photo if the printed words were in focus. Also crop off that black spot in the top left corner.</td>', 'Color is good, but would be a better photo if the printed words were in focus. Also crop off that black spot in the top left corner.', '2003-02-23 21:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
