(221796, 12513, 6870, '<td valign="top">A delightfully quirky image. Here, the yellow acts as both a frame and adds details. Her expression is quirky as well. I''m not sure what to think or how to react to her or to this image, but I do find it engaging.</td>', 'A delightfully quirky image. Here, the yellow acts as both a frame and adds details. Her expression is quirky as well. I''m not sure what to think or how to react to her or to this image, but I do find it engaging.', '2003-02-23 21:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
