(221847, 12413, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well framed and interesting. Though there is not much of it, yellow really is the theme here. It is very clear where to look, though I don''t mind exploring with my eye, and it is very clear what I''m look at. Nice work.</td>', 'Well framed and interesting. Though there is not much of it, yellow really is the theme here. It is very clear where to look, though I don''t mind exploring with my eye, and it is very clear what I''m look at. Nice work.', '2003-02-23 22:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
