(221944, 12539, 3419, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, good focus, and capture of detail. Well done.</td>', 'Great lighting, good focus, and capture of detail. Well done.', '2003-02-23 23:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(221945, 12427, 3419, '<td valign="top">It looks so real, which is compliment to your technical execution. Very nicely captured!</td>', 'It looks so real, which is compliment to your technical execution. Very nicely captured!', '2003-02-23 23:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(221946, 12758, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, but could be improved by crisper focus. Too soft overall.</td>', 'Nice abstract, but could be improved by crisper focus. Too soft overall.', '2003-02-23 23:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(221947, 12337, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good composition, color and capture of the water drops. Well done.</td>', 'Good composition, color and capture of the water drops. Well done.', '2003-02-23 23:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(221948, 12711, 4210, '<td valign="top">I might have tried blue marbles instead of black, to make them stand out against the background. But I guess that was the effect you were trying to minimize, so nevermind.</td>', 'I might have tried blue marbles instead of black, to make them stand out against the background. But I guess that was the effect you were trying to minimize, so nevermind.', '2003-02-23 23:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(221949, 12377, 1031, '<td valign="top">Mayonnaise in the raw...</td>', 'Mayonnaise in the raw...', '2003-02-23 23:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(221950, 12397, 3419, '<td valign="top">I find the cabinet behind the candles to be distracting. Good capture of the candle flames which are nicely exposed.</td>', 'I find the cabinet behind the candles to be distracting. Good capture of the candle flames which are nicely exposed.', '2003-02-23 23:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(221951, 12637, 3419, '<td valign="top">Your idea is creative. Different lighting and a darker background would bring out more color in the fruit.</td>', 'Your idea is creative. Different lighting and a darker background would bring out more color in the fruit.', '2003-02-23 23:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(221952, 12338, 4210, '<td valign="top">Less negative space needed.</td>', 'Less negative space needed.', '2003-02-23 23:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(221954, 12634, 1031, '<td valign="top">Had no idea it was a world-wide standard!</td>', 'Had no idea it was a world-wide standard!', '2003-02-23 23:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(221956, 12391, 3419, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice abstract, rich in color, and nicely captured.</td>', 'This is a very nice abstract, rich in color, and nicely captured.', '2003-02-23 23:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(221958, 12610, 3419, '<td valign="top">Hopefully you had no cuts or scratches on your hands (ouch). Too bright on the thumb. Nice capture of motion on the lemon drops.</td>', 'Hopefully you had no cuts or scratches on your hands (ouch). Too bright on the thumb. Nice capture of motion on the lemon drops.', '2003-02-23 23:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(221960, 12651, 3419, '<td valign="top">The glass almost disappears against the background. However, this is a very nicely composed and executed photo.</td>', 'The glass almost disappears against the background. However, this is a very nicely composed and executed photo.', '2003-02-23 23:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(221963, 12555, 3419, '<td valign="top">A very startling photo, and one that is nicely composed. However, to make this really awesome, it must be more crisply focussed.</td>', 'A very startling photo, and one that is nicely composed. However, to make this really awesome, it must be more crisply focussed.', '2003-02-23 23:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(221964, 12698, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Lighting could be a bit brighter to bring out more detail.</td>', 'Nice composition. Lighting could be a bit brighter to bring out more detail.', '2003-02-23 23:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(221965, 12410, 3419, '<td valign="top">Composition is interesting, but lighting renders the colors as dull.</td>', 'Composition is interesting, but lighting renders the colors as dull.', '2003-02-23 23:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(221968, 12739, 4210, '<td valign="top">Should have cropped that reflection at the bottom out. IMHO.</td>', 'Should have cropped that reflection at the bottom out. IMHO.', '2003-02-23 23:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(221971, 12632, 1847, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot.  Particularly, the tree breaking up continuity of the wall.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot.  Particularly, the tree breaking up continuity of the wall.', '2003-02-23 23:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(221972, 12677, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of color and detail on this leaf.</td>', 'Nice capture of color and detail on this leaf.', '2003-02-23 23:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(221973, 12452, 3419, '<td valign="top">The background behind the roses is distracting. Nice capture of detail on the yellow rose.</td>', 'The background behind the roses is distracting. Nice capture of detail on the yellow rose.', '2003-02-23 23:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(221974, 12370, 4210, '<td valign="top">Composition needs work. I would have used just the air vents.</td>', 'Composition needs work. I would have used just the air vents.', '2003-02-23 23:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(221975, 12319, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured. Good color, and nice texture on the petals and in the center.</td>', 'Beautifully captured. Good color, and nice texture on the petals and in the center.', '2003-02-23 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(221976, 12739, 1847, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty shot.  It might have been neat to capture more of that water that is reflecting that gorgeous sky.</td>', 'This is a pretty shot.  It might have been neat to capture more of that water that is reflecting that gorgeous sky.', '2003-02-23 23:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(221977, 12491, 5793, '<td valign="top">Great job...this is truly incredible...I wish I had one of your whitty little critiques to nit pick with but I don''t...congratulations...</td>', 'Great job...this is truly incredible...I wish I had one of your whitty little critiques to nit pick with but I don''t...congratulations...', '2003-02-24 00:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(221978, 12491, 1863, '<td valign="top">Congrats Indy, well deserved :)</td>', 'Congrats Indy, well deserved :)', '2003-02-24 00:03:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(221980, 12609, 1280, '<td valign="top">Ughhhhhhh I can''t believe I spelled this wrong.  It was a typo.  Blushing.........................</td>', 'Ughhhhhhh I can''t believe I spelled this wrong.  It was a typo.  Blushing.........................', '2003-02-24 00:05:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(221994, 12712, 1686, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best this week. It should have been rated much higher it was one of my two top choices this week</td>', 'This is one of the best this week. It should have been rated much higher it was one of my two top choices this week', '2003-02-24 00:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(221995, 12491, 472, '<td valign="top">congratulations :)  a nicely done flower.</td>', 'congratulations :)  a nicely done flower.', '2003-02-24 00:12:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(222061, 12414, 806, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! Well deserved!</td>', 'Excellent shot! Well deserved!', '2003-02-24 00:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(222063, 12491, 806, '<td valign="top">congrats indi!!! nice job!</td>', 'congrats indi!!! nice job!', '2003-02-24 00:32:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(222066, 12515, 806, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome! I said it before, and I will say it again.. I love this shot! I can''t believe it was an "accident"!! Good for you!<br/></td>', 'This is just awesome! I said it before, and I will say it again.. I love this shot! I can''t believe it was an "accident"!! Good for you!', '2003-02-24 00:34:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(222098, 12427, 714, '<td valign="top">Yahooo!!!  You got 4th!  Good job, Karma.  Keep it up girlfriend!</td>', 'Yahooo!!!  You got 4th!  Good job, Karma.  Keep it up girlfriend!', '2003-02-24 00:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(222130, 12491, 2079, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work Indi, Congratulations on another great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful work Indi, Congratulations on another great shot.', '2003-02-24 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(222139, 12627, 616, '<td valign="top">This should have placed higher.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-02-24 01:42:12.</i></td>', 'This should have placed higher.', '2003-02-24 01:33:44.000000', '2003-02-24 01:42:12.000000', 0),
(222147, 12414, 4494, '<td valign="top">I thought this one would win!  Great job!</td>', 'I thought this one would win!  Great job!', '2003-02-24 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(222158, 12414, 1829, '<td valign="top">HOOGIE - Oh wow.  A great macro shot.  Excellent and congrats on your ribbon mate.</td>', 'HOOGIE - Oh wow.  A great macro shot.  Excellent and congrats on your ribbon mate.', '2003-02-24 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(222205, 12491, 1829, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a beautiful image.  Excellent work - keep it up.  Looking forward to seeing more of your work.</td>', 'Congrats on a beautiful image.  Excellent work - keep it up.  Looking forward to seeing more of your work.', '2003-02-24 04:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(222216, 12379, 6752, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for you nice comments, the photo is more or less strait out of the cameram, i set the white ballance on the camera therefor the blue/purple background, that is normally totaly white. just a little noice reduction applyed.</td>', 'Thank you all for you nice comments, the photo is more or less strait out of the cameram, i set the white ballance on the camera therefor the blue/purple background, that is normally totaly white. just a little noice reduction applyed.', '2003-02-24 05:03:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(222236, 12414, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Hoogie. Must be the first time a ribbon has gone to New Zealand here. Choice!</td>', 'Congratulations Hoogie. Must be the first time a ribbon has gone to New Zealand here. Choice!', '2003-02-24 05:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(222238, 12491, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on second! Well deserved.</td>', 'Congratulations on second! Well deserved.', '2003-02-24 05:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(222285, 12364, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely done... certainly a lot better than my entry for the week!</td>', 'Nicely done... certainly a lot better than my entry for the week!', '2003-02-24 07:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(222308, 12515, 1037, '<td valign="top">Whoa, you outdid yourself! What an amazing photo. If I''d voted I would have given it a 10. <br/> <br/>I''ll never be first on our camera''s page now... ah well :).</td>', 'Whoa, you outdid yourself! What an amazing photo. If I''d voted I would have given it a 10.  I''ll never be first on our camera''s page now... ah well :).', '2003-02-24 08:25:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(222310, 12491, 2170, '<td valign="top">Yay Indi!!!  One of only 2 exceptions to my self-imposed "every flower photo in this challenge gets a 4" rule.<br/> <br/>Beautifully done!<br/> <br/>Rob</td>', 'Yay Indi!!!  One of only 2 exceptions to my self-imposed "every flower photo in this challenge gets a 4" rule. Beautifully done! Rob', '2003-02-24 08:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(222334, 12395, 6418, '<td valign="top">Yeah!!  I am so happy to be here!!  Thank you all so much for the kind comments!  It was taken in Hayama, Japan!  It is the best place to get nice snset near I live!  Could you see Mt. Fuji on the right?  Thanks again!</td>', 'Yeah!!  I am so happy to be here!!  Thank you all so much for the kind comments!  It was taken in Hayama, Japan!  It is the best place to get nice snset near I live!  Could you see Mt. Fuji on the right?  Thanks again!', '2003-02-24 09:04:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(222427, 12640, 3942, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot for the comments to all of you! <br/> <br/>Personally I didn''t expected a score above 5. According to my former experiences with abstract and miscolored shots I''m even surprised, that this one finished with a 4.8 because it''s not everybodys taste. After one week I''m not sure about the post processing on this shot myself too. According to the good comment of ChrisW123 I decided to put a different version on my private homepage. You can have a look under <a href="//www.200bar.de/nds/show_pic.php?id=101" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.200bar.de/nds/show_pic.php?id=101</a> if you are interested in. Personally I like this version a little more. Maybe this one could have done better on DPC because it doesn''t look so much as digital art. <br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-02-25 07:21:42.</i></td>', 'Thanks a lot for the comments to all of you!  Personally I didn''t expected a score above 5. According to my former experiences with abstract and miscolored shots I''m even surprised, that this one finished with a 4.8 because it''s not everybodys taste. After one week I''m not sure about the post processing on this shot myself too. According to the good comment of ChrisW123 I decided to put a different version on my private homepage. You can have a look under //www.200bar.de/nds/show_pic.php?id=101 if you are interested in. Personally I like this version a little more. Maybe this one could have done better on DPC because it doesn''t look so much as digital art.  ', '2003-02-24 10:46:48.000000', '2003-02-25 07:21:42.000000', 0),
(222429, 12441, 656, '<td valign="top">Maybe try a vertical/ portrait framing?</td>', 'Maybe try a vertical/ portrait framing?', '2003-02-24 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(222452, 12750, 5268, '<td valign="top">The hibiscus flower only lasts one day. The darker colors around the edges of this, as well as the bright yellow toward the center, are natural. To the uninitiated the flower appears to be old, or artificial, but it isn''t. The lighting is natural.</td>', 'The hibiscus flower only lasts one day. The darker colors around the edges of this, as well as the bright yellow toward the center, are natural. To the uninitiated the flower appears to be old, or artificial, but it isn''t. The lighting is natural.', '2003-02-24 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(222462, 12491, 2667, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot indigo. The lighting is very nicely done and the composition is clasically wonderful. Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful shot indigo. The lighting is very nicely done and the composition is clasically wonderful. Congrats!', '2003-02-24 11:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(222477, 12414, 2667, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a fine win. Well done!</td>', 'Congratulations on a fine win. Well done!', '2003-02-24 11:15:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(222485, 12491, 3018, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  The leaf improves your composition.  Lighting is great.  Can you elaborate on how you lighted the picture?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations!  The leaf improves your composition.  Lighting is great.  Can you elaborate on how you lighted the picture? ', '2003-02-24 11:18:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(222506, 12761, 3018, '<td valign="top">I just love the lighting on the flower.  Can you elaborate on how you did your lighting?<br/> <br/></td>', 'I just love the lighting on the flower.  Can you elaborate on how you did your lighting? ', '2003-02-24 11:25:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(222514, 12645, 3018, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that you did not score higher.  From the comments, I guess that people didn''t get it.  <br/> <br/>BTW, I feel flattered that someone would parody a picture of mine.  Hehe! You did great!<br/> <br/></td>', 'It''s a shame that you did not score higher.  From the comments, I guess that people didn''t get it.   BTW, I feel flattered that someone would parody a picture of mine.  Hehe! You did great! ', '2003-02-24 11:29:34.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(222521, 12587, 6505, '<td valign="top">Actually, this is a weed!  The exotic weed - wild radish.  Sorry to any botanist out there.</td>', 'Actually, this is a weed!  The exotic weed - wild radish.  Sorry to any botanist out there.', '2003-02-24 11:36:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(222547, 12701, 5266, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments - I know it was a bit soft in focus, but I came down with the flu and had taken this shot early in the week and I did want to participate.<br/> <br/>With regards to the comment about the "Sparkle of Life" missing .... he just woke up - usually is moving at about 100 miles an hour and I can''t get a photo at all.  So he was a bit drowsy from his nap, hence the missing sparkle.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments - I know it was a bit soft in focus, but I came down with the flu and had taken this shot early in the week and I did want to participate. With regards to the comment about the "Sparkle of Life" missing .... he just woke up - usually is moving at about 100 miles an hour and I can''t get a photo at all.  So he was a bit drowsy from his nap, hence the missing sparkle.', '2003-02-24 11:48:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(222596, 12414, 3260, '<td valign="top">what settings did you shoot this with? congrats.</td>', 'what settings did you shoot this with? congrats.', '2003-02-24 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(222597, 12715, 3260, '<td valign="top">imo, you deserved a higher ranking.</td>', 'imo, you deserved a higher ranking.', '2003-02-24 12:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(222605, 12414, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work! Congratulations! I commented before, but I still love the various textures and sharpness of the image.</td>', 'Nice work! Congratulations! I commented before, but I still love the various textures and sharpness of the image.', '2003-02-24 13:03:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(222612, 12580, 6870, '<td valign="top">This was in my top three. Not only was it yellow?unless I''m colorblind (which I am!)?it says something to me. Unlike the three winners, whose photos are good, this one said something beyond yellow. I still say bravo!</td>', 'This was in my top three. Not only was it yellow?unless I''m colorblind (which I am!)?it says something to me. Unlike the three winners, whose photos are good, this one said something beyond yellow. I still say bravo!', '2003-02-24 13:14:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(222616, 12561, 6870, '<td valign="top">Maybe some didn''t feel it was yellow enough, but I still think that it is well composed. The yellow wall gives the image both structure and depth, and I love the contrasting darks with the blurry shadow and sharp window. I say yay!</td>', 'Maybe some didn''t feel it was yellow enough, but I still think that it is well composed. The yellow wall gives the image both structure and depth, and I love the contrasting darks with the blurry shadow and sharp window. I say yay!', '2003-02-24 13:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(222619, 12719, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really thought this photo would win! You should feel great about it anyway. It''s a masterpiece, and it says yellow, but so much more.  I''m really stunned that it''s not in the top 10. Maybe I''m missing something.... Great work. I aspire to such photos.</td>', 'I really thought this photo would win! You should feel great about it anyway. It''s a masterpiece, and it says yellow, but so much more.  I''m really stunned that it''s not in the top 10. Maybe I''m missing something.... Great work. I aspire to such photos.', '2003-02-24 13:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(222622, 12413, 6870, '<td valign="top">Once again, the fact there there is little yellow makes this photo so appropriate for the Yellow theme, because it attracts the eye so magnificenty. I thought this photo would do better. One of my favorites. Great work again.</td>', 'Once again, the fact there there is little yellow makes this photo so appropriate for the Yellow theme, because it attracts the eye so magnificenty. I thought this photo would do better. One of my favorites. Great work again.', '2003-02-24 13:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(222627, 12733, 6870, '<td valign="top">It just goes to show how colorblind I am. Sure looked yellow to me, and the light! Wow! The Light!</td>', 'It just goes to show how colorblind I am. Sure looked yellow to me, and the light! Wow! The Light!', '2003-02-24 13:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(222631, 12733, 1808, '<td valign="top">I guess I was a bit colorblind on this one.<br/> <br/>I didn''t adjust the color balance at all, just the intensity. Turning it more yellow would have certainly helped in the challenge.<br/> <br/>The white dot is a star. The dark thing to the bottom left is a house top. It was taken at night after a snowstorm and as the clouds were breaking up.<br/></td>', 'I guess I was a bit colorblind on this one. I didn''t adjust the color balance at all, just the intensity. Turning it more yellow would have certainly helped in the challenge. The white dot is a star. The dark thing to the bottom left is a house top. It was taken at night after a snowstorm and as the clouds were breaking up.', '2003-02-24 13:29:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(223054, 12655, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. if anybody would care to be honest or mean or "pick your descriptor" and tell me.  What is really really bad about this photo?  <br/> <br/>No distracting background; it meets the challenge; focus isn''t horrible; lighting isn''t great, but it''s not horrible;  it''s a flower, but not a boring, uninteresting one  -  pick another issue.<br/> <br/>H   E   L  P   !  !  !  !</td>', 'O.K. if anybody would care to be honest or mean or "pick your descriptor" and tell me.  What is really really bad about this photo?   No distracting background; it meets the challenge; focus isn''t horrible; lighting isn''t great, but it''s not horrible;  it''s a flower, but not a boring, uninteresting one  -  pick another issue. H   E   L  P   !  !  !  !', '2003-02-24 16:43:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(223180, 12732, 6532, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all the comments.</td>', 'Thanks to all the comments.', '2003-02-24 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(223276, 12363, 1647, '<td valign="top">Sorry about the tough introduction to dpchallenge.  As you can see, meeting the criteria well is important to a lot of people.  Perhaps you could have recoloured the table yellow using photoshop.  The image still has some focus issues though - partly because of low light.<br/> <br/>If the coin was rotating as you mentioned then perhaps a really slow shutter speed could have showed the rotation.  I''m not sure if your camera is good at Macro, but with 3MP resolution you could have cropped the coin to make it larger, rather than resize the image down.<br/> <br/>Good luck for your next entry.</td>', 'Sorry about the tough introduction to dpchallenge.  As you can see, meeting the criteria well is important to a lot of people.  Perhaps you could have recoloured the table yellow using photoshop.  The image still has some focus issues though - partly because of low light. If the coin was rotating as you mentioned then perhaps a really slow shutter speed could have showed the rotation.  I''m not sure if your camera is good at Macro, but with 3MP resolution you could have cropped the coin to make it larger, rather than resize the image down. Good luck for your next entry.', '2003-02-24 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(223305, 12410, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I didn''t get to vote on your image during the challenge.  I think your biggest problem was a lack of light.  If the image had been bright and smooth then it would have scored much better.  There were a lot of angles and lines to add interest to the photo.<br/> <br/>If practical I would suggest going back and retaking the photo.  Perhaps bounce light off the roof if you want to avoid reflections, but give it plenty of light.  One other option might be to try and salvage the photo somewhat using "denoise" or some of the special ISO filters in photoshop.</td>', 'Unfortunately I didn''t get to vote on your image during the challenge.  I think your biggest problem was a lack of light.  If the image had been bright and smooth then it would have scored much better.  There were a lot of angles and lines to add interest to the photo. If practical I would suggest going back and retaking the photo.  Perhaps bounce light off the roof if you want to avoid reflections, but give it plenty of light.  One other option might be to try and salvage the photo somewhat using "denoise" or some of the special ISO filters in photoshop.', '2003-02-24 19:25:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(223326, 12563, 1647, '<td valign="top">Hi.  I didn''t get to your image during voting, but thought I would comment now.  As other people have said one of the problems with this image is that it''s washed out.  The black isn''t very black and the white isn''t very white.  Your Westward Bound has slightly better contrast.<br/> <br/>Have you looked at "histograms" or "levels" in your photo editing tool, or even simply "brightness/contrast"?  Also have a look at the tutorials section on this site for some helpers.</td>', 'Hi.  I didn''t get to your image during voting, but thought I would comment now.  As other people have said one of the problems with this image is that it''s washed out.  The black isn''t very black and the white isn''t very white.  Your Westward Bound has slightly better contrast. Have you looked at "histograms" or "levels" in your photo editing tool, or even simply "brightness/contrast"?  Also have a look at the tutorials section on this site for some helpers.', '2003-02-24 19:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(223330, 12433, 1647, '<td valign="top">The eyes are stunning.  It looks like the camera may have focused on the waterdrops rather than the cat.  Are you able to manually override the focus on your camera?<br/> <br/></td>', 'The eyes are stunning.  It looks like the camera may have focused on the waterdrops rather than the cat.  Are you able to manually override the focus on your camera? ', '2003-02-24 19:33:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(223338, 12707, 1647, '<td valign="top">Looks like you suffered for not having yellow in the photo.  As others suggested, perhaps if you just stuck the cord into the banana, instead of wrapping it in foil, would have helped...  Even if it was still in black and white.<br/> <br/>It looks like "brown spots" would have scored better than "foil".</td>', 'Looks like you suffered for not having yellow in the photo.  As others suggested, perhaps if you just stuck the cord into the banana, instead of wrapping it in foil, would have helped...  Even if it was still in black and white. It looks like "brown spots" would have scored better than "foil".', '2003-02-24 19:38:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(223353, 12695, 1647, '<td valign="top">Becky,<br/> <br/>I''m surprised this image scored so low in the challenge.  Looking at your camera you''ve done very well for a .3MP camera...  Although no-one knows this during voting unfortunately.<br/> <br/>Personally I thought it was fairly yellow...  Perhaps you could have fiddled in photoshop (or similar) to increase the amount of yellow.<br/> <br/>Finally, did you take this shop from a tripod or handheld?  If you say handheld then you did really well to get it this sharp even - I tried fireworks once and made a terrible mess than to the long exposure and camera shake.<br/> <br/>Good luck for your next entry.</td>', 'Becky, I''m surprised this image scored so low in the challenge.  Looking at your camera you''ve done very well for a .3MP camera...  Although no-one knows this during voting unfortunately. Personally I thought it was fairly yellow...  Perhaps you could have fiddled in photoshop (or similar) to increase the amount of yellow. Finally, did you take this shop from a tripod or handheld?  If you say handheld then you did really well to get it this sharp even - I tried fireworks once and made a terrible mess than to the long exposure and camera shake. Good luck for your next entry.', '2003-02-24 19:43:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(223360, 12732, 1647, '<td valign="top">Hi.  I tend to agree with the others...  The photo is nice but since the challenge is Yellow I would have been a lot closer to the duck, with a lot less surrounding it.  Ignoring the challenge the photo has a nice range of colours and objects in it.<br/> <br/>Good luck for your next entry.</td>', 'Hi.  I tend to agree with the others...  The photo is nice but since the challenge is Yellow I would have been a lot closer to the duck, with a lot less surrounding it.  Ignoring the challenge the photo has a nice range of colours and objects in it. Good luck for your next entry.', '2003-02-24 19:46:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(223529, 12655, 2752, '<td valign="top">Hi Swash...I gave you a 5...composition is great,the background gives the subject a dramatic impact.  My concern was with the thick greenish stems(?)in the upper right and lower right corners..I would have cropped them off. Sorry it didn''t do well.  Mine didn''t either.</td>', 'Hi Swash...I gave you a 5...composition is great,the background gives the subject a dramatic impact.  My concern was with the thick greenish stems(?)in the upper right and lower right corners..I would have cropped them off. Sorry it didn''t do well.  Mine didn''t either.', '2003-02-24 21:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
