(234227, 12657, 6855, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB<br/> <br/>Challenge:  Definitely met the challenge! About as yellow as you can get!<br/> <br/>Technique:  The water would have been a great effect if you had focused some light on it.  The drops will become much more pronounced with better lighting.  I also think you would have had better results on a dark background, with the pepper off-centered.<br/> <br/>Overall:  A great shot that just needs some minor cleaning up.</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB Challenge:  Definitely met the challenge! About as yellow as you can get! Technique:  The water would have been a great effect if you had focused some light on it.  The drops will become much more pronounced with better lighting.  I also think you would have had better results on a dark background, with the pepper off-centered. Overall:  A great shot that just needs some minor cleaning up.', '2003-03-10 20:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
